&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Insight Enterprises, Inc. is a Fortune 500 Solutions Integrator helping organizations accelerate transformation by unlocking the power of people and technology. We architect, build and manage solutions for complex IT environments to deliver outcomes that contribute to our clients&#39; success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our portfolio of digital transformation services includes deep expertise in cloud, data, AI, cybersecurity and intelligent edge. These services, augmented by Insight&#39;s longstanding relationships with 6,000+ technology partners across the globe, enable us to deliver the right technical solutions quickly and effectively. We&#39;re rated as a Great Place to Work, a Forbes Best Employer for Diversity and a Forbes World&#39;s Top Female-Friendly Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Senior Revenue Operations Manager&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; £62,000 - £80,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Bristol HQ - Hybrid Model (3 days p/w on site)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting into:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Chief Growth Officer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Insight is a global solutions integrator, helping organisations unlock greater value from people, technology and innovation. Insight AI is the specialist AI brand that transforms ideas into measurable business impact through practical, scalable AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Revenue Operations Manager, you will play a crucial role in optimising and aligning the processes, technology, and teams across the revenue-generating functions of Insight AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for driving efficiency, scalability, and effectiveness in sales, marketing, and client services operations. This role involves managing the team of Salesforce Administrators and Developers as well as collaborating with various departments to enhance revenue-generating strategies and ensure the seamless integration of systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Accountabilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build rapport, alignment, and operational advocacy among senior management and the executive team;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate, design, and implement the processes, programs, and systems to support Insight AI’s revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team management of the Salesforce Administrators and Salesforce Developers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and develop sales operations staff and our marketing team&#39;s into a highly effective machine with deep system expertise;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the training of new and current sales and marketing employees on relevant systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage collection and evaluation of sales &amp;amp; marketing data to improve effectiveness of team and campaigns;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the Marketing Operations function to ensure the seamless transition of MQLs from Marketo, to Salesforce, and reporting back up through Databricks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with our Business Intelligence team to take our analysis to the next level, as well as automate reporting;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead roll out of major sales changes such as new pricing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administrate, monitor adoption, and the ROI of our Sales Tech Stack and make relevant recommendations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve sales and marketing productivity by simplifying processes and evaluating new tools, enabling our team to work smarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engineer processes across CRM and integrations into various other pieces of the tech stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not afraid of being hands on in the CRM, building flows, and automations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in revenue operations, sales operations, or a related role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Salesforce CRM systems, marketing automation tools, and sales processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritise and thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing and engineering ETL pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HTML, CSS, Javascript, SOQL, SQL experience would be ideal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Private medical cover&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🐾 Dog‑friendly Bristol office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍻 In office bar &amp;amp; monthly socials&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚴 Cycle‑to‑work,⚡electric car scheme,🏋️ gym discounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧘 Health &amp;amp; wellbeing apps&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰Discounts for high street brands&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💙 Social &amp;amp; charitable events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;To see more roles, &lt;a href=&quot;https://amdaris.com/jobs&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Insight Enterprises, Inc. is a Fortune 500 Solutions Integrator helping organizations accelerate transformation by unlocking the power of people and technology. We architect, build and manage solutions for complex IT environments to deliver outcomes that contribute to our clients&#39; success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our portfolio of digital transformation services includes deep expertise in cloud, data, AI, cybersecurity and intelligent edge. These services, augmented by Insight&#39;s longstanding relationships with 6,000+ technology partners across the globe, enable us to deliver the right technical solutions quickly and effectively. We&#39;re rated as a Great Place to Work, a Forbes Best Employer for Diversity and a Forbes World&#39;s Top Female-Friendly Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal AI Product Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Insight AI is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Principal Consultant – AI Products &amp;amp; Adoption&lt;/strong&gt; to help clients unlock measurable value from AI. This is a strategic, client-facing leadership role focused on identifying AI opportunities, rapidly validating ideas through prototypes, and driving successful adoption at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work directly with business leaders to shape AI strategies, build compelling business cases, and lead the delivery of AI-powered products and workflows. Equally comfortable in the boardroom and working alongside technical teams, you will help organisations move from AI experimentation to real business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A key part of the role will be supporting clients in adopting emerging technologies such as Generative AI, Anthropic Claude and agentic AI solutions, while helping to build innovative AI products that improve business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior stakeholders to identify high-value AI opportunities and define AI strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery workshops and rapid prototyping engagements to demonstrate ROI and accelerate decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and oversee the delivery of AI-powered products, workflows and automation solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the implementation of Generative AI and agentic AI capabilities, including Anthropic Claude-based solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive AI adoption through change management, stakeholder engagement and value measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor on AI best practice, governance and organisational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor consultants, product teams and client stakeholders in AI product development and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pre-sales activity, proposal development and growth of Insight AI’s consulting capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering AI products, AI transformation programmes or AI consulting engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Generative AI, LLMs and agentic AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking products from concept and prototype through to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly understand business challenges and translate them into practical AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen with experience demonstrating ROI and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills with experience engaging executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mentor who enjoys developing people and building capability within teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable across industries and comfortable working in fast-paced consulting environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Insight AI?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to shape how organisations adopt AI, working at the intersection of strategy, product innovation and emerging technology. You&#39;ll help clients realise tangible business value while playing a key role in growing Insight AI’s reputation as a leader in AI consultancy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6% Matched pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual salary reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday + bank holidays + 5 day buy/sell/carry over scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Health Insurance through Vitality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eye care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electric car and cycle to work schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 month work from EMEA policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear growth and progression plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High street brand &amp;amp; gym discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;To see more roles, &lt;a href=&quot;https://amdaris.com/jobs&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Insight Enterprises, Inc. is a Fortune 500 Solutions Integrator helping organizations accelerate transformation by unlocking the power of people and technology. We architect, build and manage solutions for complex IT environments to deliver outcomes that contribute to our clients&#39; success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our portfolio of digital transformation services includes deep expertise in cloud, data, AI, cybersecurity and intelligent edge. These services, augmented by Insight&#39;s longstanding relationships with 6,000+ technology partners across the globe, enable us to deliver the right technical solutions quickly and effectively. We&#39;re rated as a Great Place to Work, a Forbes Best Employer for Diversity and a Forbes World&#39;s Top Female-Friendly Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt; Forward Deployed AI Engineer&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bristol HQ – Hybrid Model &amp;amp; Travel across EMEA region&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; DOE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced AI Forward Deployed Engineer to lead the design, delivery and scaling of high-impact AI solutions for strategic customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior, hands-on technical role for someone who thrives at the intersection of software engineering, applied AI and customer problem-solving. You will turn complex and often ambiguous business challenges into secure, scalable and commercially viable AI solutions, taking ownership from early discovery and rapid prototyping through to production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work directly with partners and customers as a senior technical contributor, working alongside Solution Architects and multidisciplinary teams to make pragmatic technical decisions and solve difficult implementation problems. This is an individual-contributor technical leadership role, with significant influence but no formal line-management responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical delivery of complex AI engagements, owning implementation, deployment approach, technical risk and engineering priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with customers and senior stakeholders to translate ambiguous business challenges into practical AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly prototype, test and iterate AI solutions with customers to validate assumptions, feasibility and value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and deploy production-grade generative AI, agentic and other applied AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain hands-on throughout delivery, contributing code, integrations, evaluations and technical implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside Solution Architects to translate customer requirements and constraints into appropriate solution designs and implementation approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate AI capabilities with enterprise systems, data, APIs, workflows and security models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish appropriate approaches for AI evaluation, observability, guardrails, human oversight and operational monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and resolve complex technical problems encountered when deploying AI into customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct design and code reviews while mentoring engineers and improving technical capability across the practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Solutions Engineering, Product, Research, Architecture and Customer Success to align strategy and resolve delivery dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable frameworks, accelerators, playbooks and solution patterns from customer delivery experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions meet appropriate security, privacy, legal, responsible AI, governance and enterprise risk requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain complex AI and engineering concepts clearly to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute customer insight and implementation learning to Insight’s AI services, capabilities and go-to-market approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience delivering software, AI, machine learning or applied AI solutions within complex, customer-facing enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering capability using languages such as Python or TypeScript/JavaScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building solutions using modern foundation models, LLM APIs and associated AI platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with generative AI patterns including RAG, tool/function calling, structured outputs and agentic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing evaluation approaches covering AI quality, reliability, safety and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating AI solutions with enterprise data, APIs, applications and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying and operating AI solutions using platforms such as Azure or AWS, or within customer-controlled environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of AI application architecture, orchestration, model selection, context management, observability and LLM operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of production engineering practices, solution architecture, security, testing and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate effectively where requirements are incomplete or ambiguous, using experimentation and iterative delivery to converge on solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working directly with senior customer stakeholders while maintaining strong technical credibility with engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial awareness and judgement to balance customer value, technical risk, delivery speed and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating reusable technical frameworks, components, standards or delivery patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Data Science, AI or a related discipline, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to continuous learning, responsible AI and staying current with developments in AI technology, governance and market expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will turn difficult customer problems into secure, scalable and high-quality AI solutions that create demonstrable value in production. Your work will reduce delivery risk and turn customer implementation learning into reusable capabilities that can be applied across customers, industries and geographies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success will also be reflected in production adoption, strong technical stakeholder feedback, repeat or expanded customer engagements, improved engineering capability and the consistent adoption of reusable frameworks and delivery playbooks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6% Matched pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual salary reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday + bank holidays + 5 day buy/sell/carry over scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Health Insurance through Vitality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eye care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electric car and cycle to work schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 month work from EMEA policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear growth and progression plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High street brand &amp;amp; gym discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;To see more roles, &lt;a href=&quot;https://amdaris.com/jobs&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Our mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re making Africa the first cashless continent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2017, over half the population in Sub-Saharan Africa had no bank account. That&#39;s for good reason—the fees are too high, the closest branch can be miles away, and nobody takes cards. Without access to financial institutions, people are forced to keep their savings under the mattress. Small business owners rely on lenders who charge extortionate rates. Parents spend hours waiting in line to pay school fees in cash.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re solving this by building financial services that just work: no account fees, instantly available, and accepted everywhere. In places where electricity, water and roads don&#39;t always work, you can still send money with Wave. In 2017, we launched a mobile app in Senegal for cash deposit, withdrawal, and peer-to-peer and business payments. Now, we have millions of users across 9 countries and are growing fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to make Africa the first cashless continent and that&#39;s where you come in...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;How you&#39;ll help us achieve it&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced security engineer who’s independent, excited about getting things done, and ready to hit the ground running. You&#39;ll primarily be responsible for our application security, working with our product teams to work on new systems to enhance our security posture. Our customers trust us with their money, and you’ll be at the forefront of making sure we retain that trust!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This broadly scoped role will allow you to get your hands on many different types of security projects, from direct application security to helping our infrastructure team think about security for our databases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we integrate AI-powered agents into our engineering and operations workflows, you&#39;ll help define and enforce the guardrails around how we use them safely. This includes securing agentic tooling against prompt injection, excessive permissions, and data exfiltration — and building the policies and technical controls to govern AI usage across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some experience with common industry certifications like ISO-27001 and PCI-DSS would be beneficial, although you won’t be expected to run or oversee audits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our to-do list changes constantly, but here are some recent projects:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design our agentic SIEM/SecOps pipelines to evaluate and tune AI-driven triage, alerting, and response automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure our MCP integrations against prompt injection, tool misuse, and credential exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tune and maintain code security review agents tailored to Wave&#39;s codebase, threat model, and regulatory environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop internal AI governance standards covering acceptable use, data handling, and audit requirements for LLM-powered tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Centralise application-level login and permissions enforcement including privileged access management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Rework our approach to secrets management with ephemeral secrets and tighter access scopes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security review of our public-facing APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work remotely from anywhere (between UTC -5 and +4) with reliable internet access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wave covers travel once per year to one of our operating countries in Africa, as well as a yearly stipend of $1200 to meet with coworkers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our salaries are competitive and are calculated using a transparent formula. For this role, depending on your level of experience, we offer a salary of up to $185,800 USD (or local equivalent), plus a generous equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We run performance reviews twice a year and award bonuses or promotions to strong performers who have been with the company for more than six months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Major benefits:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidized health insurance for you and your dependents and retirement contributions (both vary from country-to-country).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months fully paid parental leave and subsidized fertility assistance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible vacation, with most folks taking between 30-40 days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$10,000 annual charitable donation matching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Yearly travel to one of our African operating countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 7-8 years of professional experience with a minimum of 3-5 years of it spent in a security-related role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Experience with Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You might be a good fit if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are excited about finding the right balance between security and velocity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have opinions on how to secure agentic AI systems and want to put them into practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy helping other engineers understand and implement secure patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are not afraid to take on complicated systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are excited to work on lots of different security-related work, from audits to code refactors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work to make things easier for the next engineer who will touch your code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Always try to improve as a programmer and colleague.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are interested in building governance frameworks for AI usage in a regulated financial services environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experimented with LLM-based security tooling and understand both the promise and the failure modes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push through hard problems without giving up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience remediating non-conformities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are interested in security-focused source code review and penetration testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an interest in growing and mentoring a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Engineering at Wave&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll report to the Security Team Lead and work closely with the CISO, as part of a small 4 person security team, likely rotating with many of our Product and Platform teams, depending on the project you’re working on. Each team is led by a product manager and mentored by a technical lead on the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be responsible for your own security projects as well as supporting the engineering organisation on security through advice and design review. We organize things to give you as much ownership as possible, so you&#39;ll typically be in charge of your projects from planning to delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our stack (you only need prior experience with python and cloud technologies, if you need to work with anything else, we’ll train you):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;backend: Python 3 (+ mypy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API layer: GraphQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android frontend: Kotlin/Jetpack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;iOS frontend: Swift/SwiftUI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;web frontend: TypeScript/React&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;database: Postgres&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;infrastructure: GCP / Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;orchestration: Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Our team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We have a rapidly growing in-country team in Senegal, Côte d&#39;Ivoire, Mali, Burkina Faso, The Gambia, Uganda, Niger, Sierra Leone, and Cameroon plus remote team members spread across the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re deeply passionate about our mission of bringing radically affordable financial services to the people who need them most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We foster autonomy for our employees. You&#39;ll own your projects at every stage, from understanding the problem to monitoring your solution in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We raised the largest Series A in Africa in 2021. Our world-class investors, include Founders Fund, Sequoia Heritage, Stripe, Ribbit Capital, Y Combinator, and Partech Africa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are on&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.ycombinator.com/topcompanies/revenue&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.ycombinator.com/topcompanies/revenue&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Y Combinator&#39;s top companies by revenue&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How to apply&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fill out the form below, and upload a resume in English and a&amp;nbsp;cover letter describing your interest in Wave and the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We review applications frequently and recommend that you apply to the role that most closely aligns with your skills, experience and career goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wave is an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Eon, we’re transforming cloud backups into useful assets for the first time ever. Backed by prominent investors and industry leaders, our groundbreaking Cloud Backup Posture Management (CBPM) platform offers instant visibility and access across all cloud environments, turning every backup into a searchable, accessible tool. We’re an ambitious, collaborative team driven to redefine what’s possible in cloud technology. Join us, and see how your contributions can directly shape the future of backup.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a motivated, results-driven &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; based in the UK to join our growing team. In this role, you’ll be responsible for building sales from the ground up, developing relationships with the companies we work with, finding new business opportunities, and delivering top-notch service. The ideal candidate has solid experience in the backup industry, a strong background in enterprise sales, and a history of working with products that make a real difference for businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a &lt;strong&gt;sales strategy&lt;/strong&gt; to drive new business from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet and exceed&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;sales targets&lt;/strong&gt; and KPIs consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negotiate contracts&lt;/strong&gt; and close deals to maximize profits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the sales team to identify new opportunities within your territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;key decision-makers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the entire sales cycle, from prospecting to closing deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular feedback on sales performance and market trends to senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely and successful delivery of our products based on client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;8+ years of sales experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including at least 4 years in enterprise sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in &lt;strong&gt;prospecting&lt;/strong&gt; and identifying new leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing deals, particularly in &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise SaaS&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at building trust and long-term partnerships with diverse stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re passionate about acquiring new business and exceeding sales targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong experience negotiating &lt;strong&gt;complex deals&lt;/strong&gt; with a focus on win-win outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a passionate and innovative team driving change in the cloud backup space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for professional growth in a fast-paced startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Wolt AdTech &amp;amp; Promotions team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is best suited for someone who is strongly backend-oriented, thrives in ambiguity, and can take ownership of large, cross-functional initiatives from planning to delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You might be a great fit if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a strong backend engineer, ideally with &lt;strong&gt;Golang&lt;/strong&gt; experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience building and operating scalable backend systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working in &lt;strong&gt;high-ambiguity environments&lt;/strong&gt; and bringing structure where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can independently lead large initiatives across team boundaries, from problem definition and planning to stakeholder alignment and on-time delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and effectively, and know how to gather, process, and act on feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can build strong working relationships with stakeholders and keep multiple parties aligned around shared goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;AI-assisted engineering workflows&lt;/strong&gt;, including tools like &lt;strong&gt;Codex, Claude, and agent-based development approaches&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring experience with &lt;strong&gt;NoSQL databases&lt;/strong&gt; such as Cassandra, MongoDB, or similar technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong preference for &lt;strong&gt;Golang&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to take ownership of complex, cross-team projects in ambiguous environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management, planning, and delivery skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and alignment-building skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with &lt;strong&gt;AI-assisted development&lt;/strong&gt;, including tools such as Codex, Claude, and agentic workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;NoSQL databases&lt;/strong&gt; such as Cassandra, MongoDB, or similar is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We love going to work and think you should too. Our team is dedicated to trust, customer obsession, agility, and striving to be better everyday. These values serve as the foundation of our culture, guiding our actions and driving us towards excellence. We foster a culture of performance and recognition, allowing us to transform growth as we enable our employees to do the best work of their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is located in London, England. &lt;/strong&gt;Our office is situated in a core location near Waterloo and Blackfriars on the Southbank. Across the globe, our Centers of Energy serve as hubs where we accelerate productivity and collaboration, inspire creativity, and cultivate a culture of connection and celebration. Our teams coordinate their time in Centers of Energy to reflect how they work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about life at LogicMonitor, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.logicmonitor.com/careers&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LogicMonitor® is the AI-first hybrid observability platform powering the next generation of digital infrastructure. LogicMonitor delivers complete visibility and actionable intelligence across on-premises, cloud, and edge environments. By anticipating issues before they strike, optimizing resources in real time, and enabling faster, smarter decisions, LogicMonitor helps IT and business leaders protect margins, accelerate innovation, and deliver exceptional digital experiences without compromise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our customers love LogicMonitor&#39;s ability to bring cloud and traditional IT together into one view, as seen in minimal churn rates, expansion business, and exciting new customer references. In fact, LogicMonitor has received the highest Net Promoter Score of any IT Infrastructure Management provider. LogicMonitor also boasts high employee satisfaction. We have been certified as a Great Place To Work®, and named one of BuiltIn&#39;s Best Places to Work for the seventh year in a row!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sr. Solutions Engineer is responsible for the successful delivery of LogicMonitor’s most advanced and complex technical solutions for our customers. The Sr. Solutions Engineer works as a member of the Professional Services team, interfacing directly with LogicMonitor customers while working closely with internal Customer Success Management, Tech Support and Training teams. As an experienced Solutions Engineer, duties for the Sr. Solutions Engineer are elevated to the most demanding projects with a focus on enterprise customers and internal projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this Senior Solution Engineer position, we are particularly interested in candidates with strong hands-on ServiceNow experience. The role will have a significant focus on delivering integrations between LogicMonitor and ServiceNow, including&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;ITSM and CMDB&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as supporting solutions where ServiceNow forms a key part of the customer’s operational workflow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-hasbody=&quot;true&quot; data-macro-name=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here&#39;s a closer look at this key role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are is seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Solutions Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to lead the delivery of our most advanced technical solutions. As a vital member of the Professional Services team, you’ll work directly with customers while collaborating closely with Customer Success Management, Tech Support, and Training teams. In this role, you&#39;ll tackle our most challenging projects, support enterprise customers with innovative solutions, and drive key internal initiatives to elevate our service excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;administering, configuring or developing within ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally including areas such as CMDB, ITSM, APIs/integrations, data mapping and workflow configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Complex Deployments&lt;/strong&gt;: Spearhead large-scale, intricate Professional Services engagements to ensure seamless execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Product Enhancements&lt;/strong&gt;: Identify product gaps, feature requests, and issues, and communicate these insights to Product and Development teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deploy Custom Integrations&lt;/strong&gt;: Implement tailored integrations using REST APIs to extend functionality within and beyond the LogicMonitor platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advocate Best Practices&lt;/strong&gt;: Share technical best practices and lessons learned with peers to elevate team performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay Informed&lt;/strong&gt;: Continuously monitor new product features, updates, and enhancements by leveraging internal resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate on Scoping&lt;/strong&gt;: Serve as a key sounding board for Solutions Architects during the scoping of complex customer engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plan Iteratively&lt;/strong&gt;: Prioritize and schedule deliverables using an iterative development approach to ensure agile execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Implement Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;: Create, document, code, and test technical solutions for new tools, automations, or system enhancements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Execution&lt;/strong&gt;: Implement solutions following agile software development methodologies for rapid, high-quality delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Centric Automation&lt;/strong&gt;: Translate customer requirements into automation products that support the growth of Professional Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Envision System Enhancements&lt;/strong&gt;: Analyze business requirements to conceptualize and new system features and functionalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Troubleshoot &amp;amp; Resolve&lt;/strong&gt;: Diagnose and resolve automation or application issues to maintain optimal performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor &amp;amp; Educate&lt;/strong&gt;: Guide team members on advanced scripting concepts, including Big O notation, multi-threading, cookie management, and data caching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science or a related field, or equivalent experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4+ years of software development experience in commercial or enterprise environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3+ years of hands-on development using Python, Go, Java, or JavaScript.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong grasp of programming concepts and effective debugging techniques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robust knowledge of modern web architectures, microservices, and APIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with AWS services and other cloud platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;IT certifications such as AWS Certified Solutions Architect, AWS Certified Developer, VMware VCP, CCNA, MCSA, or equivalent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with container and automation technologies: Docker, Ansible, Chef, Puppet, SaltStack, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of enterprise IT infrastructure platforms: Aruba, Cisco, Citrix, Dell, EMC, F5, HP, IBM, NetApp, Palo Alto, VMware, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with automation and scripting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of Lambda functions and application monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous experience in software development, consulting, or professional services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working knowledge of JavaScript and/or Ruby.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of server application administration: Apache, MySQL, RabbitMQ, Microsoft IIS, SQL Server, Exchange, Active Directory, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with cloud platforms and services like AWS and Microsoft Azure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
