&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Honest. We are real with ourselves and our clients and share our ideas with openness and transparency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Evolutionary. We innovate using our user’s ever-changing needs so our technology remains ahead-of-the-game.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fearless. We take the best path, not the easiest, and innovate where it’s right, not where it’s simplest.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Resilience. We don’t give up until we find the right solution, even if it means going outside our remit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Belong.&amp;nbsp; We create an environment where everyone feels like they belong and is empowered to do their best work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
