&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Solutions Architect- Pre-sales (UK)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a motivated AI Architect - Pre-sales to join our sales team, specializing in the AI security space. As an AI Architect- Pre-sales, you will be instrumental in driving the adoption of our innovative AI security solutions, working closely with our sales representatives and prospective clients to understand their security needs, demonstrate the capabilities of our products, and architect tailored solutions that address their unique requirements. Your technical expertise, combined with strong communication and interpersonal skills, will be essential in building and maintaining relationships with clients and effectively articulating the value proposition of our AI security offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HiddenLayer protects the world’s most valuable technologies from adversarial AI attacks. We were founded by AI professionals and security specialists with first-hand experience of how insidious adversarial AI attacks can be to detect and defend against. Determined to prove that these attacks were preventable, the team developed a unique, patent-pending, productized solution to support organizations in accelerating their adoption of AI securely.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our dedication to innovation has been recognized by prestigious awards such as RSA&#39;s Innovation Sandbox Winner, CB Insights AI 100, CyberTech 100, and SC&#39;s Most Promising Early-Stage Start-up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Consultation:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with the sales team to engage with clients and prospects, conducting technical discussions to understand their security challenges, objectives, and infrastructure requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Demonstrations: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct product demonstrations and presentations, showcasing the features, functionalities, and benefits of our AI security solutions to prospective clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect customized security solutions tailored to client needs, leveraging your understanding of cybersecurity principles, AI technologies, and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proof of Concept (PoC): &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the development and execution of proof of concept (PoC) projects, working closely with clients to validate the effectiveness and feasibility of our solutions in their environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide pre-sales and post-sales technical support to clients, addressing inquiries, troubleshooting issues, and ensuring a smooth deployment and integration process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training and Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct training sessions and workshops for clients and internal stakeholders, empowering them with the knowledge and skills to effectively utilize our AI security products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams including product management, engineering, and research, to provide feedback from the field and contribute to product enhancements and roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay informed about market trends, emerging technologies, and competitive landscape in the AI security space, continuously enhancing your knowledge and expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven experience in a pre-sales or post-sales solution architecture role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proficient with Linux (familiarity with GNU, Bash, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Moderate to advanced cloud experience (including hands-on experience with IaC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Python programming experience is necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI experience consisting of building advanced AI workflows with tools like LangChain, LangGraph, etc. and experience with MLOps tools/environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Not required but experience with container orchestration (e.g. Kubernetes) and CI/CD pipeline integration is helpful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proficiency in articulating technical concepts and value propositions to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience with conducting product demonstrations, proof of concepts (PoCs), and technical presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills, with the ability to build and maintain relationships with clients and internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Self-motivated with a passion for technology and a drive for continuous learning and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel as needed to client sites and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY HIDDENLAYER?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We just raised $100M in Series B funding led by Delta-v Capital, with backing from Morgan Stanley, Microsoft&#39;s venture arm, Booz Allen Hamilton, and others. It&#39;s a validation of what we&#39;ve built: 10x revenue growth, 50+ new enterprise customers, and deployments across defense, finance, and the world&#39;s largest AI platforms. This funding goes straight into expanding our platform and GTM capabilities, and into growing our team globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Attracting and retaining the very best people is our #1 priority. That’s why we offer our team best-in-class benefits, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fully Remote:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are a completely remote global team. Though we’re distributed, we are intentional about getting the team together a couple of times a year. We offer a generous stipend for your home office setup, annual upgrades to ensure you have a comfortable workspace and a monthly stipend for internet/phone expenses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy unlimited and flexible time off for all&amp;nbsp;salaried employees, in addition to 15 paid company holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to Learning and Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We support personal growth and education through a dedicated L&amp;amp;D fund that can be used for training, conferences, certifications and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are committed to building a diverse team with individuals from various backgrounds, experiences, abilities, and perspectives, and we are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about HiddenLayer visit&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.hiddenlayer.com/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;HiddenLayer&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/hiddenlayersec/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/hiddenlayersec&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HiddenLayer&amp;nbsp; is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to sex, race, color, religion, national origin, age, marital status, political affiliation, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, disability or protected veteran status. We are committed to providing a workplace free of any discrimination or harassment.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;AI SOLUTIONS ARCHITECT POST-SALES&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote- UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a motivated &lt;strong&gt;Solutions Architect Post-Sales&lt;/strong&gt; to join our customer success team, specializing in the AI security space. As a post-sales Solutions Architect, you will be instrumental in ensuring the successful deployment, adoption, and ongoing value realization of our AI security solutions. You will work directly with customers after the sale to understand their environments, integrate our technology into their workflows, and help them iterate quickly to maximize security and performance outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your ability to collaborate with customers, leverage modern technologies (cloud, containerization, networking), and translate feedback into actionable improvements will make you a trusted advisor and a key contributor to our long-term customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HiddenLayer protects the world’s most valuable technologies from adversarial AI attacks. We were founded by AI professionals and security specialists with first-hand experience of how insidious adversarial AI attacks can be to detect and defend against. Determined to prove that these attacks were preventable, the team developed a unique, patent-pending, productized solution to support organizations in accelerating their adoption of AI securely.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our dedication to innovation has been recognized by prestigious awards such as RSA&#39;s Innovation Sandbox Winner, CB Insights AI 100, CyberTech 100, and SC&#39;s Most Promising Early-Stage Start-up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Onboarding &amp;amp; Deployment:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with customers to design and implement secure deployments of our AI security solutions, ensuring seamless integration into their environments (cloud, on-prem, or hybrid).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Guidance &amp;amp; Iteration:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide expert technical consultation on infrastructure, containerization (Docker/Kubernetes), and cloud networking. Help customers rapidly iterate and adopt best practices for secure AI operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Success Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary technical point of contact post-sale, ensuring customers derive ongoing value, achieve their security objectives, and successfully scale their deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Troubleshooting &amp;amp; Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Diagnose and resolve customer issues, optimize configurations, and proactively identify opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement &amp;amp; Training:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver hands-on workshops, training sessions, and technical documentation to empower customer teams to be self-sufficient with our products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feedback Loop:&lt;/strong&gt; Capture customer feedback and collaborate with product management, engineering, and research teams to inform roadmap priorities and product enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a post-sales, customer success, or solutions engineering role (AI, security, or cloud-based products preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Docker and containerized workloads; familiarity with Kubernetes is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on cloud experience (AWS, Azure, or GCP), including cloud networking concepts and Infrastructure as Code (IaC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python programming experience required; familiarity with AI/ML workflows (LangChain, LangGraph, MLOps tools) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at troubleshooting technical issues and guiding customers through iterative solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills; comfortable working with both technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, adaptable, and passionate about helping customers succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY HIDDENLAYER?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We just raised $100M in Series B funding led by Delta-v Capital, with backing from Morgan Stanley, Microsoft&#39;s venture arm, Booz Allen Hamilton, and others. It&#39;s a validation of what we&#39;ve built: 10x revenue growth, 50+ new enterprise customers, and deployments across defense, finance, and the world&#39;s largest AI platforms. This funding goes straight into expanding our platform and GTM capabilities, and into growing our team globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Attracting and retaining the very best people is our #1 priority. That’s why we offer our team best-in-class benefits, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fully Remote:&lt;/strong&gt; We are a completely remote global team. Though we’re distributed, we are intentional about getting the team together a couple of times a year. We offer a generous stipend for your home office setup, annual upgrades to ensure you have a comfortable workspace and a monthly stipend for internet/phone expenses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Health &amp;amp; Wellness Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Better than your average startup healthcare benefits. With five options to choose from, of which are fully subsidized by HiddenLayer, we offer a variety of options to fit each person’s needs. We also offer vision, dental, and 401k offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy unlimited and flexible time off for all salaried employees, in addition to 15 paid company holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to Learning and Development:&lt;/strong&gt; We support personal growth and education through a dedicated L&amp;amp;D fund that can be used for training, conferences, certifications and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to building a diverse team with individuals from various backgrounds, experiences, abilities, and perspectives, and we are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about HiddenLayer visit&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.hiddenlayer.com/&quot;&gt; HiddenLayer&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/hiddenlayersec/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; or&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/hiddenlayersec&quot;&gt; Twitter&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HiddenLayer&amp;nbsp; is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to sex, race, color, religion, national origin, age, marital status, political affiliation, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, disability or protected veteran status. We are committed to providing a workplace free of any discrimination or harassment.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veeam Kasten &lt;em&gt;for Kubernetes&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Veeam&#39;s Kubernetes-native data protection platform, purpose-built for modern cloud-native applications and AI-driven workloads. As enterprises accelerate Kubernetes adoption through container-based application modernization and modern virtualization, Kasten is positioned to be the data resilience standard for cloud-native infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the leader of Worldwide Kasten Solution Sales, you will partner with regional Kasten and field sales leadership to build territory strategy, raise technical win rates, and scale Kasten expertise across the broader Veeam field organization. You will also own the field-to-product feedback loop, working directly with Kasten Product Management and engineering to represent customer requirements. While Kasten is the primary focus, this leader will also support Veeam Data Platform opportunities where Kubernetes and virtualization workloads converge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role. You will inherit an established team of senior specialists, and your mandate is to make them better: sharper technical execution, deeper coverage across both regions, and a higher bar for how Kasten is positioned and proven. You will stay credible in front of enterprise architects and technical executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;id-📝JobDescription&amp;amp;JobPostGuidelines-WhatYou’llDo.1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a distributed team of Kasten Specialist Solutions Engineers/Architects across EMEA and APJ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical win across both regions: set the standard for discovery, solution architecture, demonstration, and POC execution, and hold the team accountable to measurable technical win rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional specialist and field sales leaders on territory planning, pipeline development, and pursuit strategy, and lead regular business reviews on technical pipeline health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Kasten and VDP Proxy technical capability across the wider Veeam field organization through enablement, certification, and repeatable assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the ecosystem technical relationships that matter in region, including Red Hat, AWS, SUSE, and regional channel partners and system integrators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel up to 30% across EMEA and APJ, with occasional global travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;id-📝JobDescription&amp;amp;JobPostGuidelines-WhatYou’llDo.1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of pre-sales or solutions engineering experience in enterprise software, including 3+ years in a people leadership role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of leading pre-sales teams, including coaching, development, retention, and performance management across multiple countries, cultures, and time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Kubernetes and virtualized environments in production or evaluation, and working knowledge of enterprise data protection and recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success supporting complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise deals with long sales cycles, including channel-led and partner-influenced motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex technical capabilities into business value, and to present credibly to groups of varying size and seniority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;id-📝JobDescription&amp;amp;JobPostGuidelines-WhatYou’llDo.1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background selling to enterprise DevOps, Platform Engineering, or IT Operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with Kubernetes data protection, or with container and virtualization platforms such as Red Hat OpenShift, AWS EKS, or VMware vSphere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership experience in a high-growth environment, launching or scaling a new product or business inside a larger enterprise or a startup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in a specialist overlay model alongside a core field sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credibility in the cloud-native community, through CNCF project involvement, conference speaking, or open-source contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;id-📝JobDescription&amp;amp;JobPostGuidelines-WhatYou’llGet.1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;9743cd7f-9c81-4637-a83c-c36db410facf&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days, plus 4 extra global VeeaMe Days for self-care and 24 paid volunteer hours annually through Veeam Cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;38b14080-a15a-4743-8a21-6b4b447cad57&quot;&gt;Private medical, dental, and vision insurance with dependent enrolment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;8524e28a-aeaa-4251-a941-fb74771df07c&quot;&gt;Life insurance with enhanced coverage and global 24/7 protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;a369285b-2679-4aa2-9753-3008cf76f298&quot;&gt;Income protection after 26 weeks, covering a portion of salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;5d8aae4a-59be-4878-9e4a-61a11534a8ce&quot;&gt;Defined contribution pension plan with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;13820d5b-adc8-404c-9fd0-9aaef815d204&quot;&gt;Worldwide travel insurance for business and leisure, with option to enroll dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;90458fed-2c89-41ff-a1cd-3a047cd0b950&quot;&gt;Employee Assistance Program with therapy, legal, and financial support, plus online GP services and wellbeing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;d260280e-0ecc-4c26-ad5c-023f79289dce&quot;&gt;Opportunities to learn and grow through on-demand libraries (LinkedIn Learning, O’Reilly), mentoring, workshops and learning events like our annual Global Day of Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: If an applicant is permanently located outside of United Kingdom, Veeam reserves the right to decline the application for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-IN1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;ul&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;li&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;checked&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;displayValue&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;backgroundColor&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;color&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;listStyleType&amp;quot;:null}]&quot; data-en-clipboard=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;56095010243a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Veeam Software is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt; and does not tolerate discrimination in any form on the basis of race, color, religion, gender, age, national origin, citizenship, disability, veteran status or any other classification protected by federal, state or local law. All your information will be kept confidential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data collected during the recruitment process will be processed in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.veeam.com/legal/recruiting-privacy-notice.html&quot;&gt;Recruiting Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how your information is collected, used, and handled in connection with hiring activities. By applying for this position, you consent to this processing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you confirm that the information provided, including any supporting documents, is complete and accurate to the best of your knowledge. Any misrepresentation, omission, or falsification may result in disqualification from consideration or, if discovered after employment begins, termination of employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;app&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineering Manager, Grafana Frontend&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grafana is an open-source observability product and a platform that teams and plugin developers build on. The Frontend group shapes its user experience (from dashboards and visualisation to navigation, search and sharing) and the foundations that support engineering teams and community contributors across the Grafana ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Engineering Manager, you’ll lead the Frontend Platform and Navigation squads, owning their performance, delivery and customer outcomes. Frontend Platform enables teams to build reliable, high-quality experiences; Navigation helps users find and organise resources and move confidently through Grafana.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll develop senior engineers, partner with Product and Design, and improve how teams work, including through AI and automation. We use Cloud-first rollout and experimentation to learn quickly, bringing relevant improvements to OSS and Enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI Notice: We invest heavily in developer productivity. You can use modern AI coding assistants as part of your daily workflow (your choice of tools, within security guidelines), backed by a company-funded usage budget so you can iterate quickly without unnecessary friction. We encourage pragmatic AI-assisted development: faster prototyping, test generation, refactors, documentation, and incident follow-ups—always with strong code review and quality standards. You&#39;ll also have access to the latest frontier models from OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for the performance of &lt;strong&gt;two&lt;/strong&gt; distributed engineering squads: set clear expectations, delegate effectively, coach and develop each team member, give timely feedback, address performance gaps and build a culture of trust and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own hiring and team planning across both squads, aligning team capacity and skills with product priorities and longer-term needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery with your squads: engage directly with customers, community members and internal users, combine their feedback with research and usage evidence, and use those insights to shape roadmaps and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Design and engineering leaders to set priorities, resolve dependencies and make trade-offs between customer needs, long-term investments and operational demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery across both squads from discovery through rollout and measurement: set milestones, surface risks early and intervene when commitments are at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI regularly in your management work to synthesise research and feedback, inform roadmap and resourcing decisions, and streamline coordination, reporting and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve how the squads plan, make decisions and deliver. Lead the adoption of AI and automation across engineering and operational workflows, evaluating their impact on delivery speed, quality and time spent on repetitive work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set engineering direction with senior engineers for the frontend foundations owned by your squads, including developer experience, accessibility, architecture, tooling, reliability and multitenant capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set engineering direction for navigation, search and resource organisation, including where AI-assisted discovery can help users find what they need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and uphold engineering standards for quality, security and operability, including how teams evaluate and validate AI-assisted work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead improvements across Grafana and R&amp;amp;D that increase engineering productivity and improve business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the engineering management on-call rota, coordinate responses and drive improvements that reduce recurring disruption. Regularly use Grafana’s AI capabilities for observability, incident investigation and management, bringing that experience into product feedback and roadmap decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience managing senior engineers, building healthy teams and developing technical leaders. You give clear feedback and address performance gaps directly and fairly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong technical foundation in modern web or frontend systems, enabling you to evaluate technical trade-offs and shape architectural and engineering-quality decisions with senior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of turning ambiguous, cross-team problems into clear priorities and measurable results, managing delivery risks and operational demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product and customer judgement, with the ability to connect engineering investments to user, developer and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise written communication and the ability to work effectively in a remote, globally distributed organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An appreciation for open-source development and the judgement to balance Cloud-first delivery with the needs of customers, community members and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI and automation in your own leadership work, and leading teams to adopt them effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with React, TypeScript or comparable large-scale frontend ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a developer platform team, including support for plugins or extensions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with navigation, search, information architecture or resource-management products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering multitenant SaaS or major platform migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on a widely adopted open-source product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the United Kingdom, the Base compensation range for this role is GBP &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;117,949&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;- GBP &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;141,539&lt;/span&gt;. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed in the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Expect open decision-making and regular company-wide updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven&lt;/strong&gt; – Autonomy and support to ship great work and try new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source Roots&lt;/strong&gt; – Built on community-driven values that shape how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Teams&lt;/strong&gt; – High trust, low ego culture that values outcomes over optics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Pathways&lt;/strong&gt; – Defined opportunities to grow and develop your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approachable Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Transparent execs who are involved, visible, and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate People&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team of smart, supportive folks who care deeply about what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person onboarding &lt;/strong&gt;- We want you to thrive from day 1 with your fellow new ‘Grafanistas’ to learn all about what we do and how we do it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance is Key&lt;/strong&gt; - We operate a global annual leave policy of 30 days per annum. 3 days of your annual leave entitlement are reserved for Grafana Shutdown Days to allow the team to really disconnect. &lt;em&gt;*We will comply with local legislation where applicable.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Grafana Labs is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from everyone regardless of race, colour, nationality, origin, caste, sex, gender reassignment identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, religion or belief, disability, veteran status, genetic information, pregnancy, maternity, marital, family or carer status, or any other characteristic which is protected by local law. We believe that equality and diversity build a strong organisation, and we work hard to ensure that is the foundation of our organisation as we grow.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Grafana Labs may utilize AI tools in its recruitment process to assist in matching information provided in CVs to job postings. The recruitment team will continue to review inbound CVs manually to identify alignment with current openings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how your personal data is used once you’ve applied to a job, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/legal/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Subject Matter Expert (SME), you&#39;ll be the deepest technical voice in the field for one product group, helping customers make technical decisions on GitLab&#39;s most important opportunities, roughly the top 10% by size or complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Account Solutions Architects (Account SAs) will bring you into prioritized opportunities. The Account SA owns the opportunity; you own your product group&#39;s success within it. You&#39;ll work directly with Product and Engineering, bringing customer needs and field insights into roadmap discussions. You&#39;ll also help the wider Solutions Architecture team build expertise through reusable assets, enablement, and coaching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll specialize in one product group, not all four. In Security &amp;amp; Compliance, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Ultimate, application security, Dependency Firewall, software supply chain security, compliance, and artificial intelligence (AI) governance. In Platform, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Dedicated, self-managed deployments, bring your own model, and cloud and hybrid architecture. In Core DevSecOps, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Premium, continuous integration and continuous delivery (CI/CD), source code management, Orbit, Artifact Central, and migrations. DevSecOps brings development, security, and operations together across software delivery. In AI &amp;amp; Competitive, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Duo Agent Platform, agentic workflows, AI-native development, competitive displacement including GitHub, and migrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your success will be measured by technical win rate and bookings on SME-engaged opportunities, product-category commit attainment and consumption growth in your region, and Proof of Value (PoV) conversion rate, evaluation cycle time, and time from technical win to production use. We&#39;ll also measure how often Account SAs reuse your assets, their confidence in handling your product group without escalation, and the quality and impact of your feedback to Product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical authority for your product group on prioritized opportunities, from discovery and architecture through trials and PoV evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical deep dives, workshops, and executive briefings that connect product capabilities to business outcomes and explain how GitLab differs from competing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and improve standardized PoV templates with clear, repeatable success criteria. Account SAs own the customer PoV; you&#39;ll contribute product-specific content and expertise while keeping the evaluation connected to the broader GitLab platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip account teams for product launches with Product Management and Product Marketing. Build demos and talk tracks, and turn early customer wins into reference stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the escalation point for Account SAs and Post-Sales Solutions Architects (Post-Sales SAs) on complex product questions, integrations, and objections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hand off PoV success criteria and architecture decisions to the Post-Sales SA with the account team when an opportunity closes. Stay involved until the customer&#39;s first production workload uses the product, and support complex accounts when Post-Sales SAs bring you in to drive adoption and consumption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring structured field feedback, competitive insights, and customer requirements to Product Management and Engineering with the wider SME team. Help manage early-access and design-partner programs, and represent GitLab through customer events, conferences, industry working groups, and published content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reference architectures, demo environments, competitive battlecards, PoV playbooks, and enablement content so account teams can handle more opportunities without your direct involvement. Mentor Account SAs and contribute to GitLab&#39;s global SME community of practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience in technical pre-sales, solutions architecture, consulting, or software engineering, with deep, hands-on expertise in one domain: application security testing, supply chain security, and compliance; scalable cloud and hybrid platforms; large CI/CD environments and source code migrations; or production AI-assisted development, working prototypes, and competitive evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical expertise in agentic and AI-assisted development workflows across planning, coding, testing, security, and delivery, applied in a customer-facing, pre-sales context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience winning technical decisions on large, complex enterprise opportunities through structured Proof of Concept (PoC) or PoV evaluations with defined success criteria and executive sign-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Git, CI/CD, containers, Kubernetes, and at least one major cloud provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to lead a whiteboard session with engineers and present the business case to executives in the same meeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication, including the ability to turn complex topics into clear playbooks that others use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working asynchronously across time zones with Sales, Product, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optional: public speaking, published technical content, open source contributions, or relevant certifications in Kubernetes, cloud architecture, or security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you bring transferable experience in an adjacent domain, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building our SME organization within GitLab&#39;s Solutions Architecture team, and we&#39;re distributed and all-remote.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GumGum is The Mindset Company™ transforming advertising. We’re an advertising technology company delivering results by matching brands with people in the right mindset in the moments that matter. Our platform is powered by the Mindset Graph™, our AI-driven data engine that processes billions of real-time contextual, creative, environmental, and historical signals to match every ad with the most receptive audience. The result is advertising that drives meaningful outcomes for advertisers and publishers, and is more relevant for consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were founded in 2008 and are headquartered in Santa Monica, California, operating in over 19 markets across North America, Europe, Japan, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our principles guide our work every day and are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Obsessed:&lt;/strong&gt; We’re focused on advertising solutions that solve needs and drive success for clients and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make it Happen:&lt;/strong&gt; We have a bias for action and take ownership to deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Always Innovate:&lt;/strong&gt; We push boundaries with creativity and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt; We ensure colleagues feel included, supported, and empowered to thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be a part of The Mindset Company™ transforming advertising, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.gumgum.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.gumgum.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Account Director role is an individual contributor responsible for prospecting and closing sales in GumGum’s market-leading contextual advertising platform. Reporting to the NSW Sales Director, this role is responsible for developing key relationships within large and mid-size agencies, with occasional managerial guidance on client calls. We require this role to work relatively autonomously while being supported by a cross-functional pre-sales team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Account Directors have experience and deep knowledge of the online media landscape and the advertising community and have at least 6+ years of digital media experience.&amp;nbsp; The Account Director uses existing processes to solve a variety of challenging problems to deliver for clients. The role requires applying independent judgment and discretion to select appropriate options from GumGum’s defined and proven products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: GumGum fosters a hybrid flexible work environment. The Sales team collaborates in office 3 days per week: Tuesday-Thursday.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Achieve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a $3M–$4M+ annual book of business across NSW, driving both renewal revenue and fresh new business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hunt for new opportunities through cold outreach, compelling presentations, RFP responses, and creative client entertainment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow relationships with large and mid-sized agencies into long-term, strategic partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn marketing-generated leads into qualified pipeline and closed deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand current clients&#39; investment by introducing them to GumGum&#39;s display and video offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a trusted advisor to brands and agencies, understanding their goals and matching them with the right GumGum solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape our product roadmap by bringing real client insight back to the Product team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Account Managers and cross-functional teams to make sure every proposal lands and delivers on client expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor&#39;s degree in Media, Marketing, or Advertising is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of digital advertising sales experience, with a proven track record of hitting or exceeding targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a large book of business, plus hands-on programmatic expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, strategic relationships across Australian agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence in Salesforce — logging meetings and calls, pulling reports, and keeping your pipeline sharp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superb written and verbal communication skills, with a knack for building strategic client relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sharp eye for detail and organisation, plus quick problem-solving while guiding stakeholders through the process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid business acumen (P&amp;amp;L, COGS, revenue drivers) and the analytical judgment to craft smart solutions from data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn about our benefits &amp;amp; perks package at &lt;a href=&quot;http://gumgum.com/benefits&quot;&gt;gumgum.com/benefits&lt;/a&gt;. If you&#39;d like additional information, your recruiter can share more specifics during the hiring process!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Awards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2025 &amp;amp; 2026 Digiday Media Awards Europe Best Contextual Targeting Offering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2025 AdExchanger Awards AI Innovators, Technology &amp;amp; Service Provider, Finalist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2025 MARKETECH APAC Marketing Technology Awards Silver Winner for Best Contextual Advertising Tech Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re always learning and evolving as a company, and we continue to take thoughtful steps to support our people and strengthen our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Follow Us on Social&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instagram: @gumgum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LinkedIn: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/gumgum/&quot;&gt;https://www.linkedin.com/company/gumgum/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;YouTube: @GumGumInc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TikTok: @itsgumgum&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beware of recruitment scams.&lt;/strong&gt; GumGum recruits only for active roles on our careers page, accepts applications through Greenhouse, and communicates only via LinkedIn or ----- / ----- email addresses. We never use chat apps, ask you to register on other recruiting sites, or request financial information, payments or purchases. &lt;a href=&quot;https://gumgum.com/contact&quot;&gt;Verify suspicious outreach&lt;/a&gt; before sharing personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Forward Deployed Engineer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About HSO&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HSO is a global Business Transformation Partner with deep industry expertise and a long standing strategic relationship with Microsoft. We help organisations unlock the full potential of Microsoft Dynamics 365, Azure, Data and AI technologies to modernise operations, accelerate innovation and deliver meaningful business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2026, HSO achieved Microsoft Frontier Partner status, recognising our advanced capabilities across Microsoft Cloud and AI and our ability to help customers move beyond AI experimentation into secure, governed, enterprise scale production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With operations across Europe, North America and Asia, we combine industry knowledge, technical excellence and a practical, people first approach to transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to expand our AI capabilities, we’re building a new generation of customer facing engineering talent to help organisations turn the potential of AI and agentic technologies into real, measurable value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HSO is building a new generation of customer facing engineers who will help our customers create the operating model of the future using the latest AI, data and cloud capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Forward Deployed Engineers combine consulting judgement, production software engineering, data platform expertise, AI delivery capability and business transformation skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will embed with strategic customers, understand their most important business challenges and rapidly turn those challenges into working, production ready AI applications, agentic workflows, automation solutions and data driven platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands on, outcome led role embedded within customer environments. You’ll move quickly from discovery to working software and take accountability for delivering measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work across business processes, data platforms, integrations, AI, cloud and security, designing solutions that make effective use of Microsoft technologies while integrating with the customer’s wider technology estate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong understanding of modern enterprise data platforms is fundamental to the role. You will need to understand how data is structured, governed, integrated, transformed and made available to AI and application workloads, and how data platform decisions affect the quality, scalability and reliability of the solutions you build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Forward Deployed Engineers work closely with Deployment Strategists. The Deployment Strategist focuses on identifying where AI can create the greatest customer value and defining the desired outcome. The FDE takes ownership of how that outcome is delivered technically.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From discovery through to go live, both roles work side by side. The FDE owns the technical solution and delivery, while the Deployment Strategist ensures the solution remains aligned to the business problem and measurable value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role does not end at first deployment. You’ll stay close to solutions through hardening, adoption and handover before moving on to the next value opportunity. You’ll also turn what you learn into reusable HSO assets, reference architectures and delivery patterns that help future engagements move faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Own Customer Outcomes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Embed rapidly within customer teams and develop a strong understanding of their priorities, operating processes, systems, data and constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Translate ambiguous business problems and defined customer outcomes into clear technical delivery plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Act as the technical lead throughout an engagement, guiding customer sponsors, business users, technical teams and HSO colleagues towards successful delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build trusted relationships with senior operational and technical stakeholders, including CTO and CIO level leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Take ownership for delivering solutions that create measurable customer value rather than simply completing technical tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lead Discovery and Solution Design&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Lead technical discovery workshops to understand customer challenges and identify high value AI, data and automation opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Assess business processes, data readiness, data architecture, integration points, security requirements, technical risks and operational constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Understand the customer’s existing data platform landscape and identify how data needs to be accessed, transformed, governed or modernised to support the required solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Apply a problem first approach to identify the smallest valuable solution that can be built and proven quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Design end to end solution architectures that balance speed, scalability, maintainability, security and responsible AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Turn discovery into a pragmatic roadmap from prototype through to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build and Ship Production Solutions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Design, build, integrate, test and deploy enterprise grade solutions using modern cloud, data and AI technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Develop AI powered applications, copilots, agents, automations, integrations and workflow solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build solutions that make effective use of modern enterprise data platforms and ensure AI applications are supported by reliable, governed and accessible data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Integrate solutions with platforms such as Microsoft Fabric, Azure Data Services, Dynamics 365, Power Platform, Salesforce, SAP, ServiceNow and customer owned systems, APIs and data platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Apply modern engineering practices including source control, CI/CD, automated testing, infrastructure as code, observability and secure development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Work iteratively. Deliver value quickly, learn from real world usage and progressively harden solutions for enterprise production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Engineer AI and Agentic Solutions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Design and implement robust agentic workflows, human in the loop processes and, where appropriate, multi agent architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Apply modern techniques across retrieval, grounding, orchestration, tool integration, context engineering and evaluation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build evaluation frameworks and guardrails to test AI behaviour, reliability and quality before and after deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Implement appropriate responsible AI, security, monitoring and governance controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Ensure data quality, lineage, governance and availability are considered as fundamental components of AI solution design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Use operational data and user feedback to continuously improve solution quality and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Create Reusable HSO Capability&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Reuse existing HSO assets, accelerators and delivery patterns wherever they improve speed and quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Turn lessons from customer engagements into reusable assets, reference architectures, engineering patterns and playbooks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Contribute actively to HSO’s AI, Data, Frontier and Horizon engineering communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Share practical knowledge across regions, practices and delivery teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Support and mentor other engineers as the Forward Deployed Engineering capability grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for experienced engineers who combine strong technical depth with commercial awareness and the ability to operate confidently with customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll ideally bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Significant experience across software engineering, cloud engineering, data engineering, solution development, technical consulting or enterprise technology delivery, with senior level ownership of complex solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong hands on experience building and operating production grade solutions on at least one major cloud platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong understanding and practical experience of modern enterprise data platforms, including data architecture, integration, transformation, governance and the role data plays in enabling AI and application workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience with Microsoft data technologies such as Microsoft Fabric, Azure Data Factory, Azure Synapse, Azure Databricks, OneLake or comparable enterprise data platforms would be highly valuable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Excellent coding capability in a modern language such as Python, C#, TypeScript, JavaScript or Java, with a track record of producing maintainable, production quality software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Practical experience designing, building and deploying AI powered applications using platforms such as Azure AI, OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, Google Vertex AI, Anthropic or comparable technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Hands on experience with large language models, prompting, retrieval augmented generation, evaluation and agent orchestration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong understanding of APIs, integrations, data platforms and modern distributed application architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience with modern engineering and DevOps practices including CI/CD, automated testing, source control and infrastructure as code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong customer facing experience in consulting, transformation, delivery or technical leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• The ability to work effectively where requirements are incomplete, priorities evolve quickly and the right answer is not immediately obvious.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• The judgement to balance engineering excellence with speed, practicality and customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do not need to be an expert in every technology we use. More important is the ability to learn quickly, understand unfamiliar environments and apply strong engineering and data fundamentals to new problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Certifications across Microsoft Azure, Microsoft Fabric, AWS, Google Cloud or leading AI platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience working with enterprise platforms such as Dynamics 365, Power Platform, Salesforce, SAP, ServiceNow or similar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience implementing responsible AI, AI governance, evaluation frameworks or model monitoring in enterprise environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience designing or delivering modern data platforms that support analytics, operational applications or AI workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience across industries such as Manufacturing, Retail, Financial Services, Public Sector or Professional Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• A track record of turning successful customer solutions into reusable patterns or accelerators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience leading small, highly capable engineering teams from discovery through to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join HSO?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is changing how organisations operate, but most businesses do not need more demonstrations or isolated pilots. They need people who can identify where AI will genuinely create value, ensure the underlying data foundations are fit for purpose and then build something that works in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That is what this role is designed to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer at HSO, you’ll work directly with strategic customers at the point where emerging AI, data and cloud capabilities meet real business problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build real AI products and solutions rather than proof of concepts that never reach production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Work across AI, cloud and data platforms to solve complex customer problems end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Work directly with senior customer stakeholders and see the impact of what you build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Operate at the forefront of Microsoft’s evolving AI and Data ecosystem as part of a Microsoft Frontier Partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Work across technologies, industries and business problems rather than being confined to a single product or platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Help shape a new engineering capability within HSO rather than stepping into a narrowly defined existing model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Turn successful customer work into reusable technology and approaches that can scale across HSO globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a senior, practical and customer focused team that values ownership, curiosity, engineering quality, speed and measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive base salary alongside HSO’s standard employee benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will also include a performance related element designed to recognise both individual contribution and the value created through successful customer delivery. Further details on the compensation structure and performance measures will be discussed during the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Location: London&lt;br&gt;Type: Full-time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;BW ESS is seeking an experienced Senior Treasury Manager to take ownership of the Group&#39;s treasury activities across its international corporate entities, project SPVs and joint ventures.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As BW ESS continues to grow, the complexity and importance of treasury is increasing materially. This role will bring together activities currently undertaken across different parts of the organisation, establish clear ownership and controls, and build a scalable treasury capability for the Group.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This is a senior, hands-on role for someone who can both design the right treasury framework and make sure it operates effectively day to day. We are looking for candidates with real ownership experience in complex, multi-entity, multi-currency environments, ideally gained in energy, renewables, infrastructure, utilities or another project- and SPV-based business.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;About BW ESS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;BW ESS is a global energy storage owner-operator, moving with speed to develop, deliver and operate market-leading projects.&amp;nbsp;The business is active in the UK, Australia, Italy, Germany, Spain, and Sweden. It has more than 540MWh of operating Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS), with ~12GWh under construction and a development pipeline of several gigawatts.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Part of BW Group, BW ESS builds on decades of global infrastructure experience, takes a long-term view of projects and partnerships, and focuses on unlocking value throughout the energy storage asset lifecycle.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;To find out more, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;https://bw-ess.com/&quot;&gt;https://bw-ess.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Reporting to the Director of FP&amp;amp;A and Treasury, you will work closely with the CFO, Strategic Finance, Portfolio FP&amp;amp;A, Accounting, Tax, Investments, Legal and project teams, as well as BW Group and the Group&#39;s banking counterparties.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You will be responsible for Group cash and liquidity management, credit support, FX and hedging operations, cash investment, banking and treasury facilities, treasury governance and treasury systems.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Your objective is to replace fragmented activity with a coherent Group treasury capability: giving management reliable visibility of cash, liquidity and treasury risk, ensuring cash and credit resources are deployed efficiently, strengthening controls and banking infrastructure, and building processes and systems that scale with the business.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cash management: own the consolidated Group cash position across corporate entities, project SPVs, joint ventures, accounts and currencies, including restricted and unrestricted cash, intercompany funding, equity contributions and distributions, and ensuring the right cash sits in the right entity, account and currency ahead of material payment obligations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Liquidity management: own the Group liquidity position and rolling forecast, consolidating inputs from Portfolio FP&amp;amp;A, Accounting, Investments, Strategic Finance and project teams, and providing forward-looking analysis of requirements, constraints, surpluses and funding needs across multiple currencies and jurisdictions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Credit support: own the portfolio of bank guarantees, parent-company guarantees, letters of credit and other contingent exposures, managing issuance, amendment, renewal and cancellation, and monitoring utilisation, expiries, fees, collateral and facility headroom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;FX management: own the consolidated view of forecast and actual FX exposures across development, construction, operations and corporate activity, maintain the Group&#39;s FX framework, recommend hedging actions, and execute approved transactions within delegated authorities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cash investment: manage surplus cash within approved policies and counterparty limits, optimising deposit arrangements, managing counterparty exposure and diversification, and negotiating terms to improve returns while preserving liquidity.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hedging operations: own the operational management of FX and interest-rate derivatives, including execution, confirmation, settlement, records of hedges and maturities, collateral and threshold monitoring, and treasury inputs into valuation, accounting and reporting.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Banking and facilities: act as principal treasury relationship owner for cash-management and transaction banks, maintain the Group&#39;s banking architecture (accounts, mandates, signatories, access, KYC and documentation), own treasury-related facilities, and support complex funds flows for acquisitions, disposals, financings, refinancings and project financial close.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Controls, policy and governance: own treasury policies, procedures, delegated authorities and the control framework, ensure transactions are authorised, documented, reconciled and auditable, monitor compliance with policy and counterparty limits, and report to senior management and governance forums.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Systems and transformation: define the future treasury operating model, lead Treasury&#39;s contribution to the Group&#39;s ERP implementation, drive automation of cash visibility, forecasting, payments and bank-statement collection, and assess the role and timing of a dedicated Treasury Management System.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;10+ years&#39; relevant experience in corporate treasury, infrastructure, energy, banking or a closely related finance role.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Demonstrable experience taking ownership of treasury activities in a complex, multi-entity, multi-currency organisation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong practical experience across cash and liquidity management, FX, banking, credit support and treasury controls.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience managing senior relationships with banks and other financial counterparties.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong understanding of treasury risk management, with the ability to translate financial exposures into practical recommendations and actions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to operate effectively across multiple legal entities, jurisdictions, currencies and stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong judgement and the confidence to identify issues, challenge existing practice and recommend solutions to senior management.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comfortable working hands-on while building more scalable processes, controls and systems.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong analytical capability and the ability to communicate complex treasury issues clearly and concisely.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;ACT, ACA, ACCA, CIMA or equivalent professional qualification preferred.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Energy, renewables, infrastructure, utilities or another project- and SPV-based business.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Treasury within a business undergoing rapid international growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Project finance, including restricted cash, reserve accounts and project-level funding structures.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bank guarantees, letters of credit, parent-company guarantees and other project credit support.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;FX and interest-rate derivatives, including ISDA-governed arrangements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;ERP, Treasury Management System or wider finance-transformation implementation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cash pooling, bank connectivity, automated payments and treasury reporting.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Acquisition, disposal, refinancing and complex transaction funds flows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join BW ESS?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This is an opportunity to join a fast-moving global energy storage owner-operator at a pivotal point in its growth, and to build the Group&#39;s treasury capability from a position of genuine ownership.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you are an experienced treasury professional who enjoys combining framework-building with hands-on delivery in an international, project-based business, we would like to hear from you.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;BW ESS is committed to building a high-performing, inclusive team and welcomes applications from candidates of all backgrounds&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Your personal information will be processed in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://bw-ess.com/bw-ess-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in shaping the experience that millions of customers land on every time they open DoorDash, Wolt, or Deliveroo. As part of our Core Consumer organisation, our Homepage team owns one of the single biggest levers we have on what customers find and one of the hardest surfaces in the app to get right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at the intersection of ranking, personalisation, and AI/ML, you&#39;ll help decide what each customer sees and why, across three brands and dozens of markets. You&#39;ll be building on a global stack, and your roadmap will be a mix: global platform problems that apply worldwide, global capabilities we&#39;re accelerating into EMEA, and EMEA-specific problems worth solving properly rather than working around.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Product Manager to join our Homepage team. In this role, you&#39;ll shape how customers discover restaurants, grocery and retail venues, dishes and products — and help define what discovery looks like as AI-driven and agentic experiences change the way people decide what to order.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be joining a team working on one of the most-used surfaces in the app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here&#39;s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building new end-to-end features and user experiences on Homepage that shape how customers discover restaurants, grocery and retail venues, dishes, and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on ranking, personalisation, and AI/ML problems in the Homepage domain, including how we decide what each customer sees and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exploring where AI-driven and agentic experiences change the way customers discover what to order.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making discovery work across three brands and many markets, without flattening into one-size-fits-all.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong product judgment and curiosity to grow into the rest:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Product Manager on consumer-facing products - discovery, homepage, feed, or ranking-driven experiences are especially relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a product manager more than a feature owner. Someone who finds the customer problems that matter most and makes the case for solving them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work backwards from the customer problem, and weigh it against what the business needs most right now.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable holding several business objectives at once and making a call when they pull in different directions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work well with a wide range of stakeholders and build trust with people whose priorities differ from your own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think strategically and can move between long-term direction and what we should ship next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with ambiguity and genuinely flexible (this industry is changing fast, AI most of all).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about what AI actually changes for customers, and can tell real value from hype.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position will be filled as soon as we find the right person, so make sure to apply as soon as you realize you really, really want to join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc?si=FzuwoSOLcv5WZVRN&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For over 20 years, Smartsheet has empowered teams to manage work seamlessly and scale solutions smarter. Now, in our most ambitious chapter yet, we are uniting human teams with AI agents. By orchestrating the work agents do best, automating manual tasks and uncovering insights at scale, we create the space for people to focus on what truly matters: judgment, creativity, and big thinking. That is magic at work, and it’s what we show up for every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Smartsheet is looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; to join our EMEA organisation. You will be responsible for increasing software and services sales by expanding existing customers&#39; adoption along with targeting new logo acquisition. This is an incredibly exciting opportunity to help build out a strategically important vertical for Smartsheet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based at Smartsheet in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;London, UK (hybrid or UK, remote eligible)&lt;/strong&gt; and reports to a &lt;strong&gt;Regional Director, Enterprise Sales.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceed quarterly and annual software and services sales quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead primary and secondary account teams by partnering with Solution Engineering, Consulting, Customer Success, Customer Outcomes, Marketing and Sales Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop short and long-term growth and renewal strategies across your customer base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance tactical execution whilst ultimately targeting complex, high-value solution-based deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively develop unsolicited proposals that align with customer initiatives and position Smartsheet as an enterprise software solution provider&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately forecast sales opportunities, while tracking and using critical metrics that predict sales success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience selling enterprise software or services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable track record of exceeding assigned quotas and receiving recognition for high-performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience building relationships with senior line-of-business leaders, IT executives and operational managers within Enterprise organisations (&amp;gt;10,000 employees)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding and experience of selling directly and through partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage a large and diverse pipeline of sales opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in developing successful go-to-market strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience executing complex, solution-based strategic sales processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;World class sales basics in terms of pipe generation approaches, territory planning, account planning and deal execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly accountable for actions and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilient and adaptable to change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High integrity with the ability to build trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent instinct and judgment to make sound choices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong self awareness in terms of strengths, weaknesses and where to have the highest impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in ambiguity with the ability to translate complexity into clarity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High humility with a mindset of continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, creative and able to respectfully challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and driven by a need to make a difference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides leadership by leveraging collective strengths, providing vision and by buying into collective objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Legally eligible to work in the UK on an ongoing basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-paid Private Medical and Dental, additional cost for family members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly contributions toward your pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly stipend to support your work and productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days paid for Holiday + Bank Holidays + Flexible Time Away Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20 weeks fully paid Maternity Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12 weeks fully paid Paternity/Adoption Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal paid Volunteer Day to support our community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for professional growth and development including access to Udemy online courses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Funded Perks including a counseling membership, salary sacrifice options, and your own personal Smartsheet account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teleworking options from any registered location in the UK (role specific)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to Know Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Smartsheet, your ideas are heard, your potential is supported, and your contributions have real impact. You’ll have the freedom to explore, push boundaries, and grow beyond your role. We welcome diverse perspectives and nontraditional paths—because we know that impact comes from individuals who care deeply and challenge thoughtfully. When you’re doing work that stretches you, excites you, and connects you to something bigger, that’s magic at work. Let’s build what’s next, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Smartsheet is an Equal Opportunity (EEO) employer committed to fostering an inclusive environment with the best employees. It is our policy to provide equal employment opportunities to all qualified applicants in accordance with applicable laws in the US, UK, Australia, Germany, Costa Rica, Japan, Bulgaria, India, and Singapore. All qualified applicants will receive consideration without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, protected veteran or disabled status, or genetic information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there are preparations we can make to help ensure you have a comfortable and positive interview experience, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mavericks Wanted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When was the last time you achieved the impossible? If that thought feels overwhelming, you might want to pause here, but if it sparks excitement...read on&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In 2015, we pioneered a “moneyball for biotech” approach, pooling projects and promising early-stage research from academia together under one financial umbrella to reduce risk and unleash innovation. This model allows science and small teams of experts to lead the way. We build bridges to groundbreaking advancements in rare&amp;nbsp;disease, and&amp;nbsp;develop life-changing medicines for patients with unmet needs as fast as humanly possible. &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Together we define white space, push boundaries, and empower people to solve problems. If you&#39;re someone who defies convention, join us and work alongside some of the most respected minds in the industry. Together, we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;ask&amp;nbsp;&quot;why not?&quot; and help reengineer the future of biopharma. At BridgeBio, we value curiosity and experimentation—including the ethical &amp;amp; thoughtful use of AI to improve clarity, speed, and quality of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager, Commercial Sourcing and Contracts will report directly to the Head of International Supply Chain. This role will be responsible for supporting the development and execution of sourcing strategies, managing the end-to-end contracting lifecycle for commercial goods and services. You will partner closely with cross-functional stakeholders (Supply Chain, Legal, Finance, CMC and Quality) to manage supplier relationships and ensure contractual compliance across Contract Manufacturing Organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sourcing Strategy &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and implementation of sourcing strategies for Contract Manufacturing Organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support RFP processes, supplier evaluations, and negotiations to secure optimal cost, quality, and service outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market analysis and benchmarking to support the identification of sourcing opportunities and mitigate supply risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive supplier consolidation, dual-sourcing, or diversification strategies where appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, negotiate, and finalize commercial contracts, master service agreements (MSAs), and supply agreements in collaboration with the relevant stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a contract repository/tracker ensuring visibility of key terms, renewal dates, and obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage contract amendments, renewals, and terminations in line with business needs and risk exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier Relationship Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as primary Commercial Supply Chain point of contact for Contract Manufacturing Organizations, managing performance reviews and escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor supplier performance against SLAs/KPIs and drive corrective action plans where needed with relevant stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support supplier risk assessments (financial, operational, compliance) in coordination with Quality and Supply Chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Where You’ll Work&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role based in the Netherlands, with approximately 10–15% travel anticipated to visit Contract Manufacturing Organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who You Are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a related field, such as Supply Chain, Logistics, or Business Administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 10 years of supply chain experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life sciences industry experience; experience with commercial products is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience negotiating and managing commercial contracts with Contract Manufacturing Organizations in a regulated environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and sustain trusted relationships, both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and cross-functional collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to translate contract terms into sourcing decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented, organized, and comfortable managing multiple contracts/projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English, both written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rewarding Those Who Make the Mission Possible&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market-leading compensation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work model – we value your flexibility in how you work, but encourage time in the office to strengthen our culture, collaboration, and sense of community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career development through regular feedback, continuous education, and professional development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognition for strong performance through financial rewards, peer-to-peer feedback, and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a global company, our comprehensive benefits may vary based on location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
