&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dragos is an Equal Opportunity Employer and considers applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, orientation, national origin, age, disability, genetics, or any other basis forbidden under federal, state, or local laws. All new hires must pass a background check as a condition of employment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;A career that’s the whole package!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Conga, we’ve built a community where our colleagues can thrive. Here you’ll find opportunities to innovate and support growth through individual and team development, all within an environment where every voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conga&lt;/strong&gt; lines up commercial operations so companies run as connected, smarter businesses. By unifying the people and processes that drive commerce, Conga aligns pricing, quoting, contracting, rebates, and communications so teams stay in sync and buyers keep moving forward. The result is trusted decisions, consistent buyer experiences, and profitable growth. More than 10,000 customers worldwide, including over 50% of the Fortune 100®, trust Conga when commercial complexity is high and global impact is on the line.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Germany (remote)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;RVP Sales&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;native/C2 level German and English&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Quick Snapshot…..&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;be at the forefront of our revenue growth strategy, spearheading efforts to uncover and nurture new business prospects while strengthening connections with our current clientele. Your role will involve deeply understanding client requirements, crafting personalized solutions, and ensuring top-notch customer satisfaction. Collaborating closely with Sales Engineering, Business/Sales Development, Marketing, Transformation Specialists,&amp;nbsp;Customer Success, Professional Services, Partners&amp;nbsp;and clients, your primary focus will be on&amp;nbsp;prospecting, managing and closing new business opportunities for enterprise-wide CONGA solutions with organizations across a variety of key strategic industries/verticals in the B2B space.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why it’s big deal…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have the chance to sell high-impact, mission-critical projects with substantial value, driving transformational change for our clients in Central Europe. Your role will involve skillfully crafting and implementing territory, account, and opportunity plans to optimize revenue within your assigned selling patch. You&#39;ll expertly manage sales opportunities throughout every stage of the cycle, ensuring success for both our clients and our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the person we are looking for?  &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven&amp;nbsp;track record.&lt;/strong&gt;  You have at least 5 years successful B2B technology Enterprise sales experience in the SaaS industry, in Central Europe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency&amp;nbsp;in revenue management principles is crucial.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a consistent track record of&amp;nbsp;over achieving&amp;nbsp;quota and revenue targets. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You cultivate and&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;strategic relationships with partners to drive mutual business growth and success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and experience in general AI and machine learning can bring significant value. You understand how AI can enhance revenue management processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunter mentality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;have the opportunity to unleash your inner hunter and drive our growth through relentless pursuit of new business opportunities. You thrive in a fast-paced environment,&amp;nbsp;leveraging&amp;nbsp;your strategic mindset and tenacity to&amp;nbsp;identify, pursue, and close deals with potential clients. The focus is 90%&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Selling. &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with prospects and clients to understand their unique challenges and business goals. Present Conga&#39;s comprehensive suite of solutions and services that align with clients&#39; needs,&amp;nbsp;demonstrating&amp;nbsp;a deep understanding of how Conga can provide value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;You have the ability to successfully leverage resources and take initiative. The most successful Conga reps are the ones who stop at nothing to achieve success no matter the&amp;nbsp;circumstance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;: You have the ability to articulate complex technology concepts to a technical and non-technical audience.&amp;nbsp;You also have superb listening&amp;nbsp;skills&amp;nbsp;and you understand objections and overcome them by turning skeptics into enthusiastic new customers and brand ambassadors. You&amp;nbsp;possess&amp;nbsp;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;. As the business landscape is constantly&amp;nbsp;evolving&amp;nbsp;you adapt to changes in market conditions, customer preferences, and competitive dynamics. You innovate and develop creative solutions to address challenges and capitalize on opportunities in the revenue management space.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration.&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;work closely with cross-functional teams including Sales Engineering, Business Development, Marketing, and Customer Success to deliver exceptional value to our clients and drive mutual success. Together,&amp;nbsp;we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;each other&#39;s&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;and insights to achieve our goals and surpass expectations.&amp;nbsp;You have the gravitas to lead a winning team,&amp;nbsp;leveraging&amp;nbsp;the strengths and skills of the organization to deliver profitable business to the organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will give you an edge...&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience selling Revenue Lifecycle Management solutions with a good understanding of CPQ,&amp;nbsp;revenue optimization,&amp;nbsp;CLM, doc-gen and e-signature products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Education and/or experience in Economics, Statistics, Mathematics, Accounting, Marketing, Finance, or Operations Research considered a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Did we pique your interest? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the kind of job you would love in the kind of environment where you would thrive, please click apply. &lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Resume Format&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We accept resumes in any format, we suggest using PDF or plain text. These formats help ensure that your resume’s formatting remains intact, making it easier for our recruiters to review your application promptly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don’t meet every requirement for the role?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and members of ethnic minorities are less likely to apply to jobs unless they meet every single qualification. At Conga we are dedicated to building a diverse, inclusive, and authentic workplace, so if you’re excited about this role but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyway. You just might be the right candidate for this or other roles. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;st-additionalInformation&quot; class=&quot;job-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Additional Information&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conga is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer and provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants regardless of race, color, religion, gender, gender identity, age, national origin, disability, parental or pregnancy status, marriage and civil partnership, sexual orientation, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. We understand interviewing can be stressful for those with disabilities. If reasonable accommodation is needed to allow you to show us your best self, please let your recruiter know as soon as possible. All your information will be kept confidential according to EEO guidelines. Conga is not open to third party solicitation or resumes for our posted FTE positions. Resumes received from third party agencies that are unsolicited will be considered complimentary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;job-apply print-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conga&#39;s Applicant Privacy Statement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The information you provide during the application process will be used in accordance with Conga’s Applicant Privacy Statement (&lt;a href=&quot;https://conga.com/applicant-privacy-statement&quot;&gt;https://conga.com/applicant-privacy-statement&lt;/a&gt;). By submitting your application, you acknowledge and agree to the terms outlined in this privacy statement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Story&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At thinkcell, we create powerful software solutions that help professionals be more efficient and productive. Founded in 2002 and based in Berlin, our tools integrate seamlessly with Microsoft Office to help users create presentations, charts, and diagrams with ease. Our dynamic, international team values creativity, collaboration, and technical excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Working Student in our Academics team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will support the day-to-day operations and growth of thinkcell’s academic program. You will work on a broad range of tasks, from handling program requests and supporting outreach to coordinating workshops and improving processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our academic program gives students and professors free access to thinkcell and helps them develop practical skills in data visualization and storytelling. You will help us bring these opportunities to more universities, faculty members, and student clubs worldwide (find out more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.think-cell.com/en/order/academics&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;). We have big plans to grow the program significantly with the next years – and you can be apart of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support program operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Help manage our academic inbox, respond to student and faculty inquiries, and coordinate license requests, renewals, and extensions with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Review new applications&lt;/strong&gt;: Research faculty members and institutions, assess eligibility against program guidelines, and prepare responses and next steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support academic outreach&lt;/strong&gt;: Identify relevant professors and student clubs, draft personalized outreach, and follow up with existing contacts to build engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate workshops&lt;/strong&gt;: Work with student clubs and faculty to schedule workshops, organize logistics, and keep contact information up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute across the team&lt;/strong&gt;: Support ongoing projects and ad hoc tasks, taking ownership of defined activities as you gain experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be great for this position if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Studies&lt;/strong&gt;: Currently enrolled in business, computer science, or a related field, with at least two years of university studies completed – undergraduate degree is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive and comfortable working independently, with strong problem-solving skills and a keen eye for detail. Well organized, reliable, and able to prioritize tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt;: Proficient in Microsoft Office, especially Excel and PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;: Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Availability &amp;amp; Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Available for 20 hours per week, including at least two days per week at our headquarters in Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Presentation experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience creating presentations in PowerPoint is a strong plus; familiarity with thinkcell is an added advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As part of our team, you will embody and help shape the following principles that define us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Forward Thinking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We embrace change and challenge the status quo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We take pride in our work and learn from our mistakes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Customer First&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We prioritize delivering lasting value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unified Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We foster collaboration, respect, and integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strive for Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We set ambitious goals and pursue quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe in a human hiring process, every application is personally reviewed.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why is thinkcell the right place for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We empower over 1.3 million users across 35,000 companies, including top consulting firms and major global enterprises. With offices in Berlin, Munich, Denver, Boston, London, Tokyo, and Dubai, we’re a diverse team of over 240 people, committed to innovation and excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;thinkcell is more than a job – it&#39;s a chance to be part of an innovative, inclusive team that values collaboration and growth. We encourage applicants from all backgrounds to apply. Together, we can shape the future of productivity software. We can’t wait to see what you’ll bring to the team!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;This role is part of our Central Finance Team at&lt;a href=&quot;https://saas.group&quot;&gt; saas.group.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is saas.group?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Think of us as the driving catalyst behind your favorite software success stories. saas.group, established in 2017, is on a mission to turbocharge promising B2B SaaS ventures, unlocking their full potential. As a Software-as-a-Service portfolio powerhouse, we specialize in acquiring small software treasures and polishing them into industry stars. With a dynamic, fully remote team of nearly 400+ colleagues spanning 45 countries we are truly global and we are rewriting the playbook on SaaS innovation and collaboration. We grow &lt;a href=&quot;https://saas.group/family/&quot;&gt;24 exciting brands&lt;/a&gt; under our umbrella.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Feel free to explore our &lt;a href=&quot;https://saas.group/candidate-hub/&quot;&gt;Candidate&#39;s Hub&lt;/a&gt; to get an insider&#39;s view, dive into our culture, gain valuable insights into our teams and how we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also, don’t forget to follow &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/saas-group/&quot;&gt;saas.group on LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; to stay up-to-date on our job openings, podcast episodes, and with all things happening at our company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_1c795b13c79aa7b0-33&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a hands-on, detail-oriented Managing Director to lead SaaS.group GmbH, our German legal entity based in Schönefeld&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2&quot;&gt;. In this role, you will serve as the registered Managing Director on-site, exercising real decision-making authority, managing office administration, and overseeing day-to-day accounting operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4&quot;&gt;. You will serve as the local face of the company for authorities, banks, auditors, and external service providers while working in close alignment with our Central Legal, Accounting, and Finance teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_1c795b13c79aa7b0-34&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0&quot;&gt;This is a unique opportunity for an experienced finance or office management professional based in the Berlin/Brandenburg region looking to step up into an official corporate leadership role within an international, fast-growing software group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Your immediate impact in the first 3-6 months will be:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_1c795b13c79aa7b0-35&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0&quot;&gt;Seamlessly transition into the registered Managing Director role for SaaS.group GmbH and establish effective on-site operational processes in Schönefeld&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2&quot;&gt;Assume complete oversight of local bookkeeping (payables, receivables, document management) and streamline month-end close workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4&quot;&gt;Build strong working relationships with our external tax advisors, auditors, banks, and internal group accounting/legal functions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6&quot;&gt;Ensure full compliance with all corporate-law requirements, commercial register obligations, and internal rules of procedure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,8&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0&quot;&gt;Manage SaaS.group GmbH on-site in Schönefeld, taking full ownership of approvals, contract execution, and payment authorizations within defined rules of procedure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2&quot;&gt;Run and oversee day-to-day bookkeeping, including accounts payable/receivable, document organization, and preparation of month-end closing activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with tax advisors and auditors on VAT filings, annual financial statements, and audit processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,6&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,6&quot;&gt;Maintain strict compliance with German corporate-law obligations, including commercial register filings, transparency register updates, and shareholder resolutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,8&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,8&quot;&gt;Lead office management and operational setup in Schönefeld, managing incoming mail, vendor/service provider contracts, archiving, and filing systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,10&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,10&quot;&gt;Act as the primary local point of contact for the German tax office (Finanzamt), financial institutions, local authorities, and insurers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,12&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You bring to the table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0&quot;&gt;Vocational training in a commercial field (e.g., Tax Clerk / Steuerfachangestellte/r, Certified Accountant / Bilanzbuchhalter/in, Office Management) or equivalent practical experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2&quot;&gt;Multi-year background in accounting, financial administration, or senior office management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency with DATEV (or comparable accounting software) as well as modern digital tools (MS Office / Google Workspace)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,6&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,6&quot;&gt;Fluency in German and good working proficiency in English to collaborate effectively across our international group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,8&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,8&quot;&gt;Willingness to assume corporate liability and responsibility as a registered Managing Director (leadership experience is a plus, but not required)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,10&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,10&quot;&gt;Residence in the Berlin/Brandenburg region with the requirement for regular, physical presence at our Schönefeld office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,12&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Real Responsibility:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5175 citation-end-5175&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;A genuine Managing Director role with clear rules of procedure, corporate protection (D&amp;amp;O insurance included), and direct collaboration with the group CFO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5174 citation-end-5174&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Freedom and autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; We’re a high-trust team, and you’ll be given lots of flexibility to solve problems in your own way — with plenty of help from the team when you need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum bureaucracy:&lt;/strong&gt; We don’t like to get bogged down with meetings and red tape. We like to be efficient and keep momentum steady &amp;amp; sustainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Small &amp;amp; friendly team:&lt;/strong&gt; We help each other out, have fun, and joke around.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our network:&lt;/strong&gt; We are a community of entrepreneurial SaaS professionals that regularly exchange ideas, knowledge, learning&amp;nbsp; and expertise with each other internally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible time off:&lt;/strong&gt; We want you to recharge your batteries when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t just simply offer you to “take a job with us” but rather to “join us on this journey” &lt;em&gt;to build the world&#39;s largest platform of independent SaaS companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sounds like something you’re up for? Feel free to apply even if you don’t check all these boxes. We believe in the power of diversity and fresh perspectives to spice up our team. Your application might just be the missing ingredient!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;—&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;saas.group is committed to creating a diverse and inclusive workplace. We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. If you&#39;re passionate about working with a team that values innovation, excellence, and fairness, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe in fair and transparent pay. Salary ranges at saas.group are location-adjusted, targeting local market medians for a remote-first environment, and will be shared with our potential future employees in writing before your first interview - so you have everything you need to evaluate the opportunity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Solutions Engineer UAS / Aviation who will play a pivotal role in the future of our company. Our Solutions Engineer will be responsible for the integration, validation, and operational readiness of Auterion-powered drone systems. You’ll collaborate closely with the production team, as well hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, and operations while ensuring that every platform transitions successfully from a physical airframe into a fully validated flying robot ready for deployment. This role is ideal for someone who lives and breathes drone technology and enjoys bridging the gap between hardware, firmware, and real-world flight performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate in a highly hands-on environment with evolving system requirements, rapidly iterating across hardware and software integration challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform firmware flashing and configuration using PX4 and/or other autopilot&amp;nbsp; ecosystems, including sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and system bring-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute End-of-Line (EoL) software validation and functional testing to ensure production readiness and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct payload and camera load-seat testing, validating integration stability and operational performance under real-world conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot embedded system issues spanning firmware, communication interfaces, sensors, and hardware-software interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently to diagnose integration and flight-readiness issues while collaborating closely with engineering and manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to validation workflows for complete UAV systems, including components, integrated features, and operational flight configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support full-stack drone integration activities across hardware, embedded firmware, and flight software layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve complex integration and reliability challenges involving sensors, flight controllers, communication protocols, and power systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable impact on product quality, manufacturing throughput, and deployment readiness through improved validation and testing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, operations, and QC engineering to accelerate batch validation and reduce EoL cycle times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with external vendors and equipment providers to support testing infrastructure, hardware integration, and operational readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in hands-on flight testing activities to validate platform stability, safety, and mission performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Sc. in Aviation Technology, Robotics, Embedded Systems, Electrical Engineering, or related field (M.Sc. optional)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with Autopilot, Mission planning and navigation Software, including firmware flashing, configuration, and flight validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical foundation in embedded systems, firmware debugging, and hardware-software integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in C/C++ and/or MAVLink communication protocols or equivalent Datalink protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UAV sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and flight controller configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Linux-based development and debugging environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UAV flight testing, system validation, and troubleshooting in real-world operational environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of drone manufacturing, QC processes, and End-of-Line testing methodologies is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills when working with cross-functional engineering and operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently in fast-paced environments with evolving technical challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for drone technology and a hands-on engineering mindset focused on building reliable flying systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About CreativeX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CreativeX is B2B SaaS technology platform that helps global marketing teams make smarter creative decisions and elevate creative expression through the clarity of data. Our technology powers creative decision-making at some of the biggest brands in the world, including Google, Unilever, Pepsi, Bayer, Mondelez, Heineken, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use computer vision and other machine learning techniques to extract creative data from our client&#39;s digital advertising copy and transform those previously dark signals into a standardised data model at industrial scale. This creates a new, unique and powerful first party data set that represents the last and most impactful untapped reservoir of advertising performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s because multiple studies have shown that the &quot;Creative&quot; itself is responsible for half of sales lift online, higher than reach, targeting, brand, &amp;amp; recency combined. But creative impact has always been the least analysed and least understood component of a complex set of marketing variables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the problem CreativeX is focussed on solving. We&#39;re an end-to-end solution to ingest, process, and analyse content at scale. We help brands isolate creative elements so they can be analysed against downstream ad impact metrics, from clickthrough rates to brand lift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our objective is to help marketing organisations power every creative decision with data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Design Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Designer, you&#39;ll help shape the next generation of the CreativeX platform, taking problems from discovery through to shipped experiences across defined areas of the product. You&#39;ll be the design lead in a product trio alongside a Product Manager and an Engineering Lead, owning whether users want what we build and whether they can figure out how to use it, while sharing discovery, outcomes and trade-offs with your partners. CreativeX is a complex product with rich data, multiple user types and increasingly sophisticated AI capabilities, and as AI increases the volume and speed of creative production, you&#39;ll make that complexity work for marketers, helping them measure performance fast, find the patterns behind what&#39;s working and see whether their full set of ads is delivering the strategy. Our roadmap is framed as problems to solve, not screens to make, so we expect you to bring a point of view. Product Design is a small, hands-on team in a scale-up: you&#39;ll be trusted with real ownership early, and this hire is an important step in growing the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own design for defined product areas, from understanding the problem through to working with Product and Engineering to ship the right experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get close to marketers and creative teams through customer conversations, research and usability testing, using what you learn to inform design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering in discovery to validate real problems, challenge assumptions and make sensible trade-offs between customer value, business needs and technical constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn creative data, insights and AI-powered capabilities into intuitive workflows, dashboards and decision-making tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for the platform, not just the feature, building on existing patterns and connecting experiences across CreativeX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use and extend our design system, creating and documenting patterns and components so they&#39;re implemented consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the quality bar through strong interaction and visual design craft, and by giving and receiving feedback in critiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn from what you ship, using customer feedback, product data and research to improve the experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In your first 90 days&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn the CreativeX platform, our customers and our design system, and work as the design lead in your product trio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of a defined product area and ship, or get build-ready, your first piece of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our AI-powered product work and add to or improve patterns in our design system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join customer conversations and use what you hear to shape your design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In your first year&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own design for one or more product areas, taking work from discovery through to launch with little direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship work you can point to, using customer feedback and product data to show whether it solved the problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build out new parts of our design system and make the product feel more coherent across areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how design works at CreativeX as the team grows, including supporting newer designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of product design experience, with a portfolio that shows how you framed problems, explored options, made trade-offs and learned from what shipped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interaction and visual design craft, confident in Figma, prototyping and design systems, and familiar with Slack and Linear&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using research, usability testing and customer feedback to inform design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems mindset and the ability to make complex information, workflows and data easy to understand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, collaborative communication: you challenge ideas constructively, take feedback well and know when to ship and learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with Product and Engineering in a product trio or small team, with real ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/em&gt; B2B SaaS, data-heavy or analytics products; marketing, advertising or martech; AI-powered products; mentoring junior designers; scale-up experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CreativeX, we encourage applicants of all backgrounds and identities to apply for roles that align with their own interests and career trajectory. If you fit the description above and see yourself in this role, we would love to see your application! &lt;em&gt;Unfortunately, we are unable to offer visa sponsorship at this time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎 Private Medical Insurance and Health Cash Plan&lt;br&gt;✈️ Generous time off + bank holidays&lt;br&gt;📚 Education budget to be used for individual learning experiences or grouped with your team for joint learning&lt;br&gt;🧘 Annual subscription to Calm and Headspace for your mental wellbeing&lt;br&gt;🎟 Monthly coaching to talk to a trained professional about career goals, relationships, and personal development&lt;br&gt;💵 Competitive salary including stock options, as we believe that everyone should have a stake in the business&lt;br&gt;🍼 4-month full pay parenting leave for all employees who have been with the company for one (1) year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CreativeX provides equal employment opportunities for all applicants and employees.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure workplace, CreativeX conducts standard right to work and background checks on all potential employees. This process is designed to verify the accuracy of information provided by candidates and to ensure a safe environment for all employees. Background checks are conducted via a secure third party application and in compliance with all applicable laws and regulations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London or Bristol, UK (hybrid, three days a week in the office, with travel to client sites as required)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Solutions Architect TL2&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Commercial&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; £94,000 – £117,000 + discretionary bonus&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Head of Client Solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; This role requires an existing right to work in the UK. We can’t offer visa sponsorship, but we review sponsorship role by role, so keep an eye on our careers site for future opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About Kaluza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Pre-Sales Solutions Architect, you’ll sit at the intersection of technology and commercial strategy, shaping how prospective clients understand, adopt and succeed with the Kaluza platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Pre-Sales Consultants, you’ll lead the technical side of sales engagements, from deep-dive sessions on architecture and data models, through solution design, to handing off to implementation teams at contracting. No two engagements are the same: you might support early-stage prototypes, present at client sites, or advise our Product Architecture team on emerging market needs and common integration patterns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery and solution design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery workshops to understand current and target architectures, translate complex requirements into solution designs, and define each client’s “to-be” architecture and integration patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimate and hand off:&lt;/strong&gt; Estimate work packages so implementation programmes are set up for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tenders and proposals:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical input into tender responses and proposals, and deliver compelling technical presentations with product and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proof of concept:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Pre-Sales Engineering to shape and design proof-of-concept exercises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the bridge between market demand and our engineering teams, so client needs shape the roadmap and proposed solutions align with core platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurable outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Advise clients on achieving measurable business outcomes through a data-driven approach, and help quantify the value of the platform in commercial conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a technologist with a strong focus on business outcomes, comfortable running deep technical sessions with architects and setting out a clear strategic vision to C-suite stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally, you’ll have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering complex enterprise software implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience architecting and building systems, including some of: solutions on AWS, finance and billing platforms, and API technologies such as GraphQL and webhooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated energy retail, particularly billing, metering and settlements systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills, able to distil complex concepts into clear, persuasive messages for a wide range of stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-centric, analytical approach, focused on solving the right problems and using data to measure success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity in a fast-paced environment, managing multiple workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation from the role technology plays in the global energy transition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience architecting SaaS solutions in the energy industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing large-scale, impactful software systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or for a large energy retailer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Five values guide how we work at Kaluza:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win:&lt;/strong&gt; Collective pride in decarbonising energy at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the real problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Cutting through complexity to focus on real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistency, transparency and doing what we say.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off and family:&lt;/strong&gt; 26 days’ holiday, plus flexible bank holidays (an extra 8 days to take whenever you like) and 26 weeks’ full pay for new parents, with no qualifying service period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and security:&lt;/strong&gt; Private medical insurance with virtual GP, life assurance, pension scheme, free mortgage advice and eye tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay and flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, a Flex Fund of 5% [of salary] to spend on the benefits you want most, retail discounts through Perks at Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and setup:&lt;/strong&gt; Personal learning budget, home office budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Climate:&lt;/strong&gt; Furthr, our climate action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Come as you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to meet people from all walks of life. The more inclusive we are, the better our work will be, and we recognise talent on merit and potential. If you’re excited about the role but don’t tick every box, we’d still love to hear from you. If you need any adjustments during the process, just let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, or read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt;Applicant Data Protection Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bristol, UK (hybrid, three days a week in the office)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Staff Engineer (TL2)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Security Engineering, within the Cyber Security squad&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; £105,600 – £132,000 + discretionary bonus&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Senior Software Engineering Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role requires an existing right to work in &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;the UK&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;. We can’t offer visa sponsorship, but we review sponsorship role by role, so keep an eye on our careers site for future opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About Kaluza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join the Security Engineering team, working alongside our cyber security leadership, architecture team and technical leaders across engineering. Our mission is to equip teams to build and innovate while upholding security best practice and protecting client data in the highly regulated energy sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate security tooling and use AI to prevent, detect and respond to emerging threats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior technical leadership to shape our technical strategy and solutions architecture, so security, risk and compliance feed into technical decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help product teams deliver secure systems quickly by building a strong security culture through mentoring, design reviews and training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give product and engineering teams practical guidance on identifying, prioritising and mitigating systemic risks and vulnerabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evolution of our security best practice across application development and the wider SDLC, supporting teams with expert advice and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence technical and non-technical stakeholders across Kaluza and client teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and coach security and software engineers to balance risk with speed and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with third-party security vendors and industry bodies to keep us at the forefront of emerging practices, tooling and standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally, you’ll have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience mentoring engineers and collaborating closely (e.g. pairing, swarming)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of software security flaws and web application security best practice (OWASP Top 10, CWE/SANS Top 25)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of CI/CD and DevOps principles, and their security considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying AI in your own work and helping others build it safely into how they develop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting skills and first-hand experience of software development at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Okta or equivalent, to enable workforce identity and enforce access management policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of AWS and/or GCP security best practice, and some experience with infrastructure as code (e.g. Terraform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying architectural and software design patterns in a complex environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic, risk-based decision-maker who weighs the technical and commercial consequences of your choices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at influencing upwards and outwards, with great communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to set a clear vision for large-scale technical direction and align multiple teams behind it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen to drive compliance and NFR improvements that balance information security and commercial goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Committed to a culture of learning and improvement, and willing to challenge engineering leadership to support it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills (SFIA):&lt;/strong&gt; We use the &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org&quot;&gt;SFIA framework&lt;/a&gt; to assess and develop our security engineers. Levels run from 1 to 7.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level 6:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/systems-design&quot;&gt;Systems design&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level 5:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/information-security&quot;&gt;Information security&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/specialist-advice&quot;&gt;specialist advice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/systems-software-lifecycle-engineering&quot;&gt;systems development lifecycle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/solution-architecture&quot;&gt;solution architecture&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/emerging-technology-monitoring&quot;&gt;emerging technology monitoring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level 4:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/information-assurance&quot;&gt;Information assurance&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/information-and-data-compliance&quot;&gt;information and data compliance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/identity-and-access-management&quot;&gt;Identity and access management&lt;/a&gt; (Level 5), &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/programming-software-development&quot;&gt;software development&lt;/a&gt; (Level 6), &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/learning-delivery&quot;&gt;learning delivery&lt;/a&gt; (Level 3), and &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/information-assurance&quot;&gt;information assurance&lt;/a&gt; stepping up to Level 5&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Five values guide how we work at Kaluza:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win:&lt;/strong&gt; Collective pride in decarbonising energy at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the real problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Cutting through complexity to focus on real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistency, transparency and doing what we say.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off and family:&lt;/strong&gt; 26 days’ holiday [plus/including bank holidays], plus 26 weeks’ full pay for new parents with no qualifying service period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and security:&lt;/strong&gt; Private medical insurance with virtual GP, life assurance, pension scheme, free mortgage advice and eye tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay and flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, a Flex Fund of 5% [of salary] to spend on the benefits you want most, retail discounts through Perks at Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and setup:&lt;/strong&gt; Personal learning budget, home office budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Climate:&lt;/strong&gt; Furthr, our climate action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Come as you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to meet people from all walks of life. The more inclusive we are, the better our work will be, and we recognise talent on merit and potential. If you’re excited about the role but don’t tick every box, we’d still love to hear from you. If you need any adjustments during the process, just let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, or read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt;Applicant Data Protection Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/hudl-2026-top-100-inspiring-workplaces?utm_medium=internal&amp;amp;utm_source=job-ad&amp;amp;utm_campaign=26_NA_talent_job-ad&amp;amp;utm_content=1org_learn-more_blog-link_learn-more_2blog_organic_3ctw&quot;&gt;Top 100 Inspiring Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Manager, HR Operations to lead our HR Operations function across Europe, Asia and LATAM. In this role, you&#39;ll translate global HR strategy into scalable programs, policies and service delivery standards while serving as a trusted advisor on complex governance and risk management across multiple international regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager, HR Operations, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategy and advisory.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll shape the roadmap for international HR operations, aligning global policy with local needs while acting as a trusted advisor to senior leaders across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead governance and compliance.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll manage end-to-end compliance across employment contracts, the employee lifecycle, global mobility, benefits, payroll and health and safety protocols across multiple countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize processes.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll leverage automation and AI to scale operational efficiency, manage vendor relationships and execute key initiatives like policy overhauls or M&amp;amp;A integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop team talent.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll directly manage our HR Operations Manager and coach the broader regional team, setting service-level standards and using metrics to showcase operational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Location&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We&#39;re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of London or Barcelona. You&#39;ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced manager.&lt;/strong&gt; You bring 10+ years of HR operations experience, including at least five years managing teams in a global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International compliance expertise.&lt;/strong&gt; You have deep working knowledge of employment law, payroll, benefits and compliance across multiple countries, with strong experience in European regions like the U.K., Spain, Italy and the Netherlands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluent.&lt;/strong&gt; You have proven experience leveraging AI tools to optimize operations and improve workflow efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process builder.&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at creating scalable, automated processes across complex regulatory landscapes while balancing hands-on execution with long-term strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaborator.&lt;/strong&gt; You build strong partnerships with Legal, Finance and IT, comfortably managing vendor negotiations and influencing senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multilingual.&lt;/strong&gt; Conversational or fluent Spanish skills are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certified professional.&lt;/strong&gt; SHRM-SCP, GPHR or equivalent certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced degree.&lt;/strong&gt; Master&#39;s degree in HR, Business or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time above any required statutory leave, company-wide holidays and timeout (meeting-free) days, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing. &lt;/strong&gt;Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you&#39;re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time, company-wide holidays and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too. Plus, every five years, we give you a paid sabbatical to unplug and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy.&lt;/strong&gt; We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re always investing in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech stack and hardware to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take care of your mental and physical health.&lt;/strong&gt; Medical plans tailored for you and your family—including vision, dental, and fertility benefits—and stay supported with our EAP and Employee Resource Groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to your 401(K).&lt;/strong&gt; Yep, that&#39;s free money. We&#39;ll match up to 4% of your own contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will also be eligible for a long-term incentive (LTI) award. Any bonuses awarded are based on individual and company performance paid at Hudl&#39;s discretion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£75,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£125,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Level Up Your Career with Zynga!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zynga, we bring people together through the power of play. As a global leader in interactive entertainment and a proud label of Take-Two Interactive, our games have been downloaded over 6 billion times—connecting players in 175+ countries through fun, strategy, and a little friendly competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From thrilling casino spins to epic strategy battles, mind-bending puzzles, and social word challenges, our diverse game portfolio has something for everyone. Fan-favorites and latest hits include FarmVille™, Words With Friends™, Zynga Poker™, Game of Thrones Slots Casino™, Wizard of Oz Slots™, Hit it Rich! Slots™, Wonka Slots™, Top Eleven™, Toon Blast™, Empires &amp;amp; Puzzles™, Merge Dragons!™, CSR Racing™, Harry Potter: Puzzles &amp;amp; Spells™, Match Factory™, and Color Block Jam™—plus many more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2007 and headquartered in California, our teams span North America, Europe, and Asia, working together to craft unforgettable gaming experiences. Whether you&#39;re spinning, strategizing, matching, or competing, Zynga is where fun meets innovation—and where you can take your career to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the play!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager to join us at NaturalMotion to help build a new, unannounced mobile free-to-play action game.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace a hybrid work environment. Within this role, you would work 2 days per week in our London office and the remaining days at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with a multi-disciplined team (Design, Art, Programming &amp;amp; Analytics) to design, scope and implement core features that result in an outstanding gameplay experience for our players and positively inflect metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage the live operations schedule, ensuring best-in-class execution. Emphasis on attention to detail, proactive communication, and measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the leadership team in defining and iterating upon the game’s business strategy to build a robust product roadmap for development and post-launch live content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive user and competitive research, champion the usage of core innovative game technology, and ensure that product decisions are based on in-depth data analysis and an understanding of the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively across different business divisions, including release operations, user acquisition, legal, and other stakeholders, given the use of an established Take-Two IP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively champion product vision &amp;amp; strategy, monitor product progression through completion of milestones and partner with other parts of the organisation including Central Analytics and Product Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build knowledge and understanding of data driven insights within the rest of the team through regular communication about relevant dashboards and reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an independent, self-starter capable of driving projects forward autonomously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Management experience in free-to-play game development, with a proven track record in managing live operations and executing best-in-class practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong passion for and in-depth knowledge of mid-core games, specifically within the action, shooter, or RPG genres.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working effectively with various cross-functional stakeholders (e.g., release operations, user acquisition, legal).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work independently as a self-starter, owning features and schedules without requiring direct reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create wire-frames, product specifications and white papers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional data analysis skills, coupled with advanced Excel and SQL proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills and ability to present work to executive staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding written and oral communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational and analytical skills, as well as excellent attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to provide clear direction, set measurable goals and give insight on industry trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience with new game development through to worldwide launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with shipping/managing games on multiple platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and discretionary annual bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday, plus bank holidays &amp;amp; 2 paid personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months fully paid maternity/adoption leave and 16 weeks fully paid paternity leave (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan, with a double matching employer contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical &amp;amp; dental insurance and healthcare cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance, personal accident insurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and neurodiversity support programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Employee Stock Purchase Plan (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness reimbursement plan, worth £600 per annum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly happy hours, seasonal parties and monthly social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual rail season ticket advance and cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;#LI-GB1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at ----- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Level Up Your Career with Zynga!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zynga, we bring people together through the power of play. As a global leader in interactive entertainment and a proud label of Take-Two Interactive, our games have been downloaded over 6 billion times—connecting players in 175+ countries through fun, strategy, and a little friendly competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From thrilling casino spins to epic strategy battles, mind-bending puzzles, and social word challenges, our diverse game portfolio has something for everyone. Fan-favorites and latest hits include FarmVille™, Words With Friends™, Zynga Poker™, Game of Thrones Slots Casino™, Wizard of Oz Slots™, Hit it Rich! Slots™, Wonka Slots™, Top Eleven™, Toon Blast™, Empires &amp;amp; Puzzles™, Merge Dragons!™, CSR Racing™, Harry Potter: Puzzles &amp;amp; Spells™, Match Factory™, and Color Block Jam™—plus many more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2007 and headquartered in California, our teams span North America, Europe, and Asia, working together to craft unforgettable gaming experiences. Whether you&#39;re spinning, strategizing, matching, or competing, Zynga is where fun meets innovation—and where you can take your career to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the play!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Producer to join us at Natural Motion to help build a new, unannounced mobile free-to-play action game.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with the game team to help steer planning and development of our core features and systems across our client frontend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace a hybrid work environment. Within this role, you would work 2 days per week in our London office and the remaining days at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for tactical planning, costing and delivery of core feature set within UX, UI and systems development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with wider game groups to ensure alignment and cohesion of cross-game team features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate to production and leadership groups on progress, risks and successes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable and foster iterative development; setting out plans that can deliver quickly with buy-in from stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will report directly to the Lead Producer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven production experience, including at least one game shipped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A conscientious Producer who prioritises team health and morale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized, with excellent communication skills - able to align multidisciplinary teams around upcoming targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly collaborative team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to identify and communicate risks as they arise to leadership groups ready with mitigation plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to showcase clear goalsetting, with feasible deliverables for cross discipline teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with JIRA, Confluence, Miro with comfortability in setting automations, workflows and repeatable processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience playing a wide variety of genres, notably in the Action RPG genre&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of UXUI pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production experience in mobile game development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and discretionary annual bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday, plus bank holidays &amp;amp; 2 paid personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months fully paid maternity/adoption leave and 16 weeks fully paid paternity leave (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan, with a double matching employer contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical &amp;amp; dental insurance and healthcare cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance, personal accident insurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and neurodiversity support programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Employee Stock Purchase Plan (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness reimbursement plan, worth £600 per annum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly happy hours, seasonal parties and monthly social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual rail season ticket advance and cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;#LI-GB1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at ----- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Journalist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weekly office requirement:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid, 2 days in office &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At GWI we’re always looking for extraordinary people who thrive on making an extraordinary impact. Right now we’re looking for a Senior Data Journalist to play a key role in our PR &amp;amp; Comms team in London. If that’s you, and making a difference gets you out of bed in the morning, keep reading. It could be the start of something, well, extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;As our Senior Data Journalist, you’ll:
&lt;p&gt;Play a pivotal role within the PR &amp;amp; Corporate Comms team, interrogating GWI data and transforming it into actionable, commercially impactful and, editorially punchy narratives. With a journalistic mindset, your work will showcase the value of GWI’s solutions across key personas, verticals and, companies to support GWI’s positioning at the forefront of AI-powered insights in an increasingly agent-driven world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things you’ll be responsible for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support proactive pitches and media enquiries with data points to strengthen the story and build trust with media partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Marketing and PR team to deliver narrative and unique view points for events through relevant formats and channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with Head of Comms, lead on the development and upkeep of industry wide data story tracking and wider press narrative trends, themes and forward features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing, GWI leaders and Insights team to identify strategic thought-leadership themes and bring them to life through compelling data stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Marketing team to support ABM and demand gen efforts for high-value prospects by transforming GWI data into bespoke insights that drive engagement and accelerate pipeline through tailored content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build bespoke data stories for high-value accounts, enabling Marketing and Revenue teams to deliver personalized campaigns and outreach that resonate with target prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver outputs including presentations, white papers, reports, podcasts, interviews, op-eds and joint deliverables with clients or partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all thought leadership demonstrates ROI for target audiences by connecting directly to their workflows and jobs-to-be-done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent GWI on global stages—at conferences, client events, panels, and round tables—as a confident and credible spokesperson.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an ambassador within GWI and occasionally as a spokesperson for press, championing the narratives we take to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;It’s also fun; shaking things up is what working for GWI is all about. You’ll need to be flexible, comfortable with continuous change, and working in a high-tempo environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What do I need to bring with me?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll need to be able to demonstrate the core skills this role requires. You don&#39;t have to tick all the boxes right away; the important thing is that you’re willing to learn. Here’s what the team will be looking for in you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert analysis and storytelling skills, with the ability to turn data into insights that directly address media enquiries and client challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability to engage diverse audiences—from research specialists to commercial leaders—always bringing the room with you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in PR strategy and media/journalist relations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and writing skills, with the confidence to deliver hour-long sessions,co-present, and field challenging questions on the spot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with quantitative research methods and mastery of GWI’s data and software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of GWI’s competitive landscape and future as the human intelligence for the AI era.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work independently, managing the end-to-end process of thought leadership creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equally important is attitude. We want people who think big (to make an impact), ask why (to find a better way), and show respect (to everyone, at every level, all the time). Those are our values, and they’re a big part of what we’re looking for in you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence the global narrative of a fast-scaling company with ambitions to define an emerging category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside senior executives and cross-functional leaders where your impact is visible at the highest levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a fast-paced, growth-oriented culture with opportunities to make your mark and grow your career as the company scales globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion 🫶&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity is fundamental to who we are—as a data company and as a workplace. Our data reflects global realities, and so must our teams. We strive to build a workforce as diverse and inclusive as the insights we deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Disability Confident employer, we welcome applications from disabled candidates and are committed to making adjustments throughout the hiring process—whether that&#39;s extra time, materials in advance or a different format, breaks, an adjusted interview format, assistive tools, or flexible scheduling. We&#39;re happy to discuss whatever would work best for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We actively encourage applications from underrepresented and marginalised communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI, you&#39;ll find a place to contribute meaningfully, grow professionally, and belong fully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/2g0akAyAlUU?si=dIgYyrKaAlNZK-NQ&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#li-hybrid&lt;br&gt;#LI-VS-1&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director of Marketing Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office requirement:&lt;/strong&gt; Minimum 2 days in the office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI we’re always looking for extraordinary people who thrive on making an extraordinary impact. Right now we’re looking for a Director of Marketing Operations to oversee the Marketing Ops team based in London. If that’s you, and making a difference gets you out of bed in the morning, keep reading. It could be the start of something, well, extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;As our Director of Marketing Operations you’ll:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the people that are the engine that improves the efficiency and performance of our Growth Marketing team. Marketing Ops at GWI is a growth engine, not a service function. Reporting to the VP Growth Marketing and as a member of our Marketing Leadership team, you’ll have real influence and be expected to identify and drive initiatives that have an impact on pipeline and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things you’ll be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading and mentoring two direct reports. You’ll own the prioritisation and delivery of the MOps roadmap, ensuring your team are working on the highest impact projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of our entire marketing tech stack, including assessing new tech, budget ownership, vendor management, and rationalising the stack when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The lead and account lifecycle. You will be responsible for lead and account scoring and ensuring actionable intent signals are surfaced to Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data governance and quality in all tooling. You’ll work closely with RevOps to ensure data is syncing seamlessly in Salesforce and Hubspot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and govern our campaign infrastructure and attribution reporting. You’ll be responsible for our measurement methodology and&amp;nbsp; ensuring we have a clear source of truth for performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with,&amp;nbsp; global marketing, revenue, product and RevOps to improve GTM operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising the Marketing &amp;amp; Revenue leadership on GTM efficiency, investment trade-offs, and improvements to our operating model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and implementing automations that measurably reduce manual work or improve conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do I need to bring with me?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable managing a modern marketing tech stack. You’ll need deep expertise in Hubspot, Salesforce and Clay and understand how to connect those tools into a broader stack including Claude, Intercom, Qualified, GA, paid media channels, SEO/GEO tooling etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a technical leader with demonstrable experience using AI to deliver meaningful outcomes in a team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a continuous improvement mindset. You proactively assess the effectiveness of current processes, propose, and implement improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong sense of ownership and can connect the dots across departments, bring people together to solve problems, and communicate the impact of activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity is fundamental to who we are—as a data company and as a workplace. Our data reflects global realities, and so must our teams. We strive to build a workforce as diverse and inclusive as the insights we deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Disability Confident employer, we welcome applications from disabled candidates and are committed to making adjustments throughout the hiring process—whether that&#39;s extra time, materials in advance or a different format, breaks, an adjusted interview format, assistive tools, or flexible scheduling. We&#39;re happy to discuss whatever would work best for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We actively encourage applications from underrepresented and marginalised communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI, you&#39;ll find a place to contribute meaningfully, grow professionally, and belong fully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/2g0akAyAlUU?si=dIgYyrKaAlNZK-NQ&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#li-hybrid&lt;br&gt;#LI-VS01&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The extraordinary AlphaSense Sales team is split into two parts: Financial Services and Corporates. The Financial Services Sales Team focuses on sales to hedge funds, asset management, investment banking, and private equity. Our Corporate Sales Team is verticalized with a focus on the Fortune 1000 in the subsequent sectors: Life Sciences, Technology, Media, and Telecom, Energy and Industrials, Consulting, and Consumer Packaged Goods. Both the Financial Services and Corporate sales teams have Enterprise and Mid-Market sales professionals, and there is an additional corporate team of sales professionals focused exclusively on Investor Relations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial, driven and accomplished new business sales professional to join our growing Corporate Sales team focused on selling top Fortune 1000 companies. This is an opportunity to join a high growth company and sell an award winning product that is experiencing rapid adoption across all industry verticals. The person in this role will make a significant contribution in the company’s growth and future success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An Accomplished Sales Professional who is open to sell into Corporate industry markets which could include Life Science, Technology Media and Telecoms, Professional Services, CPG or the Energy and Industrial verticals. You perceive Sales as both an art and science, and clearly can articulate your version of the ‘science of sales’;&amp;nbsp; what activity leads to success and ultimately what you need to do to consistently hit your targets. Whether the activity is; pipeline building, managing a heavy volume of product trials, or spearheading a complex discussion. Ideally we would like to see you have gained these skills through experience in SaaS sales, preferably focused on financial information and/or research solutions (not a must-have)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hard-working and possess a ‘never give up’ attitude: We have a highly motivated team and an accomplished culture. We look for people who possess a natural tenacity and desire to succeed. You set the example for work ethic, forward-thinking, enthusiasm, and commitment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectually Curious: You know the right questions to ask and how to uncover business challenges at all levels of an organization from Analysts to C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coachable. You will have the opportunity to advance your career through robust training and development programs at AlphaSense. An openness to feedback and desire for constant improvement is key to success here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Proficient Communicator: You have the skills necessary to explain complex financial data and concepts to a non-financial audience -- and you are comfortable doing this virtually via video, via phone and/or in writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable about the personas we sell into. (Our product is sold enterprise-wide, but we have particular success within; Corporate Strategy, Market Intelligence, Business Development, M&amp;amp;A, Investor Relations and research-related functions.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cold call, prospect, conduct frequent technical demonstrations and in a full 360 Sales role, targeting corporate&amp;nbsp; intelligence departments selling into the Corporate vertical markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research opportunities, prospect, initiate discussions, build relationships, conduct demos, oversee product trials, and most importantly, &lt;strong&gt;close deals! &lt;/strong&gt;This is an end-to-end new business sales role and no task is too small or too large.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accurately and develop the necessary pipeline to meet/exceed quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our Product Specialist team during trials to ensure client commitment and ultimate purchase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and distribute product feedback from clients and prospects to the sales and product teams to help us continually enhance our product offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

