&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy more than 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity—innovating at the intersection of intelligence, imagination and influence, with experts across advertising, sports &amp;amp; entertainment, PR &amp;amp; social, consulting, and health collaborating seamlessly across more than 120 offices spanning 90 countries. Ogilvy was named &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-brings-home-network-year-2026-cannes-lions-international-festival-creativity&quot;&gt;Network of the Year&lt;/a&gt; at the 2026 Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-4th-straight-year&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e2c78315-ff05-4544-925f-9288319dea2c&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC for the fourth consecutive year, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;39833259-880d-4fd8-930f-0d84b1c14850&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;735e393e-6e8a-4ca8-804a-74f1bd8166b6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ogilvy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d10960ce-761b-48c5-81d5-0a7c4cc6013a&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;92ffcb70-6ca7-4d9a-88d5-c130e36e6c4f&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;3bd2010d-00a2-401b-8cfb-7e8c24deac52&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Account Director&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;Corpsumer PR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department: &lt;/strong&gt;Consumer PR &amp;amp; Influence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;London&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract Type: &lt;/strong&gt;Fixed-Term 12-Months&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Time/Part time:&lt;/strong&gt; Full Time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting into: &lt;/strong&gt;Business Director / Client Partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a talented individual to join our team as an Account Director on a large technology account. You’ll spearhead high-impact PR campaigns and run a fast-paced press office that spans both consumer and corporate remits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a natural problem solver who thrives on challenge and builds instinctive, collaborative relationships across different agency Capabilities and Crafts. Combining a deep understanding of strategy with flawless execution, you will ensure the team constantly delivers creative, quality work that moves the needle for our client.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years’ of PR experience, ideally with a “corpsumer” background&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in consumer tech and the evolving world of AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the UK media landscape and established journalist relationships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of managing fast-paced press offices and navigating complex, multi-stakeholder projects spanning consumer, corporate and policy remits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established as a trusted advisor to mid-level clients, with a strong grasp of their business context, challenges and goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural problem-solver who looks at briefs from unexpected angles and pushes for innovative ways to sell in and execute work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes ownership of large projects and is accountable for both work and process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An empowering mentor who guides junior team members, manages up effectively, and fosters a collaborative team culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially astute, with experience managing budgets, scoping work, and resource planning to hit targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with clients, becoming a trusted partner and advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage the fast-paced press office function, and projects across consumer, corporate and policy remits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end delivery of projects, from briefing, scoping and resourcing to execution and measurement, working with other Capabilities and Crafts instinctively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and maintain strong relationships with key stakeholders, including media, creators and internal client teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee a team of Account Managers and Account Executives, providing guidance and mentorship, while also acting as an escalation point to support the team in resolving issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with integrated teams across Ogilvy, including social media and influencer marketing, to spot opportunities and align on campaigns and projects, where relevant&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of creativity, collaboration, and innovation within the agency and among the account management team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the main point of contact for mid-senior clients, managing communication and expectations throughout the project lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all campaign materials, including press releases and assets, are delivered to a high standard and align with the client&#39;s messaging and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regular client meetings and status updates to review project progress and discuss any changes or adjustments needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement measurement strategies, as required, to evaluate campaign effectiveness and report on ROI to clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple projects simultaneously, balancing competing priorities and timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion inclusiveness, diversity, and equity in all aspects of work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay abreast of industry trends, ensuring a relevant and fresh approach&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we help you Thrive:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt; 25 days annual leave + 1 Volunteer Day &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bupa Healthcare&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Maternity, Adoption and Shared Parental Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a Flexible Working Model with core working hours: 10am – 4pm&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1.5:1 Matching Pension Structure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing and Health: Up to £25.00 per month towards physical or online exercise class membership, Unmind membership, LifeWorks tool and annual eye tests and development budgets and Wellbeing incentives and activities throughout the year &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season Ticket Loan and Cycle to Work Scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy, our people are at the heart of what we do: a creative agency that sparks game-changing ideas across culture and business through collaboration, integrity, and a celebration of self-expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in building powerful teams with purpose - and we relentlessly curate transformative initiatives that make our commitment to fairness, and equity a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ultimate mission is to leave a positive impact on the world, creating a better future for all, while supporting and uplifting the global communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; This is central to our mantra of Borderless Creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ogilvy is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any assistance seeking a job opportunity, or if you need reasonable accommodation with the application process, please contact us at ----- Please note that this contact is only for candidates who are requesting accommodation. Emails for other purposes, including application status requests, will not receive a response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At JetBrains, code is our passion. Ever since we started, back in 2000, we have strived to make the strongest, most effective developer tools on earth. By automating routine checks and corrections, our tools speed up production, freeing developers to grow, discover, and create.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We just unveiled JetBrains Central,&amp;nbsp; a platform for agent-driven software development that connects tools, agents, and infrastructure. It enables automated AI workflows to run, be monitored, and be managed across teams – with clear visibility into results, costs, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JetBrains Central provides three core capabilities:&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance and control: &lt;/strong&gt;Policy enforcement, identity and access management, observability, auditability, and cost attribution for agent-driven work. Some of these functionalities are already available via the &lt;a href=&quot;http://console.jetbrains.cloud/&quot;&gt;JetBrains Central Console&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent execution infrastructure:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Cloud agent runtimes and computation provisioning that allow agents to run reliably across development environments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent optimization and context:&lt;/strong&gt; Shared semantic context across repositories and projects, enabling agents to access relevant knowledge, and task routing to the most appropriate models or tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inside the Professional Services department, we are building a team of Forward Deployed Engineers to help our customers adopt AI-native development with JetBrains Central and enable JetBrains consulting partners to transform their customers’ AI-native software development lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Forward Deployed Engineer, you will work directly with early adopter customers to deploy JetBrains Central platform into complex enterprise environments and help them move from experimental AI usage to governed, scalable AI-native development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a trusted advisor to customer engineering teams and consulting partners, while also mentoring other Forward Deployed Engineers and helping with complex deployments. In this role, you will help establish best practices for enterprise AI adoption and influence how organizations implement AI-driven software development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is often a strong fit for engineers who have previously served as Principal or Staff Engineers, Heads of Engineering, CTOs, or Solutions Architects and who enjoy working directly with customers while staying deeply involved with complex technical systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines consulting, architecture, and hands-on engineering. Your work in the field will directly influence how our platform evolves and how enterprises adopt AI-driven development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work directly with the world’s most innovative companies — our client base includes 420 of the Fortune 500 — ensuring they maximize the value of their JetBrains investments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy JetBrains Central platform into enterprise development environments, CI/CD systems, and internal developer platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help organizations transition from ad-hoc AI experimentation to governed AI-native development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement enterprise AI governance, including security policies, access management, and data privacy controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable observability for AI-driven development to help organizations understand their AI usage and its impact on productivity, as well as their code-generation patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design sustainable AI adoption strategies, including usage controls and cost visibility across multiple model providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate our cloud-based agent execution layer, allowing AI agents to run securely and at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with JetBrains product teams to shape the platform based on real-world deployments and customer feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create delivery frameworks and train JetBrains partners to deliver the desired scope of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support other Forward Deployed Engineers, sharing architectural expertise and helping to scale the team’s deployment practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will thrive in this role if you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultant at heart who can communicate effectively with both engineers and technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to see the whole picture of the software development lifecycle across developer tools, infrastructure, APIs, and cloud systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced at integrating complex software systems into enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about the future of AI agents and AI-native software development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with early adopters and overcoming ambiguous technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated to mentor other engineers and contribute to building a new technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in software-related projects, ideally in a customer-facing or consulting environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Java or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or integrating developer platforms, infrastructure systems, or software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern development workflows (CI/CD, developer environments, internal developer platforms, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with customers or technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and the ability to operate in fast-evolving technical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and desire to travel to meet customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;These would be a plus, but are not blockers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with industry-specific solutions (fintech, telco, retail, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI/LLM platforms, agent frameworks, or AI-assisted development tools.&lt;br&gt;Experience in solutions engineering, consulting, or forward-deployed engineering roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the JetBrains ecosystem or developer productivity tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-KP1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent position available with a considerable portfolio of works for the next 5+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To build your career by assisting in the delivery of ‘leading edge’ engineering projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To work with a vibrant, agile and multi-functional team in delivering projects on time, safely, to budget and to the required quality standards.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To benefit from Kirby’s Career Development Programmes that will enhance your leadership capability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To work with the best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent package on offer with room for negotiations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Kirby Group Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kirby Group Engineering is an international multi-disciplinary engineering services contractor and leading provider of high-value engineering services to a number of ‘blue chip’ companies. Operating across Ireland, the UK, Europe and South Africa, Kirby has become the engineering service provider of choice in growth segments such as pharmaceuticals, data centres and power transmission and distribution. Our culture is innovative, collaborative and performance focused. The successful candidate will have the opportunity to grow and develop in a company committed to developing talent and rewarding performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Electrical QC Inspector ensures that electrical systems, components, and installations comply with safety and quality standards. The role includes conducting inspections, testing, and documenting results to verify that work meets project requirements, codes, and industry standards.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Functions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inspection of Electrical Installations:&lt;/strong&gt; Inspect electrical systems and installations during and after the construction process to ensure compliance with safety regulations, project specifications, and industry standards (e.g., NEC, IEC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Control Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor and verify electrical works for quality control, ensuring all installations adhere to engineering drawings, plans, and specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing and Verification:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform a variety of electrical tests (e.g., continuity tests, insulation resistance tests, voltage tests) to verify the functionality and safety of installed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation: &lt;/strong&gt;Maintain and complete detailed inspection records, non-conformance reports (NCRs), and testing logs. Provide feedback to supervisors and project managers regarding quality-related issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-Conformance&lt;/strong&gt; Handling: Identify and report non-conformance items, working with relevant personnel to resolve issues, ensuring corrective actions are implemented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with Site Engineers:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with engineers and contractors to resolve quality-related issues and ensure work is executed according to project specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure all electrical work is performed safely, adhering to workplace safety standards and relevant electrical codes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inspection of Materials:&lt;/strong&gt; Inspect incoming electrical materials, ensuring that components meet specified standards and quality levels before being used in installations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide feedback and suggestions for improvements in processes, materials, and quality control systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Necessary requirement of the Quality Control Inspector:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong Trade/Construction background and/or a third level qualification in Electrical/Mechanical Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 3 year’s experience in a lead/managerial position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and people skills with the ability to adapt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on own initiative is essential as well as taking direction where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in conjunction with others and be a team player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to working to the highest possible standards and delivering high quality results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in the use of MS office, BIM 360 Field Management or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Centre, Pharma or similar experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired competencies / special roles requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Electrical Testing &amp;amp; Commissioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CompEx Ex01-04 training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working on HV/MV systems. ‘Authorised person’ experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on this or opportunities based in Ireland, UK or Europe contact the&amp;nbsp;Talent Acquisition Team in Kirby Group confidentially on&amp;nbsp;+353 (0)1 454 0411 or apply in confidence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on this role, or other Construction / Engineering opportunities across Ireland, the UK, Europe, or South Africa please review our careers page (&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.kirbygroup.com/vacancies/&quot;&gt;Vacancies - Kirby Group Careers&lt;/a&gt;) or contact the Talent Acquisition Team at Kirby Group in confidence on +353 (0)1 454 0411.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Kirby Group Engineering is an equal opportunities employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive workplace and welcome applications from all suitably qualified candidates, regardless of race, gender, disability, religion, sexual orientation, or age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy more than 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity—innovating at the intersection of intelligence, imagination and influence, with experts across advertising, sports &amp;amp; entertainment, PR &amp;amp; social, consulting, and health collaborating seamlessly across more than 120 offices spanning 90 countries. Ogilvy was named &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-brings-home-network-year-2026-cannes-lions-international-festival-creativity&quot;&gt;Network of the Year&lt;/a&gt; at the 2026 Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-4th-straight-year&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e2c78315-ff05-4544-925f-9288319dea2c&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC for the fourth consecutive year, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;39833259-880d-4fd8-930f-0d84b1c14850&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;735e393e-6e8a-4ca8-804a-74f1bd8166b6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ogilvy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d10960ce-761b-48c5-81d5-0a7c4cc6013a&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;92ffcb70-6ca7-4d9a-88d5-c130e36e6c4f&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;3bd2010d-00a2-401b-8cfb-7e8c24deac52&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;page&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;layoutArea&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;column&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du hast Lust strategische Influencer-Kampagnen zu entwickeln und umzusetzen und möchtest mehr „Purpose“ mit deiner Arbeit bewirken, indem du Marken und Unternehmen strategisch mit gesellschaftlich relevanten Themen verknüpfst? Dann bist du bei uns genau richtig: „We inspire brands and people to impact the world“ – Ogilvys Vision ist es, Marken und Menschen dafür zu begeistern, die Welt zu verändern. Diese Vision treibt auch uns bei Ogilvy Public Relations an.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unsere Kommunikations-Allrounder beraten Kunden in den Bereichen Corporate, BtC und BtB Communications sowie Social Media, Influencer und Content Marketing. Was uns ausmacht: Tiefe Marken-&amp;nbsp;und Unternehmenskenntnisse, Leidenschaft für kreative Kommunikation und die Maxime “We, not me”.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zum nächstmöglichen Zeitpunkt suchen wir also &lt;strong&gt;eine:n &lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Senior Influence Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(m/w/d) &lt;/strong&gt;in Düsseldorf oder Berlin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Möglichkeit zur Arbeit im Mobile Office (drei Präsenztage vor Ort)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nutzung unseres&amp;nbsp;WPP Weiterbildungsnetzwerkes, inkl. LinkedIn Learning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung bei der privaten Altersvorsorge und die Gewährung von vermögenswirksamen Leistungen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jubiläumsprämien in Form von zusätzlichen Urlaubstagen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Möglichkeit zur Nutzung eines Job Bikes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erweiterte Betriebliche Krankenversicherung mit einem zusätzlichen Budget von bis zu 300€ im Jahr&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zugriff auf unser&amp;nbsp;Employee&amp;nbsp;Assistance Programm&amp;nbsp;TELUS Health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kostenlose Nutzung der&amp;nbsp;Headspace-App&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subventionierte&amp;nbsp;Gympass-Mitgliedschaft&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operative Steuerung unserer Influencer-Kampagnen, von der Konzeption und Umsetzung bis hin zur Überwachung und dem Projektcontrolling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entwicklung von Influencer-Strategien inklusive der Empfehlung von Zielsetzungen, Zielgruppen, Redaktionskalendern und Budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du entwickelst Strategien nicht nur, sondern setzt sie auch eigenverantwortlich und operativ selbst um – von der Konzeption bis zur täglichen Kampagnensteuerung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recherche, Aufbereitung, Präsentation und Ansprache relevanter Influencer für die Kampagnen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budgetcontrolling der Influencer-Kampagnen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abstimmung und Zusammenarbeit mit allen relevanten Stakeholdern - intern und extern - um für unsere Kund:innen passende Kampagnen zu entwickeln und umzusetzen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weiterentwicklung und Verwaltung unserer Influencer-Datenbank&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kundenbindung und -zufriedenheit sowie Qualitätssicherung der Agenturleistungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auswertung, Analyse und Reporting von Influencer-Kampagnen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was du mitbringst:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist ein Talent, möchtest den Quereinstieg wagen und hast anschauliche Beispiele uns das zu präsentieren oder du hast 3-5 Jahre Berufserfahrung im Influencer Marketing und kennst dich bestens in der deutschen Creator Szene aus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgewiesene Erfahrung in den Bereichen Konzeption, Kampagnenplanung und -durchführung, Influencer Relations, Events, Social Media und Projektmanagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Umfassende Kenntnisse und Kontakte im Bereich Influencer Relations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast eine hohe Affinität für aktuelle Trends und bist am Puls der Zeit bei cultural und social Themen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Präsentationsstärke: Fähigkeit, kreative Ideen vor internen Stakeholdern sowie bestehenden und potenziellen Neukunden sicher zu präsentieren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist Teamplayer, besitzt eine hohe Kundenorientierung und Qualitätsanspruch sind für dich selbstverständlich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute MS-Office-Kenntnisse sowie gute Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrungen mit Influencer Recherche- und Analyse-Tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir glauben an die Kraft von Diversität und Kollaboration. Den Herausforderungen der heutigen Welt können wir nur gemeinsam begegnen. Wir verpflichten uns daher, für den Job in Frage kommende Bewerber:innen ausschließlich nach ihren Fähigkeiten und grundsätzlich unabhängig von Alter, Geschlecht, ethnischer Zugehörigkeit, sexueller Orientierung, Behinderung oder Religion zu beurteilen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Das klingt nach einer spannenden Herausforderung? Sehr gut, dein Ansprechpartner Kai Schlüter&amp;nbsp;freut sich über deine Bewerbung!&lt;br&gt;Aus Gründen der Nachhaltigkeit und des Datenschutzes bitten wir darum, Bewerbungsunterlagen ausschließlich über unsere Bewerber:innenplattform Greenhouse an uns zu senden. Wir würden uns freuen, wenn auf das Mitsenden eines Fotos verzichtet würde.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy, our people are at the heart of what we do: a creative agency that sparks game-changing ideas across culture and business through collaboration, integrity, and a celebration of self-expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in building powerful teams with purpose - and we relentlessly curate transformative initiatives that make our commitment to fairness, and equity a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ultimate mission is to leave a positive impact on the world, creating a better future for all, while supporting and uplifting the global communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; This is central to our mantra of Borderless Creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ogilvy is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any assistance seeking a job opportunity, or if you need reasonable accommodation with the application process, please contact us at ----- Please note that this contact is only for candidates who are requesting accommodation. Emails for other purposes, including application status requests, will not receive a response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At JetBrains, code is our passion. Ever since we started, back in 2000, we have strived to make the strongest, most effective developer tools on earth. By automating routine checks and corrections, our tools speed up production, freeing developers to grow, discover, and create.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We just unveiled JetBrains Central,&amp;nbsp; a platform for agent-driven software development that connects tools, agents, and infrastructure. It enables automated AI workflows to run, be monitored, and be managed across teams – with clear visibility into results, costs, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JetBrains Central provides three core capabilities:&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance and control: &lt;/strong&gt;Policy enforcement, identity and access management, observability, auditability, and cost attribution for agent-driven work. Some of these functionalities are already available via the &lt;a href=&quot;http://console.jetbrains.cloud/&quot;&gt;JetBrains Central Console&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent execution infrastructure:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Cloud agent runtimes and computation provisioning that allow agents to run reliably across development environments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent optimization and context:&lt;/strong&gt; Shared semantic context across repositories and projects, enabling agents to access relevant knowledge, and task routing to the most appropriate models or tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inside the Professional Services department, we are building a team of Forward Deployed Engineers to help our customers adopt AI-native development with JetBrains Central and enable JetBrains consulting partners to transform their customers’ AI-native software development lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Forward Deployed Engineer, you will work directly with early adopter customers to deploy JetBrains Central platform into complex enterprise environments and help them move from experimental AI usage to governed, scalable AI-native development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a trusted advisor to customer engineering teams and consulting partners, while also mentoring other Forward Deployed Engineers and helping with complex deployments. In this role, you will help establish best practices for enterprise AI adoption and influence how organizations implement AI-driven software development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is often a strong fit for engineers who have previously served as Principal or Staff Engineers, Heads of Engineering, CTOs, or Solutions Architects and who enjoy working directly with customers while staying deeply involved with complex technical systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines consulting, architecture, and hands-on engineering. Your work in the field will directly influence how our platform evolves and how enterprises adopt AI-driven development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work directly with the world’s most innovative companies — our client base includes 420 of the Fortune 500 — ensuring they maximize the value of their JetBrains investments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy JetBrains Central platform into enterprise development environments, CI/CD systems, and internal developer platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help organizations transition from ad-hoc AI experimentation to governed AI-native development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement enterprise AI governance, including security policies, access management, and data privacy controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable observability for AI-driven development to help organizations understand their AI usage and its impact on productivity, as well as their code-generation patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design sustainable AI adoption strategies, including usage controls and cost visibility across multiple model providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate our cloud-based agent execution layer, allowing AI agents to run securely and at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with JetBrains product teams to shape the platform based on real-world deployments and customer feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create delivery frameworks and train JetBrains partners to deliver the desired scope of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support other Forward Deployed Engineers, sharing architectural expertise and helping to scale the team’s deployment practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will thrive in this role if you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultant at heart who can communicate effectively with both engineers and technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to see the whole picture of the software development lifecycle across developer tools, infrastructure, APIs, and cloud systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced at integrating complex software systems into enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about the future of AI agents and AI-native software development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with early adopters and overcoming ambiguous technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated to mentor other engineers and contribute to building a new technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in software-related projects, ideally in a customer-facing or consulting environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Java or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or integrating developer platforms, infrastructure systems, or software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern development workflows (CI/CD, developer environments, internal developer platforms, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with customers or technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and the ability to operate in fast-evolving technical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and desire to travel to meet customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;These would be a plus, but are not blockers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with industry-specific solutions (fintech, telco, retail, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI/LLM platforms, agent frameworks, or AI-assisted development tools.&lt;br&gt;Experience in solutions engineering, consulting, or forward-deployed engineering roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the JetBrains ecosystem or developer productivity tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-KP1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Do you care deeply about visual hierarchy, interaction details, and how a webpage feels to use? Do you believe design isn’t decoration, it’s how products communicate, guide, and solve complex problems? If you enjoy refining pixels, building coherent web systems, and eliminating friction for smart users, this is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems. Our mission is simple: make development teams more productive and AI adoptable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our web presence is often the first interaction developers and teams have with JetBrains. As software evolves, our web products and tools need to clearly communicate complex concepts while staying intuitive, accessible, and fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll take ownership of major web design initiatives across our ecosystem. Instead of applying surface polish, you’ll tackle core visual and structural challenges, building scalable design patterns, improving user journeys, and shaping how our web interfaces operate across devices. You’ll collaborate directly with product managers and developers, bringing visual clarity to complicated workflows and ensuring our web pages meet the high standards our users expect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design responsive, accessible web pages and interaction flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and evolve scalable web design systems and UI component libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex technical concepts and user requirements into intuitive visual experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with developers to ensure implementation stays true to design intent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test, iterate, and refine designs based on user feedback and real-world usage patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to structure, layout systems, and interaction details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems-thinking mindset that prioritizes consistency and scalability over isolated fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, articulate reasoning behind design decisions when collaborating with other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong self-direction and comfort taking ownership of end-to-end design initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about how users interact with web pages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating complex Web/UI/UX projects delivered from concept to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with modern design and prototyping tools like Figma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of modern web standards and responsive design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating and managing web design systems and UI component libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of designing accessible, inclusive web interfaces aligned with WCAG standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success means delivering web experiences that feel effortless, consistent, and visually refined. You’ll know you’re succeeding when complex user flows become clear, design components scale seamlessly across products, and both internal teams and end-users trust the quality of your work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like you, send us your portfolio and tell us about work you’re proud of.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-DNI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Mission Brief&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Integrated Engine Design team shapes the architecture of the Sea Level and Vacuum engines. Integrates every subsystem into one compact, reliable package, and designs, analyzes, and tests the piping and structural components that keep the engine together and performing as it should.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a Working Student, you will be contributing to the development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; and modeling of the piping system of our latest engines, including secondary lines and sensor capillaries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;. You will work and have impact on flight hardware, and will get to see your designs move from CAD to manufacturing and testing. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Model secondary lines in 3D based on fluid schematics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Prepare drawings and take the designs through the hardware approval process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Track manufacturing orders and external procurement of piping components&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Run clearance and accessibility checks within the engine&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Support with the implementation of Engineering Change Requests for active designs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Help the IED team with general CAD tasks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrolled in a bachelor’s program in Aerospace or Mechanical Engineering, or a related field, in at least your third semester.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on 3D modelling experience from internships, university projects or student teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of CAD tools, ideally Siemens NX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic, focused, and able to meet design release dates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of fluid and mechanical systems, with the ability to turn a concept into a design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication and enjoyment of collaborating with colleagues across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with piping or tubing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Knowledge about manufacturing principles and GD&amp;amp;T &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You are familiar with rocket engine fluid schematics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with engine instrumentation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible mobility budget&lt;/strong&gt;: Travel your way with a choice between a fully financed Deutschlandticket or a fuel allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport Clubs membership:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Free snacks and drinks:&lt;/strong&gt; Indulge in a variety of free snacks and beverages to keep you fuelled throughout the day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical and mental well-being:&lt;/strong&gt; Access via OpenUp the online support from certified psychologists and lifestyle experts at no cost to you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Much More!&lt;/strong&gt; Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re making rockets in a way that hasn&#39;t been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to find out more about us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.isaraerospace.com/&quot;&gt;www.isaraerospace.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Disclaimer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Mission Brief&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt;As a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt;Avionics Working Student&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt; in the Reusability Program, you &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt;support the engineering team in the preliminary design &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt;and coordination of reusability experiments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt;. Initially supporting ESA reusability studies, you translate Spectrum test insights into &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt;architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NoBreakHyphenBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt;‑&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt;level performance assessment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt;s, design constraints and development targets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot;&gt;You perform preliminary sizing of actuators, instrumentation layouts, harnessing and interface with the specialist departments (Avionics, GNC) to ensure compatibility and compliance with system constraints.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Avionics system design: design avionics architecture, constrained by mission objectives, pre-existing architecture and available components.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support program&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;level decisions by delivering structured results, trade offs, and data&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;driven recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;After familiarizing with existing architecture, interface with GNC department on system requirements, avionics system capabilities, instrumentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive ground requirements for telemetry and data processing.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Participate in data analysis and documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support rapid prototyping and testing activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Enrolled in a relevant STEM discipline (e.g. Aerospace, Electrical, Mechnical Engineering)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;More than 1 year’s experience in high-tech projects related to avionics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with avionics system and component layout and design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Good communication and teamwork skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Able to manage different tasks with different priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proficient in common CAD software (e.g. SolidWorks, Siemens NX)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Fluent in English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Participation in student groups or amateur engineering competitions (e.g. EuRoC, SAC, IREC)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;German proficiency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible mobility budget&lt;/strong&gt;: Travel your way with a choice between a fully financed Deutschlandticket or a fuel allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport Clubs membership:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Free snacks and drinks:&lt;/strong&gt; Indulge in a variety of free snacks and beverages to keep you fuelled throughout the day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical and mental well-being:&lt;/strong&gt; Access via OpenUp the online support from certified psychologists and lifestyle experts at no cost to you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Much More!&lt;/strong&gt; Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re making rockets in a way that hasn&#39;t been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to find out more about us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.isaraerospace.com/&quot;&gt;www.isaraerospace.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Disclaimer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Story&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At thinkcell, we create powerful software solutions that help professionals be more efficient and productive. Founded in 2002 and based in Berlin, our tools integrate seamlessly with Microsoft Office to help users create presentations, charts, and diagrams with ease. Our dynamic, international team values creativity, collaboration, and technical excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Working Student in our Academics team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will support the day-to-day operations and growth of thinkcell’s academic program. You will work on a broad range of tasks, from handling program requests and supporting outreach to coordinating workshops and improving processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our academic program gives students and professors free access to thinkcell and helps them develop practical skills in data visualization and storytelling. You will help us bring these opportunities to more universities, faculty members, and student clubs worldwide (find out more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.think-cell.com/en/order/academics&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;). We have big plans to grow the program significantly with the next years – and you can be apart of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support program operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Help manage our academic inbox, respond to student and faculty inquiries, and coordinate license requests, renewals, and extensions with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Review new applications&lt;/strong&gt;: Research faculty members and institutions, assess eligibility against program guidelines, and prepare responses and next steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support academic outreach&lt;/strong&gt;: Identify relevant professors and student clubs, draft personalized outreach, and follow up with existing contacts to build engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate workshops&lt;/strong&gt;: Work with student clubs and faculty to schedule workshops, organize logistics, and keep contact information up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute across the team&lt;/strong&gt;: Support ongoing projects and ad hoc tasks, taking ownership of defined activities as you gain experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be great for this position if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Studies&lt;/strong&gt;: Currently enrolled in business, computer science, or a related field, with at least two years of university studies completed – undergraduate degree is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive and comfortable working independently, with strong problem-solving skills and a keen eye for detail. Well organized, reliable, and able to prioritize tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt;: Proficient in Microsoft Office, especially Excel and PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;: Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Availability &amp;amp; Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Available for 20 hours per week, including at least two days per week at our headquarters in Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Presentation experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience creating presentations in PowerPoint is a strong plus; familiarity with thinkcell is an added advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As part of our team, you will embody and help shape the following principles that define us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Forward Thinking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We embrace change and challenge the status quo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We take pride in our work and learn from our mistakes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Customer First&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We prioritize delivering lasting value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unified Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We foster collaboration, respect, and integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strive for Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We set ambitious goals and pursue quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe in a human hiring process, every application is personally reviewed.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why is thinkcell the right place for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We empower over 1.3 million users across 35,000 companies, including top consulting firms and major global enterprises. With offices in Berlin, Munich, Denver, Boston, London, Tokyo, and Dubai, we’re a diverse team of over 240 people, committed to innovation and excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;thinkcell is more than a job – it&#39;s a chance to be part of an innovative, inclusive team that values collaboration and growth. We encourage applicants from all backgrounds to apply. Together, we can shape the future of productivity software. We can’t wait to see what you’ll bring to the team!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As (Senior) Site Financial Controller (f/m/d/x) you will be part of the Controlling and FP&amp;amp;A team responsible for Factor EU. Our Team is tasked with safeguarding and owning the financial health of the companies operating in Germany, Belgium, Netherlands, Denmark and Sweden. Specifically, they are focused on everything in and around the P&amp;amp;L. We maintain and drive a by-annual budget cycle, serve as active business partners to the operations teams, and execute an impeccable and audit-proof financial closing round each month end. The team strives for continuous improvement in all financial and operational processes and is expected to proactively move the business forward on its profitable growth trajectory. You are responsible for all things finance at our production site in Verden. The role is broad and demanding and therefore requires excellent fundamentals in operational controlling, management accounting, and financial accounting. This position reports to the Head of Finance of Factor EU. The role can be based out of the site in Verden or Hybrid, based in our offices in Berlin. If hybrid, regular visits at the site are mandatory (~20%).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your area of responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You own the weekly and monthly financial reporting for F_EU warehousing and production operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You own the month end closing cycle for the operations, starting with accruals and finishing with high quality variance analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work with the Finance team and the fulfillment teams at the site to prepare and ensure quality inventory records&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You execute the quarterly and annual business planning for both production sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You execute long-term scenario analyses and forecasting as it relates to site operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You serve as a reliable finance business partner to F_EU finance leadership, the production site leadership, site HR departments and the global production leadership.&amp;nbsp;You challenge, sensitize and support workforce staffing and compensation decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You continuously improve the processes that stand behind all aspects of F_EU operations financial reporting, budgeting and controlling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a university degree in STEM-related fields, Business Administration, Finance or Economics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have gained a minimum 3+ years of experience in a similar operations - finance controlling role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know your way around a P&amp;amp;L and are highly fluent in financial and management accounting topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong financial modeling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a great interest in operational processes and their impact on financial outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at business partnering through strong communication, organization, and a hands-on mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to solve problems in a structured and transparent way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are based out of Verden or with an ability to travel regularly via train&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deadlines do not bother you, but rather motivate you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL skills are a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior touchpoints with Adaptive and Oracle are a plus but not required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English, German is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Internal training opportunities plus a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food &amp;amp; Lifestyle: &lt;/strong&gt;Discounts on Factor_-boxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary and 30 days of vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Well-being: &lt;/strong&gt;Access to well-being initiatives, with discounted fitness offers currently being rolled out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;We’re working on introducing additional perks, including mobility support and a company pension scheme, to give our team even more flexibility and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for a challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now with your complete application documents, also without a photo and without stating specific personal characteristics such as nationality or gender if you choose to do so. German or English language certificates and documents regarding residence and work permits are welcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to hearing from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is reorganising UX to work AI-native — practitioners either go deep as platform and skills experts, or broad as generalists who move fluidly across product, design and engineering to drive experience quality and innovation. This role leads UX for our Operations organisation: the part of the business that bridges technology with physical fulfilment, procurement, quality assurance and supply chain, across every market and brand we operate in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll take over from a Director who spent two years shifting this function from reactive delivery to a high-leverage, AI-native strategic partner — including building an internal design platform, integrated with AI tooling, that other parts of the business have since adopted. You inherit that trajectory, not a finished product: some of our highest-stakes bets for 2026, including how we plan menus algorithmically at scale and how we run the internal tools that power supply-chain decision-making, are still being actively designed, not maintained.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Berlin-based, in-person leadership role. Operations is one of several major, Berlin-anchored parts of our technology organization, and regular physical presence — with peers, with your team, and in the room for cross-functional decisions — is a deliberate requirement of how we want this function led going forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX strategy and quality across four core areas of Operations: menu planning and food systems (algorithmic menu planning, ranking, demand forecasting, assortment), fulfillment (production, order management, inventory, logistics, manufacturing, supplier reliability), an internal operations-research platform that runs dozens of optimization models across the supply chain, and the technology backbone that keeps our warehouses and production sites running.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continued build-out of an AI-native design practice: extending our design system directly into AI-assisted workflows, and using that as proof that UX can lead — not just support — the company&#39;s AI-first agenda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Service design for the internal-facing tools that operators, planners and analysts depend on every day — often the least glamorous and highest-impact surface area in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent leadership for a distributed team spanning multiple geographies: hiring, career development, and consistent design-quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A seat at the Operations leadership table, partnering directly with the senior Product and Engineering leaders for the organization, and representing UX&#39;s interests in company-wide strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in UX/product design, including several years leading design for complex, operational, or B2B/enterprise-grade systems — supply chain, logistics, marketplace operations, or similar domains are a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shifting a design function from reactive delivery to strategic, AI-native practice — not just familiarity with AI tools, but experience redesigning how a team works because of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling design systems/platforms that other teams adopt, and comfort operating at the intersection of design, product and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management — this role sits at the table with senior product, engineering and exec leadership and needs to hold its own there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and unglamorous domains: this is service design for internal operators and planners, not consumer-facing polish, and the highest-value problems here are rarely the most visible ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Location &amp;amp; ways of working&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in our Berlin office, with an expectation of regular in-person presence — this is one of the small number of senior UX roles at HelloFresh where onsite leadership is a deliberate requirement rather than a preference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Reporting line&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports to HelloFresh&#39;s VP of UX, who also leads UX for two other major parts of the business and reports into senior Product leadership. UX holds a more central, cross-functional reporting line than is typical for Product or Engineering here, reflecting the company&#39;s investment in design and experience quality as a differentiator — with visible sponsorship at the executive level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a new teammate to join us on the journey of keeping HelloFresh a trusted name - someone with a passion for security and appetite for new challenges. Security Engineers work in a variety of ways to constantly iterate and improve HelloFresh’s security posture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role aims to improve the HelloFresh Security Logging &amp;amp; Monitoring Program by maturing the tools, processes and playbooks to reduce dwell time (indicators of which would be lowered MTTD&amp;amp;R).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible&lt;/strong&gt; for SOC monitoring, use-case building, triage and advisory using cloud-native SIEM platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduct&lt;/strong&gt; initial triage of security events and incidents and document progress throughout the Incident Response Lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate&lt;/strong&gt;, optimize, automate and operate modern security solutions like EDR/EPPs and conventional Firewalls, IDS/IPS, Email Security, VPN, and MDM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage&lt;/strong&gt; premium and open-source threat intel feeds to regularly sweep environments against rising APT campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prepare&lt;/strong&gt; status reports and follow up with the stakeholders through Jira and Incident Mgmt. Platform to close the remediation loop&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitate&lt;/strong&gt; efficient Incident Detection and Response in &lt;strong&gt;AWS cloud &lt;/strong&gt;and enterprise IT environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 3 years of experience working in mature SOC environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security monitoring and incident response experience in AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud SIEM &amp;amp; SOAR platforms, DDoS mitigation and preventing tools and Layer-7 Web-based perimeter security controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of network intrusion methods, network containment, segregation techniques and technologies such as Sandboxes and Intrusion Detection/Prevention Systems (ID/PS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate EDR, EPP and Device Management solutions as per best security practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decent programming skills to enable data processing, IaC and security automations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and reporting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with log analysis stacks like ElasticSearch, Splunk/SumoLogic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to working on-call in rotational shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interacting with front-end developers, designers, product managers and our teams around the world is very much part of our day-to-day, so communication skills are vital. We are looking for strong problem-solvers who can apply their engineering skills to a wide range of platforms and environments, while also acting as an ambassador to coach team members and stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a new teammate to join us on the journey of keeping HelloFresh a trusted name - someone with a passion for security and appetite for new challenges. Security Engineers work in a variety of ways to constantly iterate and improve HelloFresh’s security posture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the first port of call for responding to any of HelloFresh’s security related questions and concerns. You will also develop and deliver tools and processes to enable colleagues to achieve their goals and objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhance&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;the security posture of the enterprise IT infrastructure, services, and tools by hardening them against abuse and nefarious activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implement&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;secure configurations and policies for IAM, EDR, VPN, Firewalls, Email Security, Slack and MDM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;for security hardening and posture of enterprise IT assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adapt&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;to modern AI adoption strategy through implementing and mitigating AI controls in a variety of methods including Shadow AI, MCP integrations, and protecting against AI-based risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deploy, optimize and operate&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;modern security solutions like EDR, Zero-Trust, SSE/CASB, DLP, and Patch Management tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assist&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;in company-wide security awareness campaigns and vulnerability patching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perform&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;comparative technical and commercial analysis for various security products/tools prior to procurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience hardening workstations, network equipment, servers, IAM platforms through using CIS/NIST frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding and usage of Generative AI from a corporate perspective, including LLM guardrails, MCP connections/gateways, and risks stemming from its usage such as prompt injections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to perform malware analysis on Windows, MacOS, and Linux machines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of modern-day social engineering attacks and how to prevent them through technical controls and training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth understanding of common TCP/IP protocols and modern-day security threats on each network layer and protecting against them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and reporting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh Group reaches more than 6 million customers across 16 markets through a portfolio of 8 consumer brands — from meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to pet food and specialty products. HelloTech, our global technology division, builds the digital consumer experience across Berlin, Warsaw, and North America: the apps, the personalization, the discovery moments, and everything in between that turns food into something people genuinely look forward to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design is core to how we compete. Our Consumer UX team designs end-to-end experiences across all 8 brands, and we hold a high quality bar — internally, our “zest-appeal” framework defines design excellence from baseline usability through to best-in-class, surprise-and-delight craft. We are also moving fast to an AI-native way of working, where AI rethinks discovery, prototyping, and the path from design to code. Experience quality and innovation are leadership priorities all the way to the group president.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This year we are doubling down on craft, execution, and design leadership. In a world where it is easier than ever to get software to 75% built, it is the last 25% — the polish, the motion, the detail customers actually feel — that decides whether a consumer experience is merely useful or genuinely loved. Millions of people open our apps every week to feed themselves and their families; the final 10% is the difference between a transaction and a habit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a build-and-scale role, not a maintenance one. We are hiring a design leader to own a consumer experience domain within the Consumer mega alliance, raise the quality bar across it, grow a high-performing team, and build the design-technology and AI-native capability that turns ambitious ideas into beautifully executed, shipped products. We need a maker and a leader who leads through the work — not a strategy-only or people-management-only role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The level — Director or Senior Director — will be set by the candidate’s experience and the final scope of the domain. We are open to both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead from the front. &lt;/strong&gt;Lead, coach, and inspire a multidisciplinary team — UX, UI, content, and localization — across multiple consumer surfaces. Stay hands-on in the work: review designs, jump into critiques, and drive clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn ambiguity into clarity. &lt;/strong&gt;Solve problems from first principles, not templates. Help your team make hard decisions, focus on outcomes over process, and install just the right amount of structure and rigour to ship great work at speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set and uphold an extremely high craft bar. &lt;/strong&gt;From UX flow to polished UI — layout, typography, motion, micro-interaction, and visual storytelling. Be the design-quality amplifier who notices the details others miss and pushes work to where it needs to be, coaching the team to our quality tenets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a consumer experience domain end-to-end. &lt;/strong&gt;Take accountability for the quality and delivery of experiences across the customer journey, from problem framing to shipped product across our brands and 16 markets. Drive design excellence through every detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build design-technology capability. &lt;/strong&gt;Champion and scale our design system (Zest) and modern UI foundations. Close the gap between design and engineering through prototyping, design-to-code workflows, and component quality — making design and engineering faster together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make us AI-native. &lt;/strong&gt;Treat AI as an active part of how design gets done — accelerating discovery, generating and validating prototypes, and shortening design-to-delivery. Define the quality bar AI-assisted workflows must meet, and help the company rewrite how consumer products get built in the AI era.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner deeply with Product and Engineering. &lt;/strong&gt;Align on priorities, make tradeoffs, unblock delivery, and move fast. Advocate clearly and persistently for the right experience, and raise the ambition of the partners around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leadership. &lt;/strong&gt;A track record of leading and growing high-performing design teams in product-first, consumer (B2C) companies — hiring, coaching, and developing designers at all levels, from IC to managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High agency. &lt;/strong&gt;You thrive in ambiguous, fast-changing environments, push for the right solution rather than the convenient one, and lean in to make things happen without waiting for permission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A bias to ship. &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated success driving teams to ship great software at scale, not just making decks about it — owning execution across a product line and a portfolio of features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional craft and product taste. &lt;/strong&gt;Strong visual and interaction sensibility and a high personal bar for detail. You know what great looks like for a consumer audience, and you can help teams get there — across hierarchy, motion, and micro-interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design-technologist mindset. &lt;/strong&gt;Fluency at the design–engineering boundary: design systems, component architecture, prototyping in code or advanced tools, and a practical grasp of front-end constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native practice. &lt;/strong&gt;You already use AI across the design workflow — for insight synthesis, rapid prototyping, and design-to-code — and have a point of view on scaling it responsibly with a high quality bar. Fluency with tools like Figma, Claude, and similar is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and systems thinking. &lt;/strong&gt;Experience designing and maintaining quality across a multi-brand or multi-market consumer ecosystem, balancing consistency with brand-specific character.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your team consistently delivers high-quality consumer product work at speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hired exceptional talent and helped your existing team grow in craft and execution maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience quality in your domain is visibly higher — the last 10% is sweated, and it shows in what customers feel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product and engineering leaders love partnering with you because you unlock progress and raise the ambition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design systems and AI-native workflows in your domain make the whole team faster without sacrificing craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a key player in shaping how HelloFresh builds consumer product in the AI era — writing new playbooks, not following old ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and impact. &lt;/strong&gt;Shape experiences for 6+ million customers across 8 brands and 16 markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A craft-and-AI-first culture. &lt;/strong&gt;Leadership that champions experience quality, innovation, and AI-native ways of working from the top of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real ownership. &lt;/strong&gt;End-to-end accountability for your domain, with the autonomy to set and raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth. &lt;/strong&gt;A defined leadership track and the chance to expand scope as the alliance scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration. &lt;/strong&gt;Work with experienced product, engineering, and design partners across HelloTech’s international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Senior Workforce Capacity Planner&lt;/strong&gt; stellst du sicher, dass unsere Produktionskapazitäten und Personalressourcen optimal auf den geplanten Produktionsbedarf abgestimmt sind. Du übersetzt Produktionsvolumen und Forecasts in konkrete Produktions-, Kapazitäts- und Personalpläne und sorgst dafür, dass die richtigen Mitarbeitenden zur richtigen Zeit mit den benötigten Qualifikationen verfügbar sind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dein Schwerpunkt liegt auf der &lt;strong&gt;mittel- und kurzfristigen Produktionsplanung sowie der Personal- und Kapazitätsplanung&lt;/strong&gt;. Du erkennst frühzeitig Engpässe, bewertest unterschiedliche Planungsszenarien und entwickelst gemeinsam mit den operativen Teams Lösungen, um unsere Produktionsziele zuverlässig zu erreichen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dabei arbeitest du eng mit Production, Workforce Planning und weiteren relevanten Schnittstellen zusammen und schaffst eine belastbare Planungsgrundlage für einen effizienten Produktionsablauf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Verantwortungbereich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Produktionsplanung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du erstellst und optimierst Produktionspläne auf Basis von Forecasts und Produktionsanforderungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personalplanung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du leitest den Personalbedarf aus Produktionsvolumen, Schichtmodellen und Produktivitätskennzahlen ab und stimmst ihn mit den verfügbaren Ressourcen ab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kapazitätsplanung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du analysierst Produktionskapazitäten, erkennst Engpässe frühzeitig und entwickelst Lösungen zur optimalen Auslastung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Optimierung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du analysierst Plan-Ist-Abweichungen und entwickelst Maßnahmen zur Verbesserung der Planung und Produktivität.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zusammenarbeit:&lt;/strong&gt; Du koordinierst dich mit Production, Workforce Planning und weiteren Schnittstellen, um eine verlässliche und umsetzbare Planung sicherzustellen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5+ Jahre Erfahrung in Production Planning, Resource Planning, Scheduling oder Workforce Management, idealerweise in einem dynamischen, volumenstarken Umfeld wie Manufacturing, FMCG oder E-Commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein ausgeprägtes Verständnis für Kapazitätsplanung, Ressourcensteuerung und operative Zusammenhänge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du kannst komplexe Daten und Abhängigkeiten analysieren und daraus klare, umsetzbare Entscheidungen ableiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast eine hands-on Mentalitä&lt;strong&gt;t&lt;/strong&gt; und Freude daran, operative Herausforderungen nicht nur zu analysieren, sondern konkrete Lösungen umzusetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen Wohlfühlarbeitsplatz&lt;/strong&gt; mit einem tollen Team in Barleben bei Magdeburg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabatte auf unsere HelloFresh Kochboxen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeite&lt;/strong&gt;n durch interne Trainings sowie ein jährliches Team-Budget für Weiterbildung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein kompetitives Gehalt und ggf. Schichtzulagen &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 Tage Urlaub &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spaß bei Teamevents &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergünstigte Fitnessangebote &lt;/strong&gt;bei Urban Sports Club bzw. John Reed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiativen für das Wohlbefinden &lt;/strong&gt;durch Kooperationen mit der Headspace-App und Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Selgros Karte &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Persönliche Sicherheitsausrüstung &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Du bist auch hungrig nach mehr?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bewirb Dich jetzt mit Deinen vollständigen Bewerbungsunterlagen, gerne auch ohne Lichtbild und ohne Angabe von spezifischen Merkmalen wie Nationalität oder Geschlecht. Sprachzertifikate und Unterlagen zur Aufenthalts- und Arbeitserlaubnis können gerne mit eingereicht werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns auf Dich!&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
