&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Staff Data Scientist, you will lead and develop a high-performing data science team, translating complex business challenges into scalable analytical and machine learning solutions that drive measurable commercial outcomes across HelloFresh&#39;s brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Chippendale, Sydney (hybrid working environment) and reporting to the Director Data ANZ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop the data science team by providing technical mentorship, regular coaching, and stretch opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior stakeholders across commercial, product, and operations to shape the data science roadmap and communicate progress and outcomes clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive delivery of high-impact projects including ML models, experimentation frameworks, and analytical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain technical depth by contributing to hands-on work, including reviewing code, validating modelling approaches, and ensuring technical rigour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion best practices in experimentation (A/B testing), model development, and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and prioritise the team&#39;s roadmap, balancing strategic initiatives with BAU demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit and retain data science talent, contributing to a collaborative culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading or managing data science teams with a track record of developing talent and delivering end-to-end projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on background in Python and PySpark, with experience in Databricks or equivalent cloud-based data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with traditional data science tools and techniques, such as XGBoost and deep learning frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of A/B testing methodology and machine learning model development, validation, and production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience as a practicing data scientist capable of engaging credibly at a technical level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An influential partner capable of translating ambiguous business problems into clear data science briefs for senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mentor who values curiosity, technical rigour, and continuous improvement within a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driven by commercial impact, retention, acquisition, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with deep learning frameworks and their practical business application (desirable).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HelloFresh Academies - internal learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount - 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% off Youfoodz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Immediately available - Can wait a notice period&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent full time role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Chippendale Head Office - hybrid working environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;About The Team:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As the Senior Site Services Manager, you will lead all aspects of facilities and maintenance operations across the site, ensuring a safe, efficient, and high-performing environment. You&#39;ll oversee building and equipment maintenance, contractor and vendor relationships, budgets, and compliance, while driving continuous improvement and operational excellence. Leading a team of Facilities colleagues, you&#39;ll inspire high performance, deliver against key KPIs and objectives, and ensure the site operates to the highest standards of safety, quality, and cost-effectiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jh6prp&quot; data-start=&quot;28&quot; data-end=&quot;179&quot;&gt;Lead, motivate, and develop the Facilities &amp;amp; Maintenance team to achieve outstanding performance and help every colleague reach their full potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6lt1cq&quot; data-start=&quot;180&quot; data-end=&quot;303&quot;&gt;Oversee the day-to-day operation of site facilities, ensuring a safe, efficient, and high-performing working environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;quqzkb&quot; data-start=&quot;304&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;Manage and coordinate maintenance teams and contractors, ensuring all work is completed efficiently, safely, and to the highest standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;o6xcnk&quot; data-start=&quot;445&quot; data-end=&quot;578&quot;&gt;Act as the first point of contact for colleague queries, working closely with HR, Training, and other support teams where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17cbdgv&quot; data-start=&quot;579&quot; data-end=&quot;688&quot;&gt;Drive continuous improvement initiatives that enhance operational performance, reliability, and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xlucbk&quot; data-start=&quot;689&quot; data-end=&quot;837&quot;&gt;Lead facilities procurement activities, including tendering and RFP processes, to secure best value and effective facilities management solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ti84o8&quot; data-start=&quot;838&quot; data-end=&quot;963&quot;&gt;Implement and optimise central Building Management System (BMS) dashboards to improve visibility, control, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kollsx&quot; data-start=&quot;964&quot; data-end=&quot;1090&quot;&gt;Manage facilities and maintenance budgets, identifying opportunities to maximise value while maintaining service excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hcnu7f&quot; data-start=&quot;1091&quot; data-end=&quot;1243&quot;&gt;Build strong relationships with suppliers, evaluating contracts and negotiating commercial terms to achieve cost savings without compromising quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ekskyz&quot; data-start=&quot;1244&quot; data-end=&quot;1404&quot;&gt;Identify, investigate, and resolve operational issues, escalating complex challenges to the Facilities &amp;amp; Maintenance senior leadership team where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ky8w78&quot; data-start=&quot;1405&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot;&gt;Ensure full compliance with Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs), work instructions, and all relevant company policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6enake&quot; data-start=&quot;1527&quot; data-end=&quot;1735&quot;&gt;Champion a culture of Food Safety and Health &amp;amp; Safety, ensuring compliance with legal requirements and recognised standards, including BRCGS and ISO, while promoting a proactive approach to risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
