&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we&#39;re reinventing the way people experience grocery shopping, from planning meals to enjoying fresh, delicious food at home. Surprisingly simple, sustainable and delightful. We&#39;re looking for a Product Designer to join our Amsterdam HQ and help shape Europe&#39;s fastest-growing grocery app. If you care about making things people genuinely love and want to see your work ship fast and matter at scale, this is your place.&lt;/p&gt;
