&lt;h4&gt;Why Kimchi?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great models are raw ingredients. Kimchi is what happens when you ferment them with good engineering. We started inside CAST AI helping companies run LLMs on their own Kubernetes clusters; today we run our own coding harness on any model you pick, and we run the models underneath it ourselves.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kimchi Inference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One API line and a customer&#39;s existing client just works: DeepSeek, GLM, Kimi, MiniMax, Nemotron served serverless from our own GPU fleet (OpenAI- and Anthropic-compatible, pay per token, spend visible per user, team, and key). When control matters, the same models run on the customer&#39;s own cluster instead. Behind that one line sits the machinery you&#39;ll own: SGLang and vLLM engines, B300 nodes, a shared cluster filesystem that holds every checkpoint exactly once, KV caches riding coding traffic with heavy prefix reuse, and the benchmark harness that gates every change we ship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;em&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;edb2bdea-40e7-48f0-9485-a0bd7169c7c7&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;edb2bdea-40e7-48f0-9485-a0bd7169c7c7&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;annotation&quot;&gt;Made by Cast AI — a Miami-headquartered, globally distributed team across 34 countries that hit unicorn status in January 2026 with a $50B+ backed investment pushing its valuation past $1 billion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Throughput. Latency. Cold starts. Cost per token.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Move those four numbers in the right direction and two things happen: customers get faster, cheaper inference, and our margins improve. That&#39;s the entire thesis of this role. Every loader you tune, every scheduler decision you land, every kernel you stare at shows up in a customer&#39;s p99 and on our P&amp;amp;L. Your mandate is the inference stack&#39;s optimization, whatever it takes, and the technical direction of how we optimize it is yours to argue with data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The problem:&lt;/strong&gt; the checkpoints run 0.3-1.5 TB, and the &quot;right&quot; serving configuration depends on traffic shape, sequence-length distribution, batch dynamics, GPU SKU, memory bandwidth, and quantization tolerance, all variables that shift week to week. Most teams pick a configuration once, over-provision GPUs, and absorb the cost. We don&#39;t: we took Kimi-K3 (1.5 TB) from over an hour cold-to-serving to under twelve minutes with a shared filesystem, O_DIRECT weight loaders, and node-local JIT caches, and we&#39;re nowhere near done. Prefill/decode disaggregation and tiered KV caches are next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Python; SGLang; vLLM; TensorRT-LLM; PyTorch; fastsafetensors; CUDA-adjacent tooling; Kubernetes; virtiofs shared filesystems; ClickHouse; OpenTelemetry; Prometheus; Grafana; GitLab CI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Requirements&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built real ML systems for 5+ years, and your portfolio shows depth in inference or training infrastructure, not just model training notebooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your Python is production-grade: services, not scripts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve run vLLM, SGLang, or TensorRT-LLM for real, and you have a working mental model of why an engine performs the way it does on a given GPU.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve measured quantization regressions, not just compression ratios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-GPU and multi-node setups hold no fear: tensor and expert parallelism, collective communication, and their practical failure modes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know where the bytes live (page caches, O_DIRECT, network filesystems under terabyte-scale reads) and how fast they move.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You instrument before you optimize, and you can tell a real win from a benchmark artifact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A wide mandate excites you more than it unsettles you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve worked on LLM routing specifically: RouterBench-class evals, cost/quality/latency Pareto fronts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calibration, abstention, or conformal methods in production decision systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve run online A/B loops with drift monitoring on a model that touches real money.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push throughput. Continuous batching, chunked prefill, speculative decoding with draft models, CUDA-graph capture, and scheduler tuning across the engine&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;fleet. Find the ceiling on each GPU SKU, then raise it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cut latency. Attack TTFT and inter-token latency separately; profile to find the actual bottleneck (compute, memory bandwidth, scheduling, storage, or&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;network) and fix it, not the one you assumed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get more out of the KV cache. Hierarchical and paged attention, prefix caching on heavy-reuse coding traffic, eviction policies, quantized KV. A lot of the&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;unrealized throughput lives here, and you&#39;ll own it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kill cold starts. Weight loaders (O_DIRECT, fastsafetensors-class), JIT and compile caches, shared-filesystem read paths. A 1.5 TB checkpoint has no business&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;taking an hour to reach serving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantize without regressing quality. INT8/INT4, FP8/FP4 across weights, activations, and KV, measured on real workloads, not just perplexity benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale across nodes. Distributed inference topologies, network-aware placement, prefill/decode disaggregation, checkpointing strategies that don&#39;t bottleneck&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;on storage or interconnect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the technical direction. Decide what we benchmark, what we adopt, and what we build ourselves. Bring the team along with strong writeups and reproducible&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary (depending on the level of experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a flexible, remote-first global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a global team of cloud experts and innovators, passionate about pushing the boundaries of Kubernetes technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get quick feedback with a fast-paced workflow. Most feature projects are completed in 1 to 4 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend 10% of your work time on personal projects or self-improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning budget for professional and personal development - including access to international conferences and courses that elevate your skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual hackathon to spark new ideas and strengthen team bonds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-building budget and company events to connect with your colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equipment budget to ensure you have everything you need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra days off to help maintain a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Hiring process&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screening call with Recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring Manager interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical interview (system design)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Live coding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture Check interview with an executive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our standard hiring process, we would like to inform you that a background check may be conducted at the final stage of recruitment through our third-party provider, Checkr.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that Cast AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;em&gt;does not&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;em&gt; provide any form of visa sponsorship/work permit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Sony Music’s&lt;strong&gt; Product, Design, Engineering and Global Operations (PDEGO)&lt;/strong&gt; team is&amp;nbsp;looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer to join our Permissions Platform team&lt;/strong&gt; in our&amp;nbsp;King’s Cross London office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Engineer, you’ll collaborate with the team lead to shape the technical direction and delivery of products that empower artists and record labels around the&amp;nbsp;world. You’ll combine hands-on engineering with technical leadership, working closely&amp;nbsp;with Product, Design, and Engineering partners to turn complex needs into reliable,&amp;nbsp;scalable solutions. You’ll build performant scalable solutions, collaborate with other&amp;nbsp;engineers, and help your team deliver meaningful outcomes for our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Collaborate on the technical design and delivery of products within a&amp;nbsp;cross-functional team, connecting engineering decisions to user needs and&amp;nbsp;business priorities.&lt;br&gt;● Develop across our technology stack, writing clean, tested, maintainable code&amp;nbsp;and setting a high standard for engineering quality.&lt;br&gt;● Balance scalability, reliability, security, and performance with pragmatic&amp;nbsp;delivery.&lt;br&gt;● Partner closely with Product and Design to understand requirements, assess&amp;nbsp;trade-offs, and break complex initiatives into clear, achievable milestones.&lt;br&gt;● Participate in technical design discussions and code reviews, communicating&amp;nbsp;decisions clearly and building alignment within your team.&lt;br&gt;● Drive improvements to testing, observability, deployment practices, and&amp;nbsp;operational reliability.&lt;br&gt;● Share knowledge and contribute to a collaborative culture of continuous&amp;nbsp;learning and technical ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● You bring 8+ years of software engineering experience.&lt;br&gt;● You have a strong track record of building and delivering full-stack web&amp;nbsp;applications; we use TypeScript, React, GraphQL, and Python.&lt;br&gt;● You have experience designing microservices and APIs, with a strong&amp;nbsp;understanding of REST, HTTP, OAuth, and related standards.&lt;br&gt;● You bring strong knowledge of AWS cloud technologies and experience building&amp;nbsp;and operating reliable production services.&lt;br&gt;● You understand how to improve application performance, page load times, and&amp;nbsp;reliability.&lt;br&gt;● You champion automated testing, including unit and integration tests, and&amp;nbsp;practical engineering standards that help teams deliver confidently.&lt;br&gt;● You communicate clearly with technical and non-technical partners, explaining&amp;nbsp;complex ideas and helping teams make informed decisions.&lt;br&gt;● You’re comfortable working in an agile, product-led environment, navigating&amp;nbsp;ambiguity, and balancing longer-term technical goals with immediate priorities.&lt;br&gt;● You enjoy mentoring others and creating an environment where engineers can&amp;nbsp;contribute ideas, take ownership, and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;● A competitive salary and bonus scheme.&lt;br&gt;● Music perks, including free vinyl, gig tickets, live shows in our office, and&amp;nbsp;opportunities to skip the queue at major UK festivals.&lt;br&gt;● An office environment with breathwork, yoga, and Pilates classes; monthly craft&amp;nbsp;sessions, including perfume making, pottery, and sushi rolling; pub quizzes; and&amp;nbsp;album and single launches.&lt;br&gt;● An on-site restaurant for breakfast and lunch, plus on-site baristas across two&amp;nbsp;floors.&lt;br&gt;● Private healthcare and dental cover, with the option to include your family.&lt;br&gt;● 25 days of annual leave, plus bank holidays and our winter recess.&lt;br&gt;● Regular social activities, including drinks, running clubs, football teams, fantasy&amp;nbsp;football, gigs, and a movie club.&lt;br&gt;● Quarterly PDEGO socials, including bowling, Formula 1, karaoke, and bingo.&lt;br&gt;● Discounts across other Sony brands, including electronics and movies.&lt;br&gt;● Entertainment and dining discounts through Tastecard, NightKey, and Gourmet&amp;nbsp;Society.&lt;br&gt;● Opportunities to contribute to Sony Music’s Social Justice Fund.&lt;br&gt;● An inclusive, collaborative, global community where you can help fuel the&amp;nbsp;creative journey.&lt;br&gt;● A modern office environment designed to support productivity, creativity, and&amp;nbsp;teamwork.&lt;br&gt;● A generous pension scheme, life assurance, and income protection.&lt;br&gt;● Investment in your professional growth and development.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sony Music Entertainment, we fuel the creative journey. We’ve played a pioneering role in music history, from the first-ever music label to the invention of the flat disc record. We’ve nurtured some of music’s most iconic artists and produced some of the most influential recordings of all time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we work in more than 70 countries, supporting a diverse roster of international superstars, developing and independent artists, and visionary creators. From our position at the intersection of music, entertainment, and technology, we bring imagination and expertise to the newest products and platforms, embrace new business models, employ breakthrough tools, and provide powerful insights that help our artists push creative boundaries and reach new audiences. In everything we do, we’re committed to artistic integrity, transparency, and entrepreneurship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music Entertainment is a member of the Sony family of global companies.&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an active part of a culturally and socially diverse society, Sony Music’s aim is that our workforce is diverse and inclusive. Sony Music is an equal opportunity employer and supports workforce diversity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We employ, retain, promote and otherwise treat all employees and job applicants according to their merit, qualifications, competence and talent. We apply this policy without regard to any individual’s sex, race, religion, origin, age, sexual orientation, marital status, medical condition or disability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://tools.sonymusiccreative.com/privacy/PCP_UK.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to read our privacy policy before beginning the application process as you will need to agree to the terms of the policy before submitting your information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that applicants must be at least 18 years of age.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At NiCE, we don’t limit our challenges. We challenge our limits. Always. We’re ambitious. We’re game changers. And we play to win. We set the highest standards and execute beyond them. And if you’re like us, we can offer you the ultimate career opportunity that will light a fire within you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, What&#39;s the role all about?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Enterprise Account Executive to join our growing New Business UK&amp;amp;I Sales team, where you’ll own the creation and conversion of high-value enterprise opportunities, engage senior decision-makers, uncover strategic business challenges, and show how our solutions can deliver measurable transformation, accelerate growth, and reshape the way organisations operate across the UK&amp;amp;I market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will you make an impact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acquiring new enterprise companies from all industries within the &lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;UK&amp;amp;I region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and maintaining an effective pipeline by self-directed prospecting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing, maintaining and reviewing territory plans that outline how you will meet business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running full sales cycles from account planning &amp;amp; targeted prospecting through discovery/qualification, contract negotiation &amp;amp; close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking a consultative, value-centric approach with senior executives to map value, develop effective business cases, build ROI models and drive Digital Transformation conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating responses to RFPs/RFIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking a collaborative approach to working closely with various team members including BDRs, Presales support, Marketing, Product, Finance and Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Representing NiCE at trade fairs or events that are customary in the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing, presenting and conducting demos, presentations and customer meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using CRM effectively and consistently to track sales cycles/engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have you got what it takes?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an experienced Enterprise Sales Executive with a proven track record of success in selling SaaS within the wider Contact Center or Conversational AI environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a hunter mentality and are passionate about winning and being part of an exciting company in a hyper-growth phase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are confident navigating sales cycles with all management levels (particularly SVP/C-Level)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organization and prioritizing are at the heart of everything you do and you are disciplined and function well in a remote environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What is a salesperson without professional communication skills, and a customer-centric, personable demeanour!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can balance driving a sales cycle independently while leveraging internal resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable leveraging a partner channel to support the sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335572083&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572084&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572085&amp;quot;:4278190080,&amp;quot;469789810&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Join an ever-growing, market disrupting, global company where the teams – comprised of the best of the best – work in a fast-paced, collaborative, and creative environment! As the market leader, every day at NICE is a chance to learn and grow, and there are endless internal career opportunities across multiple roles, disciplines, domains, and locations. If you are passionate, innovative, and excited to constantly raise the bar, you may just be our next NICEr!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-ccp-border-bottom=&quot;0px none &quot; data-ccp-padding-bottom=&quot;0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335572083&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572084&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572085&amp;quot;:4278190080,&amp;quot;469789810&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335572083&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572084&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572085&amp;quot;:4278190080,&amp;quot;469789810&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;About &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Cognigy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;NiCE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Cognigy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; delivers AI that works—fast, human, and enterprise-ready. As the leading AI-first CX platform built for real-world scale, we combine Generative and Conversational AI through orchestration, tools, and enterprise systems to power Agentic AI. Backed by global CX leader &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;NiCE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;, we empower brands with AI Agents that redefine customer experiences and achieve measurable ROI—instantly, across every channel and in 100+ languages.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requisition ID: &lt;/strong&gt;10966&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting into:&lt;/strong&gt; Director Sales&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job type:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Individual contributor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About NiCE &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;NICE Ltd. (NASDAQ: NICE) software products are used by 25,000+ global businesses, including 85 of the Fortune 100 corporations, to deliver extraordinary customer experiences, fight financial crime and ensure public safety. Every day, NiCE software manages more than 120 million customer interactions and monitors 3+ billion financial transactions. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Known as an innovation powerhouse that excels in AI, cloud and digital, NiCE is consistently recognized as the market leader in its domains, with over 8,500 employees across 30+ countries. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;NiCE is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, age, sex, marital status, ancestry, neurotype, physical or mental disability, veteran status, gender identity, sexual orientation or any other category protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Summit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Summit Therapeutics Inc. is a biopharmaceutical oncology company with a mission focused on improving quality of life, increasing potential duration of life, and resolving serious unmet medical needs. At Summit, we believe in building a team of world class professionals who are passionate about this mission, and it is our people who drive this mission to reality. Summit’s core values include integrity, passion for excellence, purposeful urgency, collaboration, and our commitment to people. Our employees are truly the heart and soul of our culture, and they are invaluable in shaping our journey toward excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Summit’s team is inspired to touch and help change lives through Summit’s clinical studies in the field of oncology. Summit has multiple global Phase 3 clinical studies, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi: Phase 3 clinical study which was intended to evaluate ivonescimab combined with chemotherapy compared to placebo plus chemotherapy in patients with EGFR-mutated, locally advanced or metastatic non-squamous NSCLC who were previously treated with a 3rd generation EGFR TKI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi-3: Phase 3 clinical study which is intended to evaluate ivonescimab combined with chemotherapy compared to pembrolizumab combined with chemotherapy in patients with first-line metastatic NSCLC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi-7: Phase 3 clinical study which is intended to evaluate ivonescimab monotherapy compared to pembrolizumab monotherapy in patients with first-line metastatic NSCLC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Colorectal Cancer (CRC)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi-GI3: Phase 3 clinical study intended to evaluate ivonescimab in combination with chemotherapy compared with bevacizumab plus chemotherapy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ivonescimab is an investigational therapy not presently approved by any regulatory authority other than China’s National Medical Products Administration (NMPA). Summit is headquartered in Miami, Florida, and has additional offices in California, New Jersey, the UK, and Ireland.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Job Title: Sr. Medical Science Liaison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Location: Oxford, UK or Zug, Switzerland or Dublin, Ireland&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director, Clinical Supply Management supports the Senior Director in leading the full scope of global clinical supply chain responsibilities. The role translates functional strategy into disciplined execution across demand and supply planning, inventory management, packaging and labelling, distribution, returns and destruction, cross-border compliance, and GxP operations. Acting as a key delegate for the Senior Director, the (Associate) Director provides a layer of management for direct reports, establishes clear priorities and performance expectations, develops team capability, and drives operational excellence through standardized processes, meaningful metrics, proactive risk management, and continuous improvement. The role partners closely with Clinical Operations, Commercial, CMC, Quality, Regulatory, Finance, Legal, Procurement, Medical Affairs and Program Management, and oversees external partners including Contract Development and Manufacturing Organizations (CDMOs), IXRS providers and specialist service providers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports the Senior Director in developing functional strategy, operating plans, budgets, governance and performance objectives across global clinical supply chain activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads day-to-day execution for new and ongoing studies and products, ensuring robust forecasting, supply planning, schedule adherence, inventory optimization, global logistics and sustained GxP compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serves as a delegate for the Senior Director in cross-functional forums, governance meetings, supplier reviews and issue escalation, providing clear recommendations and ensuring timely follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages and develops direct reports, translating functional priorities into individual objectives, balancing workloads, coaching performance, supporting career development and ensuring appropriate succession and capability plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creates an effective management layer by coordinating team activities, reinforcing accountability, removing operational barriers and escalating material risks or decisions to the Senior Director.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing the Clinical Supply Management (CSM) team, the Associate Director interprets complex clinical protocols, development plans and commercial demand forecasts, working with CMC and internal and external partners to develop packaging, labelling, supply and resupply strategies, timelines and plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports the accountability of CSM team to oversee packaging, labelling, release, distribution, resupply, returns, reconciliation and destruction activities across global locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops and maintains supply project budgets, resource plans and integrated schedules, monitors performance and proactively resolves variances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages CDMO and service-provider activities from RFP and contracting support through routine operations, troubleshooting, invoicing and performance management using defined KPIs and service expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports IXRS selection, design, set-up, User Acceptance Testing (UAT), implementation and ongoing operational performance as required by IRT Management Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives operational excellence by defining standard work, governance routines, KPIs and dashboards; uses trend and root-cause analysis to improve service, quality, cost, compliance and team productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads continuous-improvement initiatives that streamline and harmonize processes, strengthen inspection readiness and embed sustainable ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports regulatory submissions, audits and inspections and ensures timely management of SOPs, change controls, deviations, investigations and CAPAs within the function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides continuity of leadership and performs other responsibilities within the function as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience, Education and Specialized Knowledge and Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc, MSc, engineering or pharmacy degree, or equivalent, with a minimum of 8+ years of progressive supply chain experience in a pharmaceutical, biotechnology or contract development and manufacturing organization (CDMO) environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading complex international clinical studies and product supply chains, with broad knowledge of regulatory and GMP requirements for IMP and commercial product packaging and supply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior people-management experience, including setting objectives, coaching performance, developing talent, delegating effectively and managing through others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate strategy into executable priorities, operating rhythms, metrics and measurable team outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational-excellence and continuous-improvement capability, including process standardization, KPI management, root-cause analysis and sustainable implementation of improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of IXRS design specifications, set-up and UAT, together with proficiency in clinical supply planning and forecasting tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project, budget, risk and resource-management skills, with the ability to manage multiple priorities while maintaining high-quality results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in outsourcing, supplier governance, negotiation and performance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, scaling or improving end-to-end product supply chains and associated business processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate as a trusted deputy to the Director, exercise sound judgement within delegated authority and escalate issues with clear options and recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident communicator able to influence all levels of the organization and build effective relationships with global colleagues, customers and suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work independently with complex global problems while fostering inclusion, collaboration, accountability and effective team leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile and resilient in a dynamic organization where priorities may change rapidly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the drug development process and applicable FDA, EMA and PMDA expectations, including GMP, GCP, Annex 13 and relevant clinical trial requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically proficient with industry-standard systems and tools and able to use technology, data and industry trends to improve efficiency and decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable of and compliant with SOPs, change controls, deviations, investigations and CAPAs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is the pay for this position&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$83,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$97,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actual compensation packages are based on several factors that are unique to each candidate, including but not limited to skill set, depth of experience, certifications, and specific work location. This may be different in other locations due to differences in the cost of labor. The total compensation package for this position may also include bonus, stock, benefits and/or other applicable variable compensation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Summit does not accept referrals from employment businesses and/or employment agencies in respect of the vacancies posted on this site. All employment businesses/agencies are required to contact Summit’s Talent Acquisition team at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- obtain prior written authorization before referring any candidates to Summit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Summit Therapeutics Inc.&amp;nbsp;is an Equal Opportunity Employer and takes pride in creating and maintaining diverse environment. We do not discriminate in recruitment, hiring, training or promotion or any other employment practices for reasons of race, color, religion, gender, national origin, age, sexual orientation, marital or veteran status, disability, or any other legally protected status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Real Chemistry, making the world a healthier place isn’t just an aspiration—it’s our everyday reality. Our drive to transform healthcare is informed by our blend of deep scientific expertise, human-centred creativity, and AI-driven insights, fostering a unique environment where innovation thrives and our people are impact-obsessed. As a global agency, we provide a full suite of services across healthcare communications and marketing to our clients, including top players in the pharmaceutical and biotech industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our #LifeatRealChem culture is rooted in our people—we believe we are best together and are committed to excellence for both our clients and colleagues. Whether you&#39;re a seasoned professional or just starting your career, if you share our passion for healthcare and connection, we invite you to explore our opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover your purpose. Embrace innovation. Experience #LifeatRealChem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Medical Writer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Senior Medical Writers&lt;/strong&gt; are responsible for driving day-to-day project delivery (with support from others) within an account in order to create outstanding medical content across a variety of therapy areas. This position is ideal for an experienced writer who has a passion for scientific and medical developments, a keen interest in AI, and who enjoys tackling new problems, interacting with clients, and mentoring internal team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scientific knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently steps into new therapeutic areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Starting to lead discussions with clients and external experts on therapy area, drivers which influence treatment decision-making and patient pathways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Helps to lead meetings and strategic discussions with clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively utilizes a broad range of AI solutions to streamline complex projects, with support from others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluates and implements AI-driven solutions to enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of projects, identifying opportunities for improvement and collaborating with team members to optimize project delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides guidance and training to team members on best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads content delivery for complex projects with supervision from senior team, delegating to AMW/MWs as needed and where appropriate to ensure timely execution to a high standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in achieving communications objectives by employing a broad range of channels and formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project development: &lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interrogates briefs from clients/internal teams and proactively flags any queries or potential issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applies critical thinking skills towards a project brief to achieve deliverables in a timely and efficient manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides a proactive, solution-focused approach towards resolving queries, and addressing feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiates discussions with Account Teams regarding potential barriers to successful project completion that may arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editorial:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops compelling narratives from complex information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structures and writes novel projects that may not have been executed previously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality control:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes responsibility for overall quality of deliverables with supervision from senior team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviews JMWs’ work for adherence to brief, client objectives and quality of writing, providing constructive feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On site: &lt;/strong&gt;Leads elements of the on-site programme across a variety of events with support from others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client liaison: &lt;/strong&gt;Leads scientific discussion with clients and external experts as appropriate to capture briefs, resolve queries, and progress scientific content development in timely and efficient manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and new business&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports development of scientific content for new therapeutic areas for new business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identifies new business opportunities with new and existing clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project management: &lt;/strong&gt;Provides timely and accurate communication to accounts team on writer hours, and project progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;: Trains/mentors junior writers on account-specific therapy area knowledge and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications and skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You should bring a strong scientific background with a degree in a scientific or medical discipline (post-graduate degree preferred). A high level of academic achievement is expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You should bring previous experience of medical writing at an MW level or above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for, and profound understanding of, healthcare, science, medicine, and the pharmaceutical industry is essential, as well as a keen interest in AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll need to be personable, articulate, and capable of nurturing relationships. Previous experience mentoring MWs and interacting regularly with clients is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Real Chemistry offers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry offers a comprehensive benefit program and perks. Learn more about our great benefits and perks at: http://www.realchemistry.com/&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is proud to be Great Place to Work®&amp;nbsp;certified; check out what our people shared about our culture and workplace on our Great Places to Work Profile&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.greatplacetowork.com%2Fcertified-company%2F7038366&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185888156%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=pwvaCn37QXkjVQ0p6u92Oz4FA4j5NQZoNJL0ffy01qs%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe we can do our best when feeling our best, which is why we’ve put together a benefits program designed to give you the support you and your family need at every stage of life. Real Chemistry offers a comprehensive benefit program and perks, tailored to your region. Globally, this includes offices in our key markets with free snacks to keep you running all day long, generous holiday and paid time off, options for private medical, dental, and vison plans, and support in saving for the future. Other perks include mental wellness coaching and support&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;access to more than 13,000 online classes with LinkedIn Learning.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Learn more about our great benefits and perks and search specific offerings in your region at:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.realchemistrybenefits.com&quot;&gt;www.realchemistrybenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;At Real Chemistry, we believe we&#39;re at our best when we&#39;re connected. Our Real Hybrid and Regional Teams (Real HART) approach is designed to foster collaboration, learning, innovation, and meaningful relationships while providing flexibility where appropriate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Because our workforce spans multiple countries, regions, and client needs, work arrangements may vary by role and location. Some positions offer hybrid or remote flexibility, while others require regular in-office presence. For example, certain teams and regions, including some of our UK operations, have office-based requirements. Your recruiter will discuss the specific expectations for the role you&#39;re pursuing during the interview process and keep you informed throughout the hiring journey.&amp;nbsp;For employees located within a one-hour commute of a Real Chemistry office, we require in-person attendance two days per week, either from a Real Chemistry office or when working onsite with clients. Employees in regions without a nearby office may work remotely and come together throughout the year for collaboration, culture-building, learning, and team connection opportunities.&amp;nbsp;While these guidelines reflect our current workplace model, we understand that everyone’s circumstances are unique. If you require additional flexibility, we welcome an open conversation with your recruiter and our HR team to discuss your needs and determine what may be possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is an Equal Opportunity employer. We continually strive to build and sustain an inclusive and equitable work environment where our employees feel empowered to leverage all they bring from their personal lived experience and professional expertise, to make our team the best in the industry. We encourage motivated and qualified applicants to apply without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, ethnic or national origin, age, physical or mental disability, genetic information, marital information, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local employment discrimination laws where Real Chemistry operates. Should you require accommodations throughout the interview process please let your recruiter know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Notice: Real Chemistry and its affiliates&#39; names are being misused by scammers through messaging services, fake websites, and apps. Do not share personal or financial information or make payments to any unverified sources claiming to be connected to Real Chemistry. We are working to stop these unauthorized activities and protect our community. Read more&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.realchemistry.com%2Fscam-alert&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185967986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=vBa1KYjD6TUHgTF3FdPRQZvM8E8WUgHZqu9yHevh1%2BI%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Real Chemistry, making the world a healthier place isn’t just an aspiration—it’s our everyday reality. Our drive to transform healthcare is informed by our blend of deep scientific expertise, human-centred creativity, and AI-driven insights, fostering a unique environment where innovation thrives and our people are impact-obsessed. As a global agency, we provide a full suite of services across healthcare communications and marketing to our clients, including top players in the pharmaceutical and biotech industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our #LifeatRealChem culture is rooted in our people—we believe we are best together and are committed to excellence for both our clients and colleagues. Whether you&#39;re a seasoned professional or just starting your career, if you share our passion for healthcare and connection, we invite you to explore our opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover your purpose. Embrace innovation. Experience #LifeatRealChem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Counsel&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing team! The right candidate will be a client service-oriented attorney who is ready to tackle new challenges at a global company that is growing very rapidly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role, based twice a week from our London office near Moorgate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who’ll Love This Job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re intuitive – you see between the lines and understand needs of clients before they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a doer – who sees issues and solves them, requiring minimal oversight to do your best work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re flexible – knowing when to lean into things to keep things moving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an authentic partner – tailoring your approach to suit a variety of audiences and collaborators to deliver the most acutely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and advise on commercial legal matters with a focus on advertising, marketing, and digital media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft and negotiate complex client and vendor commercial and licensing agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively handle legal requests as the first point of contact for client or vendor negotiations, employment concerns and general legal matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ongoing legal counsel on commercial transactions, intellectual property laws, data and privacy regulations, and applicable advertising regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Should Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Law degree and licence to practice law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agency environment - ideally in a matrixed agency across comms, advertising etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a global company across multiple regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of advertising technology, integrated marketing, market research and digital media required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SaaS and AI solutions, digital content production, influencer, and social media matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of advertising regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conversational savvy across broad business functions including marketing, HR, finance, analytics and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with intellectual property matters including copyright, trademark, and licensing matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing and clearing content for creative assets preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is proud to be Great Place to Work®&amp;nbsp;certified; check out what our people shared about our culture and workplace on our Great Places to Work Profile&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.greatplacetowork.com%2Fcertified-company%2F7038366&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185888156%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=pwvaCn37QXkjVQ0p6u92Oz4FA4j5NQZoNJL0ffy01qs%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe we can do our best when feeling our best, which is why we’ve put together a benefits program designed to give you the support you and your family need at every stage of life. Real Chemistry offers a comprehensive benefit program and perks, tailored to your region. Globally, this includes offices in our key markets with free snacks to keep you running all day long, generous holiday and paid time off, options for private medical, dental, and vison plans, and support in saving for the future. Other perks include mental wellness coaching and support&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;access to more than 13,000 online classes with LinkedIn Learning.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Learn more about our great benefits and perks and search specific offerings in your region at:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.realchemistrybenefits.com&quot;&gt;www.realchemistrybenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
