&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll drive client satisfaction, solve complex IAM challenges and influence key cybersecurity decisions. You’ll play a key role in securing digital identities, ensuring business continuity for (global) organizations across Europe, whilst shaping our services portfolio. Your knowledge will be of value to your colleagues through mentorship and the IAM industry through thought leadership. Career growth opportunities include (senior) consulting roles in all of our portfolio topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
