&lt;h3&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well-balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place, serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience, without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered more than 25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 380+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;👐 About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Revenue at Alma covers the entire customer lifecycle, from lead generation to churn. It brings together Marketing, Partnerships, Sales and Account Management, representing more than 100 talented professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Revenue Operations plays a key role in helping these teams work together around shared goals, reliable data and efficient processes. The team supports Revenue leaders in improving performance, making better decisions and scaling the organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is a permanent contract, based in Paris, with 2 days of remote work per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/basil-lizotte-aa155182&quot;&gt;Basil Lizotte&lt;/a&gt;, and work closely with Revenue teams, the Central Data Team, Ops &amp;amp; Risk, Product and Tech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Business Analyst, Revenue Operations, you will create strategic insights that help Alma&#39;s Revenue teams understand their performance, identify growth opportunities and improve their speed and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work at the intersection of data, business and strategy, turning complex questions into clear recommendations and practical tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Build reliable data foundations for Revenue&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve business-facing data models by combining relevant CRM, revenue and operational data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve and maintain existing models and contribute to reliable end-to-end data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Turn business questions into strategic insights&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse Alma&#39;s target markets, market share, market dynamics and the key drivers behind commercial wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design ad hoc tools and models to help Revenue teams answer tactical business questions and make faster decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Improve performance monitoring and revenue growth&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage dashboards, KPIs and revenue forecasts so teams and leadership can monitor business health and progress against their goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Revenue leaders in setting the right targets, understanding growth dynamics and prioritising their roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Drive data excellence across Revenue&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote data-informed ways of working across Marketing, Partnerships, Sales and Account Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Central Data Team to maintain high standards of data quality and consistency across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧰 You will work with&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SQL, Looker, LookML, Claude Code, Python, dbt, BigQuery, GCP, Rudderstack, Segment, Salesforce&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧩 About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong SQL skills and are comfortable working with large datasets, raw CRM data and revenue-related information, including Salesforce data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building business-facing data models, dashboards, forecasts or performance analyses from the initial question through to clear recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can define relevant KPIs, assess business impact and communicate complex analysis in a clear and actionable way to different stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have approximately 4 to 7 years of experience in data analysis, business analysis or a similar role, ideally in a fast-growing technology or fintech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with Looker and LookML.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable with Python and modern data tools such as dbt, BigQuery or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked with tracking tools such as Rudderstack or Segment, as well as experimentation methodologies such as A/B testing, significance testing and causal analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are curious about AI-assisted tools and are interested in using tools such as Claude Code in your daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧘 Your Alma experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The culture&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, collective intelligence is at the heart of the way we work. We are building an international company in a fast-growing environment, where people are encouraged to take ownership, share ideas and learn from one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform, regular feedback and opportunities to develop your expertise and career path. As Alma continues to grow across Europe, you will have the opportunity to work with colleagues from different teams, countries and areas of expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to building a fair and inclusive workplace. We monitor our gender equality index and remain committed to pay equity, transparency and equal opportunities across the organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The role itself&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you join Alma, you will be able to grow and have an impact by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencing strategic decisions across the full Revenue organisation, from lead generation to churn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combining analytical depth, business understanding and direct exposure to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping Revenue teams build a stronger data culture and create more efficient ways of working as Alma scales across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🤑 Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/strong&gt; based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health insurance&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt; covered by Alma, including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability insurance&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt; covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport&lt;/strong&gt;: partnerships with &lt;strong&gt;Gymlib&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;ClassPass&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;€30/month&lt;/strong&gt; reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maternity/paternity leave&lt;/strong&gt;: salary maintained at 100% during leave, with no seniority requirement. Return to work at a 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD)&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;€544.80/year&lt;/strong&gt;, excluding full-remote contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meal vouchers&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;€10/day&lt;/strong&gt;, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental health&lt;/strong&gt;: free access to the MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid time off&lt;/strong&gt;: 25 days per year, plus additional paid leave granted to employees on executive contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our &lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 weeks of full remote work possible per year&lt;/strong&gt; during the summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🎯 Interview process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video screen with Lydia a Talent Acquisition team member&lt;/strong&gt; to discuss your background, motivation and the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience interview with Basil Lizotte or/and Gaspard Zha&lt;/strong&gt;, lasting 45 minutes, to discuss the role, the team and your experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home assignment and case study&lt;/strong&gt;, lasting 1 hour, with members team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-site team fit interview&lt;/strong&gt;, lasting 30 minutes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-site N+2 interview&lt;/strong&gt; with Antoine de la Rivière, lasting 30 minutes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reference check&lt;/strong&gt; with at least two professional references.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🌍 Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work, whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Creative Fabrica&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creative Fabrica is a fast-growing AI platform that makes it easy for everyday consumers to create whatever they imagine, from images and videos to audio and 3D creations, using the latest generative AI models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We want to make it even easier for users to bring their ideas to life by providing tutorials, instructions and engaging educational episodes on our YouTube channel. That’s where you come in!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a full-time, in-office role at our Amsterdam HQ, with 30 work-from-anywhere days per year.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who LOVES creating with generative AI and loves making everyone else excited about it too! You’re already making AI movies, creating AI influencers, exploring new prompting techniques and finding creative ways to put these tools to work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be the primary face and voice of Creative Fabrica on YouTube, turning that passion into videos that inspire people and show them how to create. You’ll own the topics, scripts and presentation, supported by a YouTube Producer &amp;amp; Editor and motion designer. Together with the YouTube Producer &amp;amp; Editor, you’ll be responsible for growing the channel and our community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create with AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Build compelling examples and show viewers how to achieve effects and results they didn’t know were possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the face of the channel:&lt;/strong&gt; Be the primary face and voice of Creative Fabrica on YouTube. Present on camera, record screen demonstrations and voiceovers, and make creative tutorials engaging and easy to follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the content:&lt;/strong&gt; Set the editorial direction, choose topics and develop strong hooks, scripts and step-by-step demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide creative production:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with your dedicated YouTube Producer &amp;amp; Editor and motion designer, review edits and ensure videos are engaging, accurate and easy to follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape titles and thumbnails:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop title and thumbnail ideas with the producer/editor, who leads the packaging and briefs the graphic designer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow the channel and community:&lt;/strong&gt; Share responsibility for channel growth with your producer/editor. Engage with viewer questions and turn audience feedback and performance insights into better videos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuine passion for generative AI:&lt;/strong&gt; You already spend time creating with AI, have work to show and love discovering and sharing what these tools can do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charisma and communication skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You’re engaging on camera, explain things clearly and bring natural enthusiasm, with excellent spoken and written English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You generate ideas independently, turn them into compelling content and follow through to finished videos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YouTube familiarity:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand what makes people click and keep watching, recognize strong hooks and formats, and want to learn from performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your own YouTube channel or experience creating long-form, creator-led videos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or engaging a community around AI or creative tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We would also like to offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; On days you work in the office a warm fresh lunch will be provided for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days &lt;strong&gt;Work From Anywhere Benefit&lt;/strong&gt; per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;24&lt;/strong&gt; days of paid vacation per year + public holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Allowance&lt;/strong&gt;, if you live more than 10 KM from the office (in the form of an NS card).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company &lt;strong&gt;pension plan&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company &lt;strong&gt;events&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;overseas trips&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job-blocks&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;block-13&quot; class=&quot;text block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;body&quot; data-columns=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;article&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Is this you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-blocks&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;block-15&quot; class=&quot;vacancy-text block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;body&quot; data-columns=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;article&quot; data-medium-editor-element=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get in touch! We&#39;d love to speak to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can apply by clicking the &quot;Apply now&quot; button.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creative Fabrica is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Creative Fabrica&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creative Fabrica is a fast-growing AI platform that makes it easy for everyday consumers to create whatever they imagine, from images and videos to audio and 3D creations, using the latest generative AI models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You know that feeling when a new AI model drops and you can’t wait to create something with it? We want to make that excitement contagious. Every new model, tool and feature we launch is a chance to show people something they hadn’t imagined creating themselves. We want videos they immediately send to friends, ideas they can’t wait to try and people opening our tools because they HAVE to make something. That’s where you come in!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a full-time, in-office role at our Amsterdam HQ, with 30 work-from-anywhere days per year.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who LOVES generating videos with AI and knows how to turn a great idea into a video people can’t ignore. You’re already making AI movies, creating unexpected visual effects and refining your prompts until the result matches the idea in your head. You save videos for their brilliant execution and immediately start thinking about how you’d make something even better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll create and edit product-launch videos and original social videos designed to grab attention and get shared. Working with our launch team, you’ll turn product-marketing messages into creative concepts and storyboards, then generate the images and video sequences with AI. You’ll lead the creative direction and own the edit, obsessing over hooks, storytelling, pacing and sound just as much as the visuals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work alongside a dedicated motion designer, combining the videos you generate with AI with their animation and compositing. From shaping the first idea to generating the right shots and editing the final cut, you’ll turn our products’ capabilities into videos that make people excited to try them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the creative direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn product-marketing messages into original concepts, hooks and storyboards. Own how we bring each launch to life, making people excited about what they can create.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate videos with AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Create images, video sequences and unexpected visual effects. Choose the right tools and refine your prompts and shots until the result matches your creative vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the edit:&lt;/strong&gt; Create product-launch videos and original social videos people can’t ignore. Bring everything together through strong storytelling, pacing, music and sound, giving people a reason to watch and share.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead production:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with the launch team and brief your dedicated motion designer, combining AI-generated videos with animation and compositing. Own the work from the first concept through revisions to the final cut.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep pushing the creative:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring fresh ideas without waiting for a brief. Stay close to new AI capabilities and use audience response to sharpen your hooks, improve your videos and decide what to create next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A genuine obsession with AI video creation:&lt;/strong&gt; You’re already making AI movies, refining your techniques and getting your hands on new models and tools. You have work to show, not just an interest in the possibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative direction and marketing instincts:&lt;/strong&gt; You can turn a product message into a compelling visual story. You understand the audience, know why they should care and develop the concept yourself rather than waiting for a storyboard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent editing and visual judgment:&lt;/strong&gt; Your portfolio demonstrates strong storytelling, hooks, pacing and sound. You know how to turn AI-generated shots into a complete video, not just a collection of impressive clips.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong social video instincts:&lt;/strong&gt; You save standout videos, study why they work and see opportunities to make something original. You understand what earns attention and gives people a reason to share.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You take ideas through to finished videos, manage deadlines and communicate clearly with the launch team and motion designer, with excellent English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating product-launch videos or social campaigns for AI, technology or creative tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We would also like to offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; On days you work in the office a warm fresh lunch will be provided for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days &lt;strong&gt;Work From Anywhere Benefit&lt;/strong&gt; per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;24&lt;/strong&gt; days of paid vacation per year + public holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Allowance&lt;/strong&gt;, if you live more than 10 KM from the office (in the form of an NS card).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company &lt;strong&gt;pension plan&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company &lt;strong&gt;events&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;overseas trips&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job-blocks&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;block-13&quot; class=&quot;text block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;body&quot; data-columns=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;article&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Is this you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
