&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2693 - SVP, Data Solutions, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the SVP Data Solutions Lead, you’ll own the development and delivery of a critical new capability that enables WPP Media clients to mobilise and unlock value from their first party data in media. Sitting within the UK Data Tech &amp;amp; Analytics team, you’ll be accountable for the delivery of Data Solutions including Private data network and Open intelligence itself in the UK and work as part of a cross WPP Media group spanning DTA, Partnerships, Investment, and our Technology Solutions teams to bring this to market and onboard clients. You will serve as the face of the Data solutions to internal teams and represent the capability in client sales engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the design the delivery and roadmap for Open intelligence in the UK, managing across stakeholder groups in DTA/MMD/DTS and leadership to represent UK solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program lead the development of the Private data network and Open intelligence solutions across the UK and into global product teams to ensure UK requirements are being prioritized in the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and socalise the strategy for PDN/OI alongside Data Partnerships on the priority, roadmap and onboarding cadence of new data partners. Represent the solutions and WPP Media requirements in new partners discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Investment and Media Solutions teams to define the commercial model for Open intelligence/PDN business and how this lands in Practices and Media Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Data Strategy to create compelling marketing and training materials for PDN and Oi, socialize to client leadership community and upskill the data strategy community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support early-stage new business pitches, among agency leadership, and in client-facing meetings to represent our data solutions in the UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clear product marketing communications to internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish governance and guardrails for data solutions capabilities across media solutions, practices and commercial viability across all data solutions and touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the UK enablement strategy into clients with collaboration with the broader global and local product and solutions teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in data strategy, data partnerships, proprietary media within a media agency or related company (e.g. publisher, ad tech, client marketing org)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client direct experience in value proposition and client benefit narratives, with the ability to create contextual client benefit for WPP Media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the voice of clients for data solutions in the UK and how our local market nuances are represented and delivered through our WPP Open platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and developing monetized data solutions in media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of UK data partner landscape, data monetization models, proprietary media products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience helping set clear strategy, roadmapping, operationalizing solutions &amp;amp; organizing resources to deliver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communications style, in particular being able to translate non-technical use cases into technical requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong influencing skills, able to represent and defend your data solutions with senior clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to collaborate in cross-functional teams, and directly influence others to drive adoption of solutions and overcome upstream barriers to implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear documentation and working playbooks on how and what is PDN is currently able to support and operationalize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery focused, solutions leader with a strong technical and client leadership background that can make commercial decisions with business context at the core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SVP, Data Science Lead, CoE - Global Clients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, AI, Data, People and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wppmedia.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The UK is the largest market within the WPP Media EMEA region, with over 4,500 people employed within the WPP Media ecosystem. Marquee UK key clients include the likes of Amazon, UK Government, BT, Tesco, Coca Cola, Bayer, Dell, Unilever, M&amp;amp;S, Ford, Nestle, Mazda, Danone and Colgate. We have a bold ambition: to make WPP Media UK the undisputed leader in our industry. We are evolving our business operating model, our ways of working and placing data, technology and AI at the heart of everything we do for our people and our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ONE WPP – Vision &#39;30&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join us in shaping the future of our industry with Vision &#39;30 – our ambitious strategy to lead in the AI era. We are revolutionizing our business to unlock limitless growth opportunities for our clients and ourselves, built on four core priorities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster unprecedented levels of data collaboration across WPP and partners through WPP Open, turning every channel into a smarter opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage our AI-powered Open Intelligence solution, connecting vast data to uncover unique insights, deliver predictive performance and superior brand experiences through our globally consistent DPAM process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive true innovation by generating intelligence from trillions of privacy-by-default data points, focusing on the &#39;why&#39; behind customer behaviour to create unparalleled competitive advantages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People:&lt;/strong&gt; Developing future-ready talent involves evolving our focus from traditional media planning to strategic business outcomes, advanced technology and real-time measurable results, as AI increasingly automates media investment by 2030&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We empower ambitious experts to deliver extraordinary work by challenging ordinary thinking. If you are passionate about an AI-driven future, thrive in a collaborative and data-centric environment, and are driven to deliver unparalleled growth, we invite you to be part of our transformative journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is a single client centric company with a portfolio of go to market brands. Wavemaker, EssenceMediacom, Mindshare and T&amp;amp;P are our agency teams, these house multiple local and global clients. In addition, we have a number of client specific brands built to service specific clients. These include OpenDoor (Amazon), MFG (Google), OpenMind (Nestle), OpenConnect (BT/EE) and Media Futures Group (Google). All of these teams are supported by consistent capabilities, enterprise level tools and systems and our market leading OPEN platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Senior Vice President (SVP) is a critical, impactful leader within WPP Media, demanding deep expertise and strong leadership. They will relentlessly optimise and innovate, translating high-level strategy into actionable plans, ensuring operational excellence and robust performance. This role involves leading a large department, executing strategic initiatives whilst tackling complex problems within defined strategic boundaries. Ultimately, their strong performance and impactful decisions directly contribute to critical functional goals, supporting our objectives and competitive advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role is for Data Science across Global Clients. Provide expert oversight across statistical modelling, econometrics, machine learning, AI, forecasting, optimisation, attribution, propensity modelling and experimentation, ensuring methodologies are robust, explainable, reproducible and appropriate to the business problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership, Technical Mentoring &amp;amp; Capability Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead, mentor and develop the Data Science team, with particular emphasis on technical coaching and craft excellence. Create an environment in which data scientists can challenge methods, learn from each other, deepen their technical expertise and progress their careers. Establish and champion best practices for code, model validation, documentation, QA, version control and model governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Science Product &amp;amp; Service Portfolio Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the technical stewardship and ongoing evolution of the Data Science CoE/Hub portfolio within the Analytics &amp;amp; Data Science Menu of Services. This includes Propensity Modelling, ML driven econometrics, MTA approaches, and other advanced measurement, attribution, forecasting &amp;amp; simulation solutions. Ensure solutions remain differentiated, scalable, operationally sound and connected to client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Solution Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the Head of CoE, DTA leaders and adjacent product, data, technology and consulting teams to identify high-value opportunities for new Data Science solutions. Translate emerging techniques in AI, machine learning, econometrics and optimisation into practical, repeatable offerings that can be piloted, proven and scaled across clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Assurance &amp;amp; Delivery Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide senior technical review and challenge on complex projects, from problem framing and data requirements through modelling, validation, deployment and interpretation. Establish consistent development and QA standards so that solutions are accurate, transparent, maintainable and fit for scaled client delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional DTA Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the senior Data Science partner across the wider DTA organisation, helping Data Strategy, Client Analytics, DTA Leads, Client Enablement and technology partners understand where Data Science can create differentiated value. Bring technical expertise into complex client opportunities and connect specialist teams around the right solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client &amp;amp; Commercial Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a senior technical advisor on priority client engagements and pitches, translating complex modelling and AI approaches into clear business value. Support solution scoping, resourcing and commercialisation of Data Science projects and managed services, balancing technical ambition with delivery feasibility and client impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Community:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strong Data Science craft community across the CoE, Global Client Teams &amp;amp; partner global hubs, sharing reusable methods, code, learning and case studies. Stay current with developments in statistical science, machine learning, AI, marketing effectiveness and media technology, and turn relevant advances into practical improvements to our people, products and client solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Science Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant experience leading Data Science teams, with a track record of building strong technical capability, developing senior talent and setting a clear technical vision in a complex, matrixed organisation. Experience in the media advanced analytics space desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level understanding of statistical modelling, machine learning, AI and predictive analytics, with the depth to review, challenge and mentor technical work rather than operating solely as a people or commercial leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modelling &amp;amp; Measurement Breadth:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience across a range of methods relevant to marketing and media, such as econometrics/MMM, attribution, propensity and classification models, forecasting, optimisation, experimentation, model validation and scenario planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming &amp;amp; Data Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency in Python, R and/or SQL, with a practical understanding of reproducible analytical workflows, data pipelines, APIs, cloud data environments, version control, model QA and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Solution Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to turn technical methodologies into repeatable products or services, manage an existing solution portfolio, establish technical standards and prioritise a roadmap of enhancements and new capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Evidence of identifying and applying new techniques to real business problems, moving from experimentation to robust, scalable solutions while maintaining appropriate governance, transparency and responsible AI practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media &amp;amp; Marketing Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of how data science supports media planning, buying, measurement and optimisation, and how technical outputs translate into client business outcomes and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to act as a trusted technical partner to senior business, client and DTA stakeholders, translating complex concepts into clear choices, implications and commercial value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Commercial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience overseeing a portfolio of complex analytical projects, including scoping, resourcing, quality, risk and stakeholder expectations, with the judgement to balance innovation, scalability and commercial viability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process. Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3508 - Senior Associate, SEO, Global Client Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role exists within Mindshare Channels &amp;amp; Solutions to support a growing team, covering both SEO, CRO and Search Analysis. As an Senior SEO Account Executive, you will play a pivotal role in day-to-day support, and in some cases ownership, of client engagements, SEO process and execution on and off page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior SEO Account Executive will be required to support the growth of our offering with the help of the Account Manager and lead in management of the Senior SEO Account Executives in the team. The Senior SEO Account Executive will help to support and shape the global SEO strategy for a variety of brands across content, technical and outreach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering client performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee development and creation of organic search best practices alongside your BD. Ultimate accountability for adherence to best practice, and responsible for effective oversight of designated organic and holistic search strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create from briefs client specific search landscapes and content topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the benchmark reporting and analysis of client campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SEO copy writing and optimisation to support the content strategy for global and local teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct technical and content audits and provide recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with reporting tools to analyse performance and provide recommendations with the support of senior team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an understanding of the services we offer and how we offer them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop skill sets to become an expert in search marketing, across both paid search, programmatic, SEO and paid social media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Driving our process&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct outreach execution approach at a global level and help coordinate this in regional/local markets via the strategy agreed by SEO directors and the global client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality control deliverables with senior team members in order to confidently provide documentation to clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within a timely manner to meet client &amp;amp; internal expectations and deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspiring our people&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide Owned Media POVs for regular client updates to your manager to support campaign actions, reporting and strategies discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively communicate with your Manager, client team and client contacts regarding deadlines and delivery of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train Grads and Executives on how to effectively and execute an efficient SEO plan and how to apply best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Account Executive with tasks, providing guidance where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The candidate should have an action-based attitude and strong time management skills to best support the SEO team. The candidate should be comfortable in presenting their findings and be confident across the core pillars of SEO and have the ambition to consistently expand their skill set.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Essential Criteria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an understanding in areas of Owned Media such as SEO (websites, site analytics and mobile environments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective and efficient working style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of on page and off page SEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative thinking around content for digital&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of site analytics and SEO tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised and has a great attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in search and digital media and advertising&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language skills desired but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Desirable Criteria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building Looker Studio reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building deliverable templates for the team to utilise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3529 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Clients (12-Month Maternity Cover)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ABOUT WPP &amp;amp; OPENDOOR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP, we’re constantly reinventing the future of creativity on an ever-broader canvas, bringing together unrivalled talent, resources and skills to provide an integrated offer of communications, experience, commerce and technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the last decade, we have developed a dedicated global client practice with the mission of accelerating WPP’s impact for our largest clients by bringing them the best of WPP. Each team is custom-built around a client’s specific needs and challenges, providing easy access to the right capabilities. And that’s why we’ve built &lt;strong&gt;OpenDoor &lt;/strong&gt;for&lt;strong&gt; Amazon&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenDoor&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique integration of the best of WPP and Amazon – building on their respective strengths and visions. Whether at WPP or at Amazon, every project is an OpenDoor on new possibilities. Anything and everything can be an opportunity for our people to drive &lt;em&gt;impact&lt;/em&gt; – for them to innovate, learn, thrive, and occasionally fail too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The unique OpenDoor partnership model is built to deliver next level Productivity, fueled by our industry-leading approach to People, Platforms, and Process. OpenDoor spans across all WPP agencies and disciplines such as media, business consultancy, communications and brand strategy, tech and commerce, public relations, and production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenDoor’s values are built from Amazon’s own &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.amazon.jobs/content/en/our-workplace/leadership-principles&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;16 Leadership Principles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and WPP’s core values of Open, Optimistic and Extraordinary. Together, when WPP’s Creative Transformation meets Amazon’s next-level customer centricity, our people come together to challenge and impact what’s done today and build a better future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining OpenDoor, not only are you joining a cross-function team partnering with one of WPP’s top five global clients, but you are also taking a step to challenge yourself and the world around you every day, working in the most unusual way on some of Earth’s most ambitious opportunities in marketing, tech, media, business, and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are searching for a talented and enthusiastic individual to join our OpenDoor team as a Director. This is a full-time contract position covering a parental leave based in London. The role is across CDS, the Consumer Devices and Services business which include LOBs such as the innovative new satellite broadband launch, Leo, and includes Alexa, Kindle, Fire, Ring and others. It’s growing significantly, with high profile lines of business for Amazon, and provides a huge growth opportunity for OpenDoor. CDS operates with a real start-up mentality and there is strong platform for innovation and acceleration. This role will mainly focus on Alexa+ /Echo, Kindle and Fire TV. Alexa+ is the exciting AI assistant for Amazon and has ambitious plans for regional roll-out and to become the connected thread across all Amazon Devices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the client for the output from the agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will understand all the elements of a client’s business and how we can support their growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have a full knowledge of the overall plan and be there to support the internal teams and clients as they require in its delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will ensure teams collaborate and always champion unrivalled work for our clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have strong commercial knowledge and ensure all financial interactions with the client (PO’s etc.) are smooth and accurate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will stretch yourself beyond the safe and be a part of agency growth through new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive vision collaboration and alignment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the active voice of the client in the agency, working with all specialists in the matrix to ensure the team deliver against the brief and with the agreed scope of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Always be looking to make our latest delivery better than the last, challenging the norm and the same – through collaborating across the agency and being aware of latest developments within OpenDoor and the client’s category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spot and convert opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a full understanding of the SOW for every client and understand how OpenDoor can add value through the engagement of specialist services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the core client KPIs and always look for opportunities for OpenDoor to support and deliver against them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial and operational excellence:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have full knowledge of all deliverables within a SOW and profitability of the client within this.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have full oversight of all financial elements of the client relationship and work quickly to resolve problems – seeking support as required to resolve quickly and accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong working relationship with the agency’s commercial team and an appreciation of financial data sensitivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full control and responsibility for accurate forecasting - meeting all internal deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to New Business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an active participant in new business pitches, stretching yourself outside your comfort zone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take responsibility for smaller scale pitches and use your experience to help develop appropriate operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Client Leadership experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will understand how an agency operates, its positioning and product offerings and how it works with clients, alongside an understanding of how your client’s business, or category, operates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Problem solving&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have an ability to solve problems, sometimes tackling them proactively before they become an issue, creating a feedback loop to ensure no further issues in the future.&amp;nbsp; You will know how to harvest insight from data that can be beneficial to a client’s business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building and maintaining stakeholder relationships&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be a trusted adviser for senior marketeers within client organisations, understand how and when to engage core specialisms across OpenDoor, collaborate more widely with partner agencies and industry partners, whilst taking responsibility for your client’s overall experience during their time at OpenDoor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effective communication&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have an ability to deliver information and opinions succinctly to garner support, considering, and being sympathetic, to the views of those around you, adapting your communication style accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
