&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your job is to make sure every payout and transaction lands with the right person.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have spent years getting very good at protecting the things a marketplace has always had to protect: checkout fraud, account takeover, courier abuse. But we are no longer only a marketplace. We now issue banking products, lend to merchants, move instant payouts to couriers, and collect cash on the doorstep. Every one of those is a new way for money to leave the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a new team, and it owns that surface: fraud wherever money moves through the platform. Who receives it, who lends it, who collects it, and who holds it in a financial account. Think instant payout rails, merchant cash advances, and platform-issued banking and earned-wage products serving millions of couriers and merchants. These are live loss surfaces, and the volume grows with every financial product we launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are now looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer (Golang)&lt;/strong&gt; to build that protection. You will design and ship real-time detection and automated enforcement for our financial products across DoorDash, Wolt, and Deliveroo. The work is high-throughput, low-latency, and unusually consequential: a rule you ship on Monday can stop a serious loss by Friday. It is also close to greenfield, so you will be setting the patterns every future financial product inherits on day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt; as one of the founding engineering roles in our London hub, working closely with our teams in Helsinki and Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain high-throughput, low-latency backend services in Go that score financial events in real time, including payout enrollments, bank account links, credit applications, and account-to-account transfers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design fraud detection and automated enforcement for our financial products end to end: from signal collection through to the decision that blocks a fraudulent payout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build on and extend our shared fraud decisioning platform, so signals, rules, and models work across all three of our brands instead of being rebuilt three times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with risk analysts, data scientists, and product managers to turn observed fraud patterns into shipped detection, and to know when a rule, a model, or a product change is the right answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across team boundaries with our account security, payments fraud, and financial product teams. We build on their signals rather than rebuild them, so clean interfaces matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to architectural discussions and technical decisions as we establish the fraud infrastructure baseline for financial products, with support from senior engineers on the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write well-tested, observable code and help the team hold a high quality bar. In fraud, a silent failure is a loss event.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our expectations:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 6 years of professional software engineering experience, including backend services you have shipped and owned in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of production experience in Golang, or strong experience in another backend language and real enthusiasm for picking Go up quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A working understanding of low-latency, high-throughput distributed systems. Real-time decisioning comes with a latency budget, and you are keen to learn to build inside one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with SQL and/or NoSQL databases, and some exposure to event-driven architectures (Kafka or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to operate what you build, including a share of on-call, with a pragmatic approach to reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses AI tooling in day-to-day development and can critically evaluate its output for correctness and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fraud, risk, payments, lending, or financial crime, especially money movement fraud, bank account linking fraud, payout abuse, or lending fraud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with rules engines, real-time feature stores, or ML model serving in a decisioning path.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in Kotlin, Java, Python, or Node.js alongside Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud infrastructure (AWS, GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple brands, regions, or regulatory regimes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product-oriented mindset. You think beyond the ticket, understand the &quot;why&quot; behind the work, and take a high level of responsibility for outcomes rather than output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity. This is a new team on a new surface; parts of the charter are still being drawn, and you will help draw them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of owning a project or feature end to end, especially in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and proactive communication, with a collaborative spirit. We work across three companies and several time zones, so we move fast, but we succeed together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An adversarial instinct. The best fraud engineers enjoy thinking like the attacker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;À propos du poste&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) Head of Integrated Marketing France pour rejoindre notre équipe Marketing France, basée à Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rattaché(e) à la Head of Marketing France, vous piloterez l&#39;une des trois équipes Marketing du marché français et managerez une équipe de 3 personnes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre mission : être le point de connexion entre la stratégie Global et son exécution sur le marché France, en fédérant l&#39;ensemble des parties prenantes autour d&#39;une vision marketing claire, cadrée et exécutée dans les temps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;À la croisée de la stratégie, de l&#39;orchestration et de l&#39;exécution, vous porterez la vision marketing France auprès du Global et des instances exécutives locales, tout en veillant à ce que chaque campagne — globale ou locale — soit livrée avec excellence et dans les délais. Vous piloterez également le programme de fidélité en France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Vos missions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et porter la vision stratégique marketing France, en s&#39;appuyant sur une compréhension fine de la stratégie Global et en assurant sa traduction pertinente sur le marché français (spécificités locales : créa, moments de consommation, culture...).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Être l&#39;interlocuteur constructif du Global : savoir s&#39;intégrer dans une stratégie globale tout en la challengeant de façon argumentée lorsque les spécificités françaises le nécessitent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fédérer l&#39;ensemble des pôles (Sales, Brand &amp;amp; Media, Creative, CRM, Analytics, Global...) pour s&#39;assurer que chacun travaille vers les mêmes objectifs et dans le même calendrier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter et sécuriser le calendrier de livraison des campagnes (globales et locales) : brief à temps, validation des plans média, validation brand, etc., pour garantir une exécution sans accroc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplifier et cadrer des sujets complexes impliquant de multiples parties prenantes, en faisant émerger les décisions à prendre et en portant les recommandations qui en découlent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formaliser et présenter la vision et la performance marketing France à un niveau exécutif, avec clarté et impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter le programme de fidélité en France, en garantissant sa cohérence avec la stratégie marketing globale et les priorités business locales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intégrer l&#39;IA dans les méthodes de travail de l&#39;équipe, pour gagner en efficacité et en qualité d&#39;exécution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manager et développer une équipe de 3 personnes, en apportant vision, coaching, structure et exigence d&#39;exécution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Le profil recherché&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous êtes un(e) leader marketing structuré(e), reconnu(e) pour votre capacité à simplifier des sujets complexes multi-stakeholders et à faire en sorte que les choses avancent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous apportez notamment :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 ans et plus d&#39;expérience en marketing, avec une expérience significative dans des environnements matriciels et multi-marchés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une capacité avérée à travailler à l&#39;interface du Global et du Local, en sachant à la fois s&#39;aligner sur une stratégie globale et la challenger de façon constructive quand nécessaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un leadership naturel pour fédérer, cadrer et orchestrer des sujets impliquant de nombreuses parties prenantes, sans lien hiérarchique direct sur la plupart d&#39;entre elles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une forte capacité de formalisation et de communication, notamment pour porter une vision ou une recommandation devant un public exécutif.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une orientation PMO marquée : rigueur, sens du détail, capacité à garder le contrôle sur des plannings complexes et à faire respecter les délais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une appétence pour l&#39;IA et son intégration dans les méthodes de travail marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience réussie en management et dans le développement de talents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une maîtrise courante du français et de l&#39;anglais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Les compétences qui feront votre réussite&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership et fédération d&#39;équipes transverses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplification et cadrage de sujets complexes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sens de l&#39;organisation et rigueur (PMO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à challenger de façon constructive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication et formalisation à niveau exécutif&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestion de projet et respect des délais&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appétence pour l&#39;IA et les nouveaux outils&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management et développement de talents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance du média (brand et performance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orientation business, à l&#39;aise avec la data et le reporting chiffré&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Airship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship is trusted by world’s leading brands such as Alaska Airlines, BBC and The Home Depot to drive revenue growth and customer loyalty with exceptional cross-channel customer experiences. Today, brands are challenged to deliver seamless, unified customer experiences across a fragmented array of channels and devices— apps, websites, email, SMS, wallets and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship’s no-code, AI-powered platform was designed with non-technical, growth-focused teams in mind, making it easy to create, test and orchestrate hyper-personalized experiences across all channels. With the ability to easily enrich customer data and rapidly launch growth experiments, Airship enables brands to deliver consistent, meaningful interactions that accelerate conversion and foster deeper customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invite you to be part of our journey in building products and delivering services that touch millions of customers around the world every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about us, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airship.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.airship.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727358600004000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3xEidfNT5kaSMR1LbqH2tz&quot;&gt;www.airship.com&lt;/a&gt;, read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airship.com/blog/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.airship.com/blog/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727358600004000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2S7rp6uesS3WbpmG9CFOaR&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt; or follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/airship-social&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/airship-social&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727358600004000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2T3DnwhcK_pt63jzkrYdK6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Backend Java Engineer, you will design, develop, and support distributed systems that&amp;nbsp;combine scale with high reliability. You will work on low-latency services that process&amp;nbsp;continuous event streams and support analytical workloads across terabytes of data.&amp;nbsp;Our backend infrastructure runs on Google Cloud Platform. It uses Java-based microservices&amp;nbsp;and SQL and NoSQL databases. You will join a core engineering team that shapes Airship’s&amp;nbsp;technical foundations and engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design data schemas and take ownership of data semantics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain, improve, and scale Java APIs and distributed services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate performance issues using server metrics, application data, and system&amp;nbsp;behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the reliability, testability, and maintainability of our backend systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and engineering teams on technical design and implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define technical standards across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and own large-scale releases and technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI as a technical assistant to draft development plans and investigate problems or&amp;nbsp;bugs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critically assess AI-generated suggestions for accuracy, security, and suitability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duties and responsibilities described are not comprehensive. Additional tasks may be&amp;nbsp;assigned, or the role’s scope may change based on business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least three years of experience designing, operating, and maintaining distributed&amp;nbsp;systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in spoken and written French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Java development skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with unit testing, code reviews, documentation, and Git-based version&amp;nbsp;control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading significant releases or technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with continuous integration and continuous delivery practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and pragmatic approach to software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to building reliable, maintainable, and testable systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We&#39;d Be Delighted If You Also Have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience troubleshooting and improving JVM performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Google Cloud Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of distributed NoSQL databases or key-value stores&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Linux administration fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Work Location &amp;amp; Travel Requirements&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship’s ‘Digital First’ approach to work means that for the majority of our roles, work can be performed remotely, either some or most of the time. Airship believes that flexible work contributes to a more productive and more equitable work environment, and that Airshippers are able to collaborate, innovate, and support one another across different locations and timezones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some roles may require that employees perform their work from a specific location to support business activities, and/or be within proximity to an Airship office location or customer or partner locations, while other roles can be performed 100% remotely.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is &lt;strong&gt;fully remote&lt;/strong&gt; and may require &lt;strong&gt;up to 10%&lt;/strong&gt; travel based on business needs or as requested by your manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Compensation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starting pay may vary based on factors such as relevant skills, work experience, market demands, and location. All offers include stock options so employees have the opportunity to benefit from Airship’s success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance options for you and your dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible time off, paid holidays, paid parental leave, and paid volunteer time off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for your overall wellbeing with employer-subsidized mental health and employee wellness programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A digital-first work environment and a monthly stipend to support remote work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship and growth opportunities to build skills and accelerate professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;AI in Recruiting&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use artificial intelligence tools in our recruitment process as decision-support tools only. Airship&#39;s People Operations team reviews all AI-generated scores and recommendations before making any hiring determination. No applicant is rejected solely on the basis of an AI-generated output.&amp;nbsp;Depending on your location, you may have the right to request human review of any AI-assisted employment decision or to opt out of AI evaluation. To make a request or learn more about how we use AI in hiring, contact &lt;a ----- ----- or visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://airship.com/legal&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;airship.com/legal&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;View our EU and UK Candidate Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airship.com/legal/eu-and-uk-candidate-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**&lt;strong&gt;Please Note:&lt;/strong&gt; To ensure the security of your personal information, Airship will only contact candidates through email addresses ending with ----- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Hiring Commitment&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship is committed to fostering a diverse work environment and providing equal employment opportunities to all applicants and employees. We welcome your application and our hiring and employment decisions are made irrespective of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status or any other characteristic protected by law. In alignment with our commitment to equal opportunity, Airship will consider for employment all qualified applicants, including those with criminal histories, in a way that adheres to the principles of fairness and the requirements of local Fair Chance laws, where applicable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;By submitting this application, I affirm that the facts set forth in it are true and complete to the best of my knowledge. I understand that if I am employed, false statements, omissions, or misleading information given in my application, interview(s), or in a background check may result in dismissal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;In a rapidly evolving world, trust in AI depends on AI agents being grounded in fresh, verified real-world data. Search is the foundation that makes this possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We are building an agent-native search platform designed specifically for AI systems rather than human users. Our product provides programmatic, low-latency, and observable search APIs that AI agents use to retrieve, filter, and reason over real-world information at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Staff Software Engineer to work on the runtime systems of a novel search engine tailored for agentic AI consumption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;In this role, you will focus on building low-latency, high-throughput systems that serve search queries in real time. You will work on the critical path of user-facing requests, where performance, predictability, and efficiency directly impact product quality. You will design and operate systems that handle thousands of requests per second under strict latency budgets, optimising every layer from request handling to data access and response assembly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, your responsibility will be to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Design, implement, and operate core runtime services for serving search queries at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build and optimise request flows, including query processing, retrieval orchestration, and response assembly under strict latency budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop systems that maintain performance and predictability under high load&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Optimise CPU, memory, and data access patterns in performance-critical paths&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ensure reliability, observability, and predictability across production services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build well-tested systems with clear responsibilities and interaction contracts, while remaining flexible as architecture evolves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Define and implement observability primitives, including structured logs, metrics, traces, and latency breakdowns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Monitor throughput, latency, and resource usage, and drive improvements in performance and cost efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Collaborate with indexing and ML teams to integrate retrieval and ranking components, keeping ML logic decoupled from core system internals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Support experimentation and iteration through controlled rollouts and rigorous benchmarking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Have 8+ years of experience as a software engineer working on production backend systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Have strong hands-on expertise in C++ or Rust in real-world, high-load services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Have built and operated high-load, low-latency user-facing systems handling thousands of RPS under strict latency constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Understand performance at a systems level — CPU, memory, networking, and data access&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Have operated your own code in production: deployed it, debugged incidents, and rolled back changes when necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Think end-to-end about request flows rather than staying within isolated components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Can balance correctness, latency, and development velocity, making pragmatic tradeoffs when scope or time requires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Collaborate effectively across engineering, ML, and product teams, communicating clearly in cross-functional settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates may also have experience with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;DBMS internals (open source or SaaS) and cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;High-load web applications or large-scale APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Performance-critical systems such as trading platforms or real-time data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Low-level performance tuning and hardware-level optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Open-source contributions or active involvement in the engineering community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Competitive programming or CTF participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;SHAD or similar advanced technical programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Conference talks or technical publications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We conduct coding interviews as part of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

